if type(P) ~= "table" then return end

P.guides["forever/40-50/shendralas"] = {
	["East through the valley to the strange crystal on its pedestal: clicking it starts {quest:92914}. The Decrepit Pylon Protectors (levels 42-43) around it are the mana elementals that guard it. Corpsefeeders (level 45, elite) roam the valley east of here.\nCareful: click the crystal from the road on its west side and move on: the Protectors stand two and three together east and north-east of it, where Corpsefeeders and the Magram Necrokhans (elites, 45) walk too."] = "向東穿過山谷，前往台座上那顆奇怪的水晶：點擊它開始{quest:92914}。周圍的{npc:252711}（42-43級）是守護它的法力元素。食屍者（45級，精英）在這裡東邊的山谷遊蕩。\n小心：從水晶西側的道路上點擊它，然後繼續走：守護者兩三隻一群站在它的東邊和東北邊，食屍者和{npc:253274}（精英，45級）也在那裡走動。",
	["New in Forever: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.\nThe Outcast Necromancers and the Magram Necromancers of the valley drop a {quest:93644} whose writer lives in {zone:2652}: players got it within a few kills. Take it from the Outcast Necromancers and leave the Magram alone: the Magram centaurs leave you be until you attack, but once you have killed Magram the whole clan turns on you, and their Necrokhans (level 45, elites) stand around the western pylon you repair later.\nThe Gelkis and Magram centaurs have {area:2657} quest chains of their own, worth about 20,000 to 30,000 more experience, but each chain asks for Honored with its clan. The two clans are rivals, so work for one of them: the Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation guide, under Reputation, shows how."] = "Forever新內容：若有步驟錯誤，請在Polestar的Discord或GitHub告訴我們，並註明是哪個步驟。\n山谷裡的{npc:11559}和{npc:253272}會掉落{quest:93644}，寫它的人住在{zone:2652}：玩家通常殺幾隻就拿到。從{npc:11559}身上拿，別碰瑪格拉姆：瑪格拉姆半人馬在你動手前不會理你，但只要殺過瑪格拉姆，整個氏族都會與你為敵，而牠們的死靈可汗（45級，精英）就站在你之後要修復的西側水晶塔周圍。\n吉爾吉斯和瑪格拉姆半人馬在{area:2657}各有自己的任務鏈，大約多給20,000到30,000經驗，但每條任務鏈都要求該氏族的聲望達到尊敬。兩個氏族互相敵對，所以只能替其中一方效力：「聲望」底下的吉爾吉斯與瑪格拉姆半人馬聲望指南有說明。",
	["North up the road to the first pylon, gathering mana from the Unstable Mana Rifts on the way. Stop where the arrow points, on the road just south of the pylon, keeping to its west edge: the quiet side, with no Protectors behind you. Pull one {npc:252711} at a time down to that spot, the one nearest the pylon's south side first, and kill it there; then step up to the pylon's west side and use {spell:1289727}, as players did to repair it.\nCareful: stay off the pylon's east and north-east side. The Protectors stand there two and three together, a Corpsefeeder (level 45, elite) walks among them and the Magram Necrokhans (elites, 45) stand just beyond: nearly every recorded death at this pylon happened east of it. If the Magram attack you (they do once you have killed Magram), wait at the arrow until any Necrokhan by the pylon walks off before you pull. Nascent Pylon Protectors (elites, 43) wander the road south of it: let them pass.\nIf you die here, walk your ghost back to the arrow before you come back to life: players who rose beside the pylon died again within seconds."] = "沿道路往北前往第一座水晶塔，沿途從{npc:264149}收集法力。在箭頭指的地方停下，就在水晶塔南邊的道路上，靠它的西緣：那一側比較安靜，背後沒有守護者。一次拉一隻{npc:252711}到那個位置，先拉離水晶塔南側最近的那隻，在那裡殺掉；然後走到水晶塔西側使用{spell:1289727}，玩家就是這樣修好它的。\n小心：別靠近水晶塔的東側和東北側。守護者兩三隻一群站在那裡，一隻食屍者（45級，精英）在牠們之間走動，{npc:253274}（精英，45級）就站在更遠一點：這座水晶塔幾乎所有記錄到的死亡都發生在它東邊。如果瑪格拉姆會攻擊你（殺過瑪格拉姆就會），先在箭頭處等水晶塔旁的死靈可汗走開再拉怪。{npc:276401}（精英，43級）在它南邊的道路上遊蕩：讓牠們過去。\n如果你在這裡死了，先讓靈魂走回箭頭處再復活：在水晶塔旁邊復活的玩家幾秒內就又死了。",
	["Pull a single Protector down to the road, then repair the pylon from its west side."] = "只拉一隻守護者到道路上，然後從西側修復水晶塔。",
	["Take the {item:286647} to an {npc:264149} on the road north of the temple and throw it into the rift. The {npc:276401} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "把{item:286647}帶到神殿北邊道路上的{npc:264149}，丟進裂隙裡。{npc:276401}是精英：建議組隊。",
	["The road south of the western pylon"] = "西側水晶塔南邊的道路",
	["The western repair used up your crystals: on the way east, use the {item:255662} on the Unstable Mana Rifts again for four more Coalesced Mana Crystals."] = "修西側時水晶已經用完了：往東的路上，再對{npc:264149}使用{item:255662}，多拿四個{item:255667}。",
	["The {item:255656} lies at the western edge of the village; Magram Guardians (levels 39-41) watch over it. They leave you be unless you have fought the Magram: pick the fragment up without a fight. Every Magram you kill turns the clan against you, and back in the valley that means the Necrokhans (level 45, elites) at the western pylon as well."] = "{item:255656}在村莊西緣，由{npc:255560}（39-41級）看守。除非你和瑪格拉姆打過，否則他們不會理你：不用戰鬥，直接撿起碎片。每殺一個瑪格拉姆都會讓整個氏族與你為敵，回到山谷後，西側水晶塔旁的死靈可汗（45級，精英）也一樣。",
	["Unstable Mana Rifts: mana for the eastern pylon"] = "{npc:264149}：東側水晶塔要用的法力",
	["Unstable Mana Rifts: mana for the western pylon"] = "{npc:264149}：西側水晶塔要用的法力",
	["Use the west face of the western pylon, where you repaired it. Approach on the road from the south and pull one {npc:252711} back to you. Wait for the elite patrols to pass; do not follow a Protector around the east side."] = "到西側水晶塔的西面，也就是你修復它的地方。從南邊沿道路接近，拉一隻{npc:252711}回到你身邊。等精英巡邏走過去；別跟著守護者繞到東側。",
	["Use the {item:255662} on the Unstable Mana Rifts, the floating sparks along the road north: each pylon takes four Coalesced Mana Crystals, and the repair uses them up."] = "對{npc:264149}（北邊道路沿途漂浮的火花）使用{item:255662}：每座水晶塔要四個{item:255667}，修復時會用掉。",
	["the road just south of the western pylon"] = "西側水晶塔正南邊的道路",
	["{item:255667}, from the Unstable Mana Rifts with the {item:255662}"] = "{item:255667}，用{item:255662}從{npc:264149}取得",
	["{npc:252711}, pulled to the arrow's spot, then {spell:1289727} on the pylon's west side"] = "{npc:252711}，拉到箭頭的位置，然後在水晶塔西側使用{spell:1289727}",
	["{zone:2652} is done. Ride back north through the {area:2657} and west along {area:405}'s southern edge to {area:2408} and fly to {area:1637}: the next guide picks up there, with the {zone:1444} guide's hand-ins. Keep your hearthstone (bound at {area:1099}): the next guide uses it to get from {area:1637} back to {area:1099}."] = "{zone:2652}完成了。往北騎回{area:2657}，再沿{area:405}南緣向西到{area:2408}，飛往{area:1637}：下一份指南從那裡接著走，包括繳交{zone:1444}指南的任務。爐石先別用（綁在{area:1099}）：下一份指南會用它從{area:1637}回到{area:1099}。",
}

P.guides["forever/50-60/mount-hyjal"] = {
	["A group choice at your level: the {npc:260148} that answers {quest:92591}'s bone pile is level 59-60."] = "在你這個等級要看有沒有隊伍：{quest:92591}的骨堆叫出來的{npc:260148}是59-60級。",
	["A group choice at your level: the {npc:260148} that answers {quest:92592}'s bone pile is level 59-60."] = "在你這個等級要看有沒有隊伍：{quest:92592}的骨堆叫出來的{npc:260148}是59-60級。",
	["A group choice below level 58: the {npc:260148} that answers the burnt bone pile is level 59-60. Grouping up is advised. The hand-in waits for the ride back to {area:16848} at the end of this guide."] = "不到58級要看有沒有隊伍：燒骨堆叫出來的{npc:260148}是59-60級。建議組隊。要等本指南最後騎回{area:16848}時才交。",
	["A group choice below level 58: the {npc:260148} that answers the burnt bone pile is level 59-60. Grouping up is advised. {npc:244511} takes the amulet on the ride back to {area:16848} at the end of this guide."] = "不到58級要看有沒有隊伍：燒骨堆叫出來的{npc:260148}是59-60級。建議組隊。本指南最後騎回{area:16848}時，{npc:244511}收護身符。",
	["A group choice below level 58: the {npc:260148} that answers the burnt bone pile is level 59-60. Grouping up is advised; alone, this guide comes back past the pile later."] = "不到58級要看有沒有隊伍：燒骨堆叫出來的{npc:260148}是59-60級。建議組隊；一個人的話，本指南之後會再經過骨堆。",
	["A group stop: the Blackthorne camps north-east of the Summit hold elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier (60) as often as the Cultists and Adepts, with {npc:260674} (60, elite) in the middle and Ghansurok (61, elite) on the ridge. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip these if you are alone."] = "組隊的一站：山頂東北方的黑棘營地裡，精英的先行者、祭司和一個信使（60級）跟教徒、侍僧一樣多，{npc:260674}（60級，精英）在中間，甘蘇洛克（61級，精英）在山脊上。建議組隊，找人和你一起做。獨自一人就跳過。",
	["Alchemy Workstation"] = "鍊金工作台",
	["Alliance: the amulet from the second pass goes to {npc:244517}: ride west across the foothills and north up the valley to {area:16848}, about four minutes, then back up to the Summit."] = "聯盟：第二趟拿到的護身符交給{npc:244517}：往西越過山腳丘陵、沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，大約四分鐘，然後回山頂。",
	["At the northern end of {area:16868}: something has dug up the grave. The Fleshflay Raveners around it carry what was taken."] = "在{area:16868}的北端：有東西把墳墓挖開了。周圍的{npc:249228}身上帶著被拿走的東西。",
	["Back to Osi, then the two elders at the back of the burrow. {npc:260661} stands beside Osi, {npc:256660} a little north-west of them, where the recording met him. {npc:260661}'s moss grows around {area:16848}, later in this guide; {npc:256660}'s amulets come from the harpies at the {area:16867}, also later in this guide, and you bring both back here then."] = "回去找歐西，然後找巢穴後面的兩位長老。{npc:260661}站在歐西旁邊，{npc:256660}在他們西北方一點、紀錄裡遇到他的地方。{npc:260661}要的苔蘚長在本指南稍後的{area:16848}周圍；{npc:256660}要的護身符來自本指南稍後{area:16867}的鷹身人，到時兩樣都帶回這裡。",
	["Back to {area:16848}"] = "回{area:16848}",
	["Back to {npc:264089}, then the ghostly {npc:255009} at {area:16868}'s western edge, where the recording met him, on your way west."] = "回去找{npc:264089}，然後往西的路上，找{area:16868}西緣那位鬼魂{npc:255009}（紀錄裡遇到他的地方）。",
	["Back up to the {area:16849}: {npc:260626}, at the ancients' outpost, flies there, and your Hearthstone is bound there."] = "回到{area:16849}：古樹前哨的{npc:260626}可以飛過去，你的爐石也綁在那裡。",
	["Back west to {npc:260626} at the ancients' outpost and fly to {area:493}. Druids: {spell:18960} is quicker. (No flight path to {area:493} yet? The road in is {area:1769}'s tunnel, from {zone:1452} or {zone:1448}.)"] = "往西回古樹前哨找{npc:260626}，飛往{area:493}。德魯伊：{spell:18960}比較快。（還沒有{area:493}的飛行路線？走進去的路是{area:1769}的隧道，從{zone:1452}或{zone:1448}進去。）",
	["Barkskin Burrow"] = "樹皮巢穴",
	["Bear berries"] = "熊莓",
	["Bones and stolen life"] = "骨頭和被奪走的生命",
	["Burn the bone pile at the south-eastern end of {area:16868} with the {item:274411}: the {npc:260148} that answers carries the amulet. The hand-in waits for the ride back to {area:16848} at the end of this guide.\nCareful: the {npc:260148} is level 59-60: burn the bone pile last, at full health, with the ruins around it cleared."] = "用{item:274411}燒掉{area:16868}東南端的骨堆：被叫出來的{npc:260148}身上有護身符。要等本指南最後騎回{area:16848}時才交。\n小心：{npc:260148}是59-60級：最後再燒骨堆，滿血、周圍的廢墟都清乾淨。",
	["Burn the bone pile at the south-eastern end of {area:16868} with the {item:274411}: the {npc:260148} that answers carries the amulet.\nCareful: the {npc:260148} is level 59-60: burn the bone pile last, at full health, with the ruins around it cleared."] = "用{item:274411}燒掉{area:16868}東南端的骨堆：被叫出來的{npc:260148}身上有護身符。\n小心：{npc:260148}是59-60級：最後再燒骨堆，滿血、周圍的廢墟都清乾淨。",
	["Deadwood Den Guardians"] = "{npc:252063}",
	["Disease Workstation"] = "疾病工作台",
	["East across the Cradle to {npc:268168}."] = "往東越過寧靜搖籃找{npc:268168}。",
	["East across the foothills to the Hermit's Abode."] = "往東越過山腳丘陵回隱士居所。",
	["East from the Cradle towards the {area:16867}, where the Wormwing harpies nest: a corrupted growth on the shrine's western slope starts a quest for {npc:260825}."] = "從寧靜搖籃往東，朝蟲翼鷹身人築巢的{area:16867}走：聖壇西坡上的一團腐化的增生物會開始一個給{npc:260825}的任務。",
	["East past {area:16868} into the {area:17145}: {npc:255683}, the great cat, waits by the path, and {npc:267109} rests in the ruins just south of her."] = "往東經過{area:16868}進入{area:17145}：大貓{npc:255683}在小路旁等你，{npc:267109}在她南邊不遠的廢墟裡休息。",
	["East up to the {area:16849}, the druids' camp. {npc:41861}, the flight master, stands at its north end; {npc:264795}, {npc:243855} and {npc:254915} along the path south; {npc:40833} indoors next to Thisalee; {npc:243815}, the innkeeper, at the south-east end."] = "往東爬上德魯伊營地{area:16849}。飛行管理員{npc:41861}站在北端；{npc:264795}、{npc:243855}和{npc:254915}在往南的小路旁；{npc:40833}在室內希莎莉旁邊；旅店老闆{npc:243815}在東南端。",
	["Fel-slime crystals"] = "魔化軟泥水晶",
	["Fenwick's survival pack"] = "芬威克的求生包",
	["Fill {npc:267109}'s gourd at the falls beside the bridge. {npc:255685}, one of {npc:255683}'s kittens, plays just west of the falls: walk up to her."] = "在橋旁的瀑布裝滿{npc:267109}的葫蘆。{npc:255683}的小貓之一{npc:255685}就在瀑布西邊不遠玩：走到她旁邊。",
	["Finish the slime ooze"] = "把軟泥收集完",
	["Fly down to {npc:260626} for {npc:249235} and {npc:256222}."] = "飛下去找{npc:260626}，為了{npc:249235}和{npc:256222}。",
	["Fly to the {area:16853}"] = "飛往{area:16853}",
	["Fly to {area:493}"] = "飛往{area:493}",
	["Fly to {area:493} from {area:2255}'s flight master. No flight path to {area:493} yet? The way in is the tunnel through {area:1769}, at the western end of {zone:1452}."] = "從{area:2255}的飛行管理員飛往{area:493}。還沒有{area:493}的飛行路線？進去的路是{zone:1452}西端穿過{area:1769}的隧道。",
	["For {npc:13220} in {zone:1451}, on the next guide: keep it"] = "給下一份指南{zone:1451}的{npc:13220}：先留著",
	["Four workstations stand in the Ashen camp: throw a pinecone at each, from the south up."] = "灰燼營地裡有四座工作台：從南往北，對每一座丟一個松果。",
	["Foxes"] = "狐狸",
	["His pack fell just north of the tree. Open it, then wait half a minute while its safety lock discharges before you open it again."] = "他的包掉在樹的北邊不遠。打開它，然後等半分鐘讓安全鎖放電完，再打開一次。",
	["Horde: ride west across the foothills and north up the valley to {area:16848}, about four minutes, for {npc:265788}'s flags, {npc:244511}'s amulet and his war paint wrap, then back up to the Summit."] = "部落：往西越過山腳丘陵、沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，大約四分鐘，交{npc:265788}的旗子、{npc:244511}的護身符和他的戰紋布，然後回山頂。",
	["Indoors at the Summit, next to {npc:254915}."] = "在山頂的室內，{npc:254915}旁邊。",
	["Inside the burrow: {npc:256646} at the far end."] = "在巢穴裡面：{npc:256646}在最裡面。",
	["Into the burrow for the elders, {npc:260661} and {npc:256660}."] = "進巢穴找兩位長老{npc:260661}和{npc:256660}。",
	["Into {area:16866}, north of the Cradle: the ruins of a Horde base, now held by demons. {npc:263406} and {npc:249052} camp at its western edge; {npc:267121}, a blademaster, waits a little east of them. Doomguards (elites, levels 58-59) walk among the demons: pull carefully."] = "進入寧靜搖籃北邊的{area:16866}：一座部落基地的廢墟，現在被惡魔佔據。{npc:263406}和{npc:249052}在它西緣紮營；劍聖{npc:267121}在他們東邊一點等你。末日守衛（精英，58-59級）在惡魔之間走動：小心拉怪。",
	["Into {area:616}"] = "進入{area:616}",
	["New in Forever: this guide follows what players did on {area:616}. If a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.\n{area:616} lies south of {zone:1452}. Fly to {area:2255} (from Theramore on the Alliance route; the Horde route already ends there), bind your Hearthstone at the inn (partway through this guide {npc:256222} sends you to {area:493}, and the way there starts in {area:2255}), then ride south down the road through {area:2249} and on through {area:2256}, which leads up into {area:616}.\nCareful: elites stand along the whole way in. Frostmaul Giants and Preservers (59-60) flank the road through {area:2249}, and Hederine Slayers, Initiates and Manastalkers (57-58) line {area:2256} from its mouth to the zone line, with {npc:10201} (61) on its east side. Follow the arrows' line at full speed, never stop or fight on the way, and don't turn off it."] = "Forever新內容：本指南依照玩家在{area:616}的實際流程編寫。若有步驟錯誤，請在Polestar的Discord或GitHub告訴我們，並註明是哪個步驟。\n{area:616}位於{zone:1452}南方。飛到{area:2255}（聯盟路線從塞拉摩飛；部落路線本來就停在那裡），在旅店綁定爐石（本指南中途{npc:256222}會要你去{area:493}，而去那裡的路從{area:2255}出發），然後沿道路往南穿過{area:2249}，再穿過{area:2256}，就會往上進入{area:616}。\n小心：一路上都有精英。{npc:7428}和保護者（59-60級）站在穿過{area:2249}的道路兩旁，{npc:7463}、初心者和法力潛獵者（57-58級）從{area:2256}入口一直排到地區交界，{npc:10201}（61級）在它東側。照箭頭的路線全速前進，路上別停也別打，不要轉離路線。",
	["North from {npc:260626} to the workshop, crate first. Watch for Ghansurok, the elite chimaera (level 61) that prowls around the workshop."] = "從{npc:260626}往北到工作坊，先送箱子。留意精英奇美拉甘蘇洛克（61級），牠在工作坊周圍徘徊。",
	["North into the shrub field: the {npc:248395} drop the leaves, and the Scarlet Dart Tubers grow in the open ground, most of them in the field's western half. Keep clear of {quest:91923} and {npc:248709}, the field's elites."] = "往北進灌木田：{npc:248395}會掉葉子，{item:267289}長在空地上，大多在田的西半部。離田裡的精英{quest:91923}和{npc:248709}遠一點。",
	["North into {area:2361}: {npc:11802} stands in the north-east of the village, upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "往北進{area:2361}：{npc:11802}在村子東北部他那棟建築的樓上：從裡面走上去，箭頭分不清樓層。",
	["North to the old bridge over the Cradle: touch the crow effigy on it and {npc:267158}, the crow wild god, appears."] = "往北到橫跨寧靜搖籃的舊橋：摸一下橋上的烏鴉雕像，烏鴉荒野之神{npc:267158}就會出現。",
	["North to the workshop. Turn the two gears and connect the two battery terminals on both sides of her glaive thrower. Ghansurok, the elite chimaera (level 61), prowls around the workshop: watch for him while you work."] = "往北到工作坊。轉動兩個齒輪，接上她的戰刃投擲器兩側的兩個電池接頭。精英奇美拉甘蘇洛克（61級）在工作坊周圍徘徊：做的時候留意他。",
	["North to {npc:249234} and his crates. Drive the skunks out from behind the crates without attacking them."] = "往北找{npc:249234}和他的箱子。把箱子後面的臭鼬趕出來，不要攻擊牠們。",
	["North to {npc:255683}, then {npc:267109} in the ruins south of her."] = "往北找{npc:255683}，再找她南邊廢墟裡的{npc:267109}。",
	["North to {npc:263757}, a demon caged in the middle of the scar. He stood at the spot marked here every time he was met in the recording, south of where the quest data puts him."] = "往北到{npc:263757}，一個關在裂痕中間籠子裡的惡魔。紀錄裡每次遇到他都站在這裡標的位置，在任務資料寫的位置南邊。",
	["North up the valley to {area:16848}, where the Alliance outpost ({npc:244517}, {npc:249968}) and the Horde's ({npc:244511}, {npc:244512}) stand next to each other."] = "沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，聯盟的前哨（{npc:244517}、{npc:249968}）和部落的前哨（{npc:244511}、{npc:244512}）挨在一起。",
	["North up the valley to {area:16848}, where the Horde outpost ({npc:244511}, {npc:244512}, {npc:265788}) and the Alliance's stand next to each other."] = "沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，部落的前哨（{npc:244511}、{npc:244512}、{npc:265788}）和聯盟的前哨挨在一起。",
	["North-east across the Cradle to {npc:249234}'s camp at the edge of {area:16866}."] = "往東北越過寧靜搖籃，到{area:16866}邊緣{npc:249234}的營地。",
	["North-east back to {npc:267097}, in the corner of {area:16866} where {npc:263394} stands: the Defiling Hounds around him drop any spikes you still need.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps, and {npc:267439}, an elite (level 61), walks this corner: give them room."] = "往東北回{npc:267097}那裡，在{area:16866}{npc:263394}站的那個角落：他周圍的{npc:249230}會掉你還缺的尖刺。\n小心：{npc:249238}（60級，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的營地之間踏步，精英{npc:267439}（61級）在這個角落走動：離他們遠一點。",
	["North-east into the {area:17145}: {npc:267109} rests in the ruins south of {npc:255683}, on your way."] = "往東北進入{area:17145}：{npc:267109}在{npc:255683}南邊的廢墟裡休息，就在路上。",
	["North-east to {npc:263394}. Drain him first: use {npc:263406}'s eye on him, and only then fight him. Undrained, he and {npc:252457} are level 60 elites. {npc:267439}, an elite (level 61), walks this corner of {area:16866}: keep out of his way.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps: give them room."] = "往東北找{npc:263394}。先吸乾他：對他使用{npc:263406}的眼睛，然後才開打。沒吸乾的話，他和{npc:252457}都是60級精英。精英{npc:267439}（61級）在{area:16866}的這個角落走動：別擋到他的路。\n小心：{npc:249238}（60級，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的營地之間踏步：離牠們遠一點。",
	["North-east to {npc:267097} at the northern ruins of {area:16866}: take {quest:97009} so the Defiling Hounds drop their spikes while you work the other errands here.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps, and {npc:267439}, an elite (level 61), walks this corner: give them room."] = "往東北到{area:16866}北邊廢墟的{npc:267097}：接{quest:97009}，這樣你做這裡其他任務時，{npc:249230}就會掉尖刺。\n小心：{npc:249238}（60級，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的營地之間踏步，精英{npc:267439}（61級）在這個角落走動：離他們遠一點。",
	["North-east up the slope from the veteran, north of {area:16868}: {npc:244512}'s silphium grows in the meadows there, where the Horde players in our recordings picked it. Then ride west to {area:16848}.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over these slopes: keep out of their way."] = "從老兵那裡往東北爬上{area:16868}北邊的山坡：{npc:244512}要的串葉松香草長在那裡的草地上，我們紀錄裡的部落玩家都在那裡採。然後往西騎到{area:16848}。\n小心：{npc:249226}（61級，稀有精英）在這些山坡上空飄蕩：別擋到牠們的路。",
	["North-west over the shrub field to {npc:249235}'s workshop on the slope above it. {quest:91923}, an elite (level 57), patrols the field, and {npc:248709}, an elite ancient (level 56), stands in its middle: give both room. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), prowls around the workshop itself: see where he is before you ride up to {npc:249235}."] = "往西北越過灌木田，到田上方山坡上{npc:249235}的工作坊。精英{quest:91923}（57級）在田裡巡邏，精英古樹{npc:248709}（56級）站在田中間：兩個都離遠一點。精英奇美拉甘蘇洛克（61級）在工作坊周圍徘徊：騎上去找{npc:249235}之前先看看他在哪。",
	["North-west to Barkskin Burrow, the furbolgs' den in the hillside: {npc:256978} waits just north of its mouth. The Barkskin furbolgs show as hostile until your standing with them improves, but none of them attacked in the recording: the Deadwood furbolgs in the camps around are the ones to fight. {npc:256978} offers more only once this first quest is handed in."] = "往西北到樹皮巢穴，山坡上熊怪的窩：{npc:256978}就在洞口北邊等你。樹皮熊怪在你跟他們的聲望提升前會顯示為敵對，但紀錄裡沒有一隻攻擊過人：要打的是周圍營地的死木熊怪。{npc:256978}要等這第一個任務交了才會給更多任務。",
	["On to the old bridge over the Cradle: touch the crow effigy on it and {npc:267158} appears again."] = "繼續到橫跨寧靜搖籃的舊橋：摸一下橋上的烏鴉雕像，{npc:267158}會再出現。",
	["Owl feathers"] = "貓頭鷹羽毛",
	["Predatory stags"] = "掠食的雄鹿",
	["Prickly pinecones"] = "多刺的松果",
	["Seeds and owl eggs"] = "種子和貓頭鷹蛋",
	["Slime Workstation"] = "軟泥工作台",
	["Slime ooze as you go"] = "順路收集軟泥",
	["Soil and venison"] = "土壤和鹿肉",
	["South to {area:493}'s flight master (the Alliance's at the southern end of the valley, the Horde's at its south-western end) and fly to {area:2255} for {npc:249235}'s parts order."] = "往南到{area:493}的飛行管理員（聯盟的在山谷南端，部落的在西南端），飛往{area:2255}拿{npc:249235}訂的零件。",
	["South to {npc:267113}, another wild god, at {area:16868}'s eastern edge."] = "往南找另一位荒野之神{npc:267113}，在{area:16868}東緣。",
	["South-east across {area:16866} to {npc:259695}, the wild god, indoors at its south-eastern edge."] = "往東南越過{area:16866}，找荒野之神{npc:259695}，在它東南緣的室內。",
	["South-east back to the Hermit's Abode."] = "往東南回隱士居所。",
	["South-east to the Hermit's Abode with what the wild gods and Omnuron gave you."] = "帶著荒野之神和奧姆努隆給你的東西，往東南回隱士居所。",
	["South-east to the Hermit's Abode."] = "往東南到隱士居所。",
	["South-east to {npc:259695}."] = "往東南找{npc:259695}。",
	["South-east to {npc:264089} on the slope above {area:16868}."] = "往東南到{area:16868}上方山坡上的{npc:264089}。",
	["South-west back towards Barkskin Burrow: the Deadwood camps on the slopes east of the burrow hold the Totemics and Fel-Tenders. An elite named {quest:92446} (level 60) may roam the camps' eastern end."] = "往西南回樹皮巢穴的方向：巢穴東邊山坡上的死木營地有圖騰師和魔化照料者。一隻叫{quest:92446}的精英（60級）可能在營地東端遊蕩。",
	["South-west to {npc:216289}, the ancient. Talk to him again when you are ready and watch what he shows you."] = "往西南找古樹{npc:216289}。準備好時再跟他說一次話，看他給你看的東西。",
	["South-west to {npc:263426}, in the middle of {area:16866}: drain him with the eye first, as {npc:263394}, then kill him. Undrained, he is a level 60 elite.\nCareful: Doomguards (elites, 58-59) stand around him: pull him out to you."] = "往西南找{area:16866}中間的{npc:263426}：跟{npc:263394}一樣先用眼睛吸乾他，再殺他。沒吸乾的話，他是60級精英。\n小心：他周圍站著末日守衛（精英，58-59級）：把他拉出來打。",
	["Still under 58 after the second pass through {area:16868}? Abandon {quest:92591}: the route doesn't come back for it."] = "第二次經過{area:16868}後還不到58級？放棄{quest:92591}：路線不會再回來做它。",
	["Still under 58 after the second pass through {area:16868}? Abandon {quest:92592}: the route doesn't come back for it."] = "第二次經過{area:16868}後還不到58級？放棄{quest:92592}：路線不會再回來做它。",
	["The Ashen Acolytes hold the camp at the north of the scar. Not every Acolyte carries notes: keep killing them after the twelve kills until you have all twelve notes.\nCareful: Awakened Fel Ash Slimes (58, elite) ooze about the scar: pull the Acolytes away from them."] = "{npc:260422}佔據裂痕北邊的營地。不是每個侍僧都帶著筆記：殺滿十二隻後繼續殺，直到十二份筆記都拿到。\n小心：{npc:264306}（58級，精英）在裂痕裡蠕動：把侍僧拉離牠們。",
	["The Ashen camp"] = "灰燼營地",
	["The Ashen workstations"] = "灰燼的工作台",
	["The Blackthorne camps"] = "黑棘營地",
	["The Blackthorne cultists camp on the slopes north-east of the Summit (level 60, with elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier among them: pull carefully). {npc:260674}, an elite (level 60) who leads them, stands among them: leave him be. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), also roams the ridge north of the camps.\nThe Cultists carry the kris and the Adepts the staff; the thorn seeds lie in the woods there, and the hippogryphs and chimaeras roam the slopes all around. Not finished in our recordings yet: if something here is off, tell us."] = "黑棘教徒在山頂東北方的山坡上紮營（60級，中間有精英的先行者、祭司和一個信使：小心拉怪）。帶領他們的精英{npc:260674}（60級）站在他們之間：別惹他。精英奇美拉甘蘇洛克（61級）也在營地北邊的山脊遊蕩。\n教徒身上有短劍、侍僧身上有法杖；荊棘種子在那裡的樹林裡，角鷹獸和奇美拉在周圍的山坡到處遊蕩。我們的紀錄還沒做完這段：這裡有不對的地方請告訴我們。",
	["The Blackthorne cultists camp on the slopes north-east of the Summit (level 60, with elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier among them: pull carefully). {npc:260674}, an elite (level 60) who leads them, stands among them: leave him be. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), also roams the ridge north of the camps.\nUse {npc:40833}'s staff on a Pact member to strip its ward, then kill it, ten times: pick Cultists and Adepts, whom Thisalee wants dead too. The Cultists carry the kris and the Adepts the staff; the thorn seeds lie in the woods there, and the hippogryphs and chimaeras roam the slopes all around. Not finished in our recordings yet: if something here is off, tell us."] = "黑棘教徒在山頂東北方的山坡上紮營（60級，中間有精英的先行者、祭司和一個信使：小心拉怪）。帶領他們的精英{npc:260674}（60級）站在他們之間：別惹他。精英奇美拉甘蘇洛克（61級）也在營地北邊的山脊遊蕩。\n對誓約成員使用{npc:40833}的法杖拆掉牠的護盾，再殺掉，共十次：挑教徒和侍僧打，希莎莉也要他們死。教徒身上有短劍、侍僧身上有法杖；荊棘種子在那裡的樹林裡，角鷹獸和奇美拉在周圍的山坡到處遊蕩。我們的紀錄還沒做完這段：這裡有不對的地方請告訴我們。",
	["The Crow is just south of the pristine crystal."] = "烏鴉就在完美水晶的南邊不遠。",
	["The Deadwood camps"] = "死木營地",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs camp on the slopes north and east of {npc:256978}: kill their Den Guardians."] = "死木熊怪在{npc:256978}北邊和東邊的山坡上紮營：殺牠們的巢穴守衛。",
	["The Hyjal Owls roost on the slopes between {npc:264089} and Barkskin Burrow: their feathers are for {area:16848}.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over the western slopes: give them a wide berth.\nCareful: Grimroot, an elite treant (level 60), walks the slopes beside {npc:264089}. He leaves you alone unless you hit him: don't, and pull the owls away from his path."] = "{npc:249053}棲息在{npc:264089}和樹皮巢穴之間的山坡上：牠們的羽毛是給{area:16848}的。\n小心：{npc:249226}（61級，稀有精英）在西邊的山坡上飄蕩：離牠們遠遠的。\n小心：精英樹人格林魯特（60級）在{npc:264089}旁邊的山坡上走動。你不打他他就不會理你：別打他，把貓頭鷹拉離他走的路線。",
	["The Noxious Slimes crawl all over the scar's southern half, and not every one leaves ooze: kill the ones you pass from here on.\nCareful: Awakened Fel Ash Slimes (elites, 58) ooze among the slimes: leave them be."] = "{npc:243509}爬滿裂痕的南半部，不是每隻都會留下軟泥：從這裡開始，經過的都殺。\n小心：{npc:264306}（精英，58級）在軟泥怪之間蠕動：別惹牠們。",
	["The Predatory Hyjal Stags roam the same meadows, east of {npc:255693}.\nCareful: Spectral Frostwyrms (61, elites) circle over the western meadows: keep out from under them."] = "{npc:256809}在同一片草地上遊蕩，在{npc:255693}東邊。\n小心：{npc:255691}（61級，精英）在西邊的草地上空盤旋：別待在牠們下面。",
	["The Rustleaf Foxes are thick in the woods around {npc:249234}'s camp.\nCareful: {npc:255183} (61, rare) walks the woods north of the camp, and a {npc:256830} (60, rare) can turn up there too: leave them be."] = "{npc:249234}營地周圍的樹林裡到處都是鏽葉狐狸。\n小心：{npc:255183}（61級，稀有）在營地北邊的樹林裡走動，那裡也可能出現{npc:256830}（60級，稀有）：別惹他們。",
	["The Scourge hold the ruins of {area:16868}, east of {area:16848}: Fleshflay Raveners and Forgotten Soldiers everywhere, Eternal Sentries among them.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over {area:16868}: keep out of their way.\nCareful: Grimroot, the elite treant (level 60), walks the slopes on the way in. He leaves you alone unless you hit him: give him room."] = "天譴軍佔據{area:16848}東邊的{area:16868}廢墟：到處都是{npc:249228}和{npc:249247}，中間還有永恆哨兵。\n小心：{npc:249226}（61級，稀有精英）在{area:16868}上空飄蕩：別擋到牠們的路。\n小心：精英樹人格林魯特（60級）在進去路上的山坡走動。你不打他他就不會理你：離他遠一點。",
	["The Summit's Blackthorne quests"] = "山頂的黑棘任務",
	["The Wormwing harpies nest on the slopes north-west of the shrine. They drop the pinfeathers and {npc:256660}'s amulets; the bangles lie in their nests, the {object:650219} in a nest on the western slope, and {npc:260826}, who has Omnuron's spear, is among them. The corrupted knots grow on the trees just north-west of the shrine."] = "蟲翼鷹身人在聖壇西北方的山坡上築巢。牠們會掉細羽和{npc:256660}要的護身符；手鐲在牠們的巢裡，地平線之寶在西坡上的一個巢裡，帶著奧姆努隆長矛的{npc:260826}也在牠們之間。腐化樹瘤長在聖壇西北方不遠的樹上。",
	["The ancients' outpost"] = "古樹前哨",
	["The bear berries grow on the slopes around the burrow: a few on the hill north of {npc:256978}, most of them east of the burrow.\nCareful: Grimroot, an elite treant (level 60), walks the slopes west of the burrow, around 16-20,58-66: give him room."] = "熊莓長在巢穴周圍的山坡上：{npc:256978}北邊的山丘上有幾顆，大部分在巢穴東邊。\n小心：精英樹人格林魯特（60級）在巢穴西邊約16-20,58-66的山坡上走動：離他遠一點。",
	["The bone pile"] = "骨堆",
	["The bone pile wakes the {npc:264306}, an elite (level 58) that hits hard: grouping up is advised."] = "骨堆會喚醒{npc:264306}，一隻打很痛的精英（58級）：建議組隊。",
	["The burnt buildings"] = "燒毀的建築",
	["The burnt buildings stand in the meadows east of {npc:255693}: the nails and brackets lie among the rubble."] = "燒毀的建築在{npc:255693}東邊的草地上：釘子和支架散落在瓦礫裡。",
	["The cog lies by the path south-west of the camp, on your way to {npc:256222}."] = "齒輪在營地西南方的小路旁，就在你去找{npc:256222}的路上。",
	["The crystals grow in the scar west and south of {npc:263757}. The pristine one turned up at the scar's southern end, close to the {npc:257753}, at the spot marked."] = "水晶長在{npc:263757}西邊和南邊的裂痕裡。完美的那顆出現在裂痕南端，靠近{npc:257753}，就在標的位置。",
	["The falls and the first kitten"] = "瀑布和第一隻小貓",
	["The harpy grounds"] = "鷹身人的地盤",
	["The last kitten, {npc:255771}, plays at the southern end of {area:16868}."] = "最後一隻小貓{npc:255771}在{area:16868}南端玩。",
	["The moss for {npc:260661} grows around {area:16848}: by the outposts and on the slopes north of them."] = "給{npc:260661}的苔蘚長在{area:16848}周圍：前哨旁邊和它們北邊的山坡上。",
	["The mouth of {area:2256}"] = "{area:2256}的入口",
	["The overlook"] = "瞭望點",
	["The pinecones lie under the healthy trees just south of the bone pile, on the scar's south-western rim, and a few east of the Crow."] = "松果在骨堆南邊不遠、裂痕西南緣那些健康的樹下，烏鴉東邊也有幾個。",
	["The road in"] = "進去的路",
	["The road through {area:2249}"] = "穿過{area:2249}的道路",
	["The seeds and the owl eggs lie on the slopes between the Hermit's Abode and the road you came in on: search north-east up towards {npc:266803} and {npc:266802}."] = "種子和貓頭鷹蛋散落在隱士居所和你進來那條路之間的山坡上：往東北朝{npc:266803}和{npc:266802}的方向找。",
	["The shrine is a pair of standing stones west of the Hermit's Abode, on the way back to the outpost: bury the remains there."] = "聖壇是隱士居所西邊的一對立石，在回前哨的路上：把遺骸埋在那裡。",
	["The shrub field"] = "灌木田",
	["The slimes are thickest in the scar's south-western corner."] = "裂痕西南角的軟泥怪最多。",
	["The sun-bleached bones lie all over {area:16868}; the Fleshflay Raveners there carry the drop of stolen life.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over {area:16868}: keep out of their way. Spectral Frostwyrms (61, elites) circle over the meadows around it: keep out from under them."] = "曬白的骨頭散落在整個{area:16868}；那裡的{npc:249228}身上帶著那滴被奪走的生命。\n小心：{npc:249226}（61級，稀有精英）在{area:16868}上空飄蕩：別擋到牠們的路。{npc:255691}（61級，精英）在周圍的草地上空盤旋：別待在牠們下面。",
	["The three warlocks and {npc:260440} are in and around the Ashen camp at the north of the scar.\nCareful: Awakened Fel Ash Slimes (58, elite) ooze about the scar: keep clear of them."] = "三個術士和{npc:260440}在裂痕北邊的灰燼營地裡外。\n小心：{npc:264306}（58級，精英）在裂痕裡蠕動：離牠們遠一點。",
	["The three wrecks"] = "三個殘骸",
	["The three wrecks {npc:256222} named lie at the east end of the fields: use the {item:269944} beside each, the catapult and the flying machine first, then the ballista a little north of them."] = "{npc:256222}說的三個殘骸在田野東端：在每一個旁邊使用{item:269944}，先投石車和飛行器，然後是它們北邊一點的弩砲。",
	["The two outposts of {area:16848}."] = "{area:16848}的兩座前哨。",
	["The untainted soil lies in the fields south and east of the outpost; Hyjal Stags graze there too, and their venison is for {npc:256222}'s stew.\nCareful: {npc:248709} (56), an elite treant, walks the fields to the south-east around 60,78: give him room."] = "未受污染的土壤在前哨南邊和東邊的田野裡；{npc:248041}也在那裡吃草，牠們的鹿肉是給{npc:256222}燉湯用的。\n小心：精英樹人{npc:248709}（56級）在東南方約60,78的田野走動：離他遠一點。",
	["The warlocks"] = "術士們",
	["The worker {npc:244517} means is a peasant just north of her; {npc:264521} stands between them."] = "{npc:244517}說的工人是她北邊不遠的一個農民；{npc:264521}站在他們中間。",
	["The {area:16849}"] = "{area:16849}",
	["The {area:16867}"] = "{area:16867}",
	["The {npc:257753}"] = "{npc:257753}",
	["Turn west here"] = "在這裡轉往西",
	["Up to the {area:16849}"] = "上到{area:16849}",
	["Vessel Workstation"] = "容器工作台",
	["West across the Cradle to {npc:255693}, another of the wild gods."] = "往西越過寧靜搖籃找另一位荒野之神{npc:255693}。",
	["West across the foothills, past the ancients' outpost, to the {npc:257753} at the southern end of {area:17050}."] = "往西越過山腳丘陵，經過古樹前哨，到{area:17050}南端的{npc:257753}。",
	["West across the slope from the scar: {npc:278305} waits alone."] = "從裂痕往西越過山坡：{npc:278305}獨自在那裡等你。",
	["West along the southern slopes to {area:17144}: {npc:249549}, a gnome test pilot, hangs tangled up in a tree. A sturdy branch lies just south of him."] = "沿南邊的山坡往西到{area:17144}：地精試飛員{npc:249549}纏在一棵樹上。他南邊不遠有一根結實的樹枝。",
	["West of the outpost to {area:17050}: the {npc:257753} perches at its southern end."] = "從前哨往西到{area:17050}：{npc:257753}停在它的南端。",
	["West to the Alliance outpost."] = "往西到聯盟的前哨。",
	["West to the Horde outpost: {npc:244511}, then {npc:244512} and {npc:265788} beside him."] = "往西到部落的前哨：先找{npc:244511}，再找他旁邊的{npc:244512}和{npc:265788}。",
	["West to the bone pile by the slime pools: throw the warlocks' bones on it, then hand the quest in at the pile itself. Handing it in wakes the {npc:264306}, an elite (level 58) that hits hard: unless you are grouped for it, hand in and ride clear at once."] = "往西到軟泥池旁的骨堆：把術士的骨頭丟上去，然後就在骨堆那裡交任務。交任務會喚醒{npc:264306}，一隻打很痛的精英（58級）：除非你組好隊要打牠，交完馬上騎走。",
	["West to the outpost."] = "往西到前哨。",
	["West to the overlook above the valley: the veteran's old scabbard lies there. Hand his quest in at the scabbard and take the next from it, then use the scabbard in your bags to call his spirit and listen to his story."] = "往西到山谷上方的瞭望點：老兵的舊劍鞘在那裡。在劍鞘那裡交他的任務、接下一個，然後使用背包裡的劍鞘叫出他的靈魂，聽他說故事。",
	["Work west back through {area:16866}: the Felguard Sentinels and Defiling Hounds are everywhere, the hounds carry the essence, and the Horde base's rubble (wire, scrap and dung) lies all over it. Light the two bonfires on your way, scout the Horde tower in the middle, take Azgalor's ashes west of the tower, and pick up the abandoned supplies, a few just north-west of {npc:259695} and the rest in the western half: {npc:259695}'s tuft of fur, used on a demon, distracts it while you take them.\nHorde: the demons here also drop the Scraps of Horde Heraldry for {npc:265788}, the old {item:253249} stands in the camp north of the south bonfire, and the {object:656786} at the camp's eastern edge start {quest:96998}.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps: give them room. {npc:255183} (61, rare) walks the camp north of the south bonfire: keep away from her.\nCareful: Doomguards (elites, 58-59) stand among the demons, and {npc:267439} (elite, 61) walks the camp: pull the hounds and sentinels to you, away from them."] = "往西穿過{area:16866}回去：{npc:249229}和{npc:249230}到處都是，獵犬身上有精華，部落基地的碎料（電線、廢鐵和糞便）散落各處。順路點燃兩堆營火，偵察中間的部落塔，拿塔西邊阿茲加洛的骨灰，再撿被遺棄的補給，幾個在{npc:259695}西北方不遠，其餘在西半部：{npc:259695}的一撮毛用在惡魔身上能引開牠，讓你去拿。\n部落：這裡的惡魔也會掉{npc:265788}要的部落紋章碎片，舊的{item:253249}立在南邊營火北面的營地裡，營地東緣的食人妖遺骸會開始{quest:96998}。\n小心：{npc:249238}（60級，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的營地之間踏步：離牠們遠一點。{npc:255183}（61級，稀有）在南邊營火北面的營地走動：遠離她。\n小心：末日守衛（精英，58-59級）站在惡魔之間，{npc:267439}（精英，61級）在營地走動：把獵犬和哨兵拉到你這裡，遠離他們。",
	["deliver the crate before it fizzles"] = "在失效前送到箱子",
	["fill the gourd"] = "裝滿葫蘆",
	["plant the seed in his remains"] = "把種子種在他的殘骸裡",
	["put the poultice on {npc:248366}"] = "把藥膏敷在{npc:248366}身上",
	["remove the corrupted knots on the trees just north-west of the shrine, on your way"] = "順路清掉聖壇西北方不遠那些樹上的腐化樹瘤",
	["scout the Horde tower"] = "偵察部落塔",
	["{item:269944}: the {npc:262036}"] = "{item:269944}：{npc:262036}",
	["{item:269944}: the {npc:266886}"] = "{item:269944}：{npc:266886}",
	["{item:269944}: the {npc:266887}"] = "{item:269944}：{npc:266887}",
	["{npc:11118} is in {area:2255}'s inn. She has more mail for you in {zone:1452}, outside this guide."] = "{npc:11118}在{area:2255}的旅店。她在{zone:1452}還有你的信，不在本指南裡。",
	["{npc:11802} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:11802}站在他那棟建築的樓上：從裡面走上去，箭頭分不清樓層。",
	["{npc:216289}: ready to watch"] = "{npc:216289}：準備好觀看",
	["{npc:228216} stands between {area:2255}'s two flight masters. Her crate holds fragile cells that fizzle out in time and when knocked about: fly straight back to the {area:16853} and take it to {npc:249235} without detours or fights (about four minutes in the recording). If it fizzles out anyway, {npc:228216} fills it again."] = "{npc:228216}站在{area:2255}兩個飛行管理員之間。她的箱子裡裝著易碎的電池，時間久了或被碰撞就會失效：直接飛回{area:16853}，不要繞路也不要打怪，交給{npc:249235}（紀錄裡大約四分鐘）。真的失效了，{npc:228216}會再幫你裝滿。",
	["{npc:243815}: {quest:93197}: for {npc:11118} in {area:2255}, at the end"] = "{npc:243815}：{quest:93197}：給{area:2255}的{npc:11118}，最後才交",
	["{npc:244511}: for {npc:254915} at the Summit, next"] = "{npc:244511}：給山頂的{npc:254915}，接下來",
	["{npc:244511}: {quest:96999}, for {npc:3187} in {area:367}, {zone:1411}; take it only if you'll pass by"] = "{npc:244511}：{quest:96999}，給{zone:1411}{area:367}的{npc:3187}；只有會經過那裡才接",
	["{npc:244512}'s poultice is for two of the outpost's wounded: {npc:265895} lies at the north end of {area:16848}, {npc:265862} just south of {npc:244512}."] = "{npc:244512}的藥膏是給前哨的兩個傷兵：{npc:265895}躺在{area:16848}北端，{npc:265862}在{npc:244512}南邊不遠。",
	["{npc:244512}: {quest:96616}, on the way back from {area:16868}"] = "{npc:244512}：{quest:96616}，從{area:16868}回來的路上做",
	["{npc:244517}: for {npc:254915} at the Summit, next"] = "{npc:244517}：給山頂的{npc:254915}，接下來",
	["{npc:248709} is an elite corrupted ancient (level 56) in the middle of the shrub field, back east: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:248709}是一棵精英的腐化古樹（56級），在東邊灌木田的中間：建議組隊。",
	["{npc:248709} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:248709}是精英：建議組隊。",
	["{npc:249234}'s camp"] = "{npc:249234}的營地",
	["{npc:249235}'s workshop"] = "{npc:249235}的工作坊",
	["{npc:254131} and {npc:260825} stand together at the {area:16867}."] = "{npc:254131}和{npc:260825}一起站在{area:16867}。",
	["{npc:254501}, above Fenwick's head"] = "{npc:254501}，在芬威克頭上",
	["{npc:254915}, at the Summit, for {npc:263406}'s message."] = "山頂的{npc:254915}，傳{npc:263406}的話。",
	["{npc:254915}, next to {npc:40833} at the Summit."] = "山頂的{npc:254915}，在{npc:40833}旁邊。",
	["{npc:255683} and {npc:267109}"] = "{npc:255683}和{npc:267109}",
	["{npc:255773}, the second kitten, plays just west of {npc:249234}'s camp."] = "第二隻小貓{npc:255773}在{npc:249234}營地西邊不遠玩。",
	["{npc:256222}'s shrine"] = "{npc:256222}的聖壇",
	["{npc:256222}, the hermit, lives at the Hermit's Abode a little further south-west. He takes the cog too."] = "隱士{npc:256222}住在再往西南一點的隱士居所。齒輪也交給他。",
	["{npc:260626}, the flight mistress"] = "飛行管理員{npc:260626}",
	["{npc:263406}, {npc:249052} and {npc:267121}"] = "{npc:263406}、{npc:249052}和{npc:267121}",
	["{npc:263757}: decide his fate"] = "{npc:263757}：決定他的命運",
	["{npc:264089} and the veteran"] = "{npc:264089}和老兵",
	["{npc:264521} and {npc:244517}"] = "{npc:264521}和{npc:244517}",
	["{npc:265788}: {quest:91794}: the flag and the heraldry are in {area:16866}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{npc:265788}：{quest:91794}：旗子和紋章在本指南稍後的{area:16866}；先留著",
	["{npc:265895} and {npc:265862}"] = "{npc:265895}和{npc:265862}",
	["{npc:266803} (Alliance) and {npc:266802} (Horde) wait together by the road a little inside the zone."] = "{npc:266803}（聯盟）和{npc:266802}（部落）一起在進入地區不遠的路旁等你。",
	["{npc:41861} flies you to {area:2255}."] = "{npc:41861}載你飛到{area:2255}。",
	["{npc:41861}, at the flight point"] = "{npc:41861}，在飛行點",
	["{object:656786}: {quest:96998}, for {npc:244511} in {area:16848}; keep it"] = "食人妖遺骸：{quest:96998}，給{area:16848}的{npc:244511}；先留著",
	["{quest:1123}'s house stands in {area:2361}, a short walk from {npc:11802}: hand her the letter from {zone:1457} on the way to the flight master."] = "{quest:1123}的家在{area:2361}，離{npc:11802}走幾步路：去找飛行管理員的路上，把{zone:1457}的信交給她。",
	["{quest:91688}: for {npc:254915}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{quest:91688}：給本指南稍後的{npc:254915}；先留著",
	["{quest:91881}: for {npc:244511} in {area:16848}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{quest:91881}：給本指南稍後{area:16848}的{npc:244511}；先留著",
	["{quest:91881}: for {npc:244517} in {area:16848}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{quest:91881}：給本指南稍後{area:16848}的{npc:244517}；先留著",
	["{quest:91923} is elite (level 57) and patrols the shrub field: grouping up is advised."] = "{quest:91923}是精英（57級），在灌木田裡巡邏：建議組隊。",
	["{quest:91923} is elite: grouping up is advised. He walks the shrub field."] = "{quest:91923}是精英：建議組隊。他在灌木田裡走動。",
	["{quest:92008}: for {npc:228216} in {area:2255}; you go there from {area:493} at the end of this guide"] = "{quest:92008}：給{area:2255}的{npc:228216}；本指南最後你會從{area:493}去那裡",
	["{quest:92011}: in {area:16866}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{quest:92011}：在本指南稍後的{area:16866}；先留著",
	["{quest:92171}: for {npc:254131}, later in this guide"] = "{quest:92171}：給本指南稍後的{npc:254131}",
	["{quest:92317}: for {npc:256222}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{quest:92317}：給本指南稍後的{npc:256222}；先留著",
	["{quest:92335}: for {npc:256222}, later in this guide"] = "{quest:92335}：給本指南稍後的{npc:256222}",
	["{quest:92446} is elite (level 60 in our data): grouping up is advised. Put {npc:244511}'s rabbit carcass down in the woods at the camps' eastern end, where the Horde players in our recordings fought him, and take his claws."] = "{quest:92446}是精英（我們資料裡是60級）：建議組隊。把{npc:244511}的兔子屍體放在營地東端的樹林裡（我們紀錄裡的部落玩家就在那裡打他），拿他的爪子。",
	["{quest:92446} is elite (level 60 in our data): grouping up is advised. {npc:244511}'s rabbit carcass lures him out in the woods by the Deadwood camps south-east of here, on part 3's way back to Barkskin Burrow; his claws come back here at the end of this guide."] = "{quest:92446}是精英（我們資料裡是60級）：建議組隊。{npc:244511}的兔子屍體會把他引到這裡東南方、死木營地旁的樹林裡，就在第3段回樹皮巢穴的路上；他的爪子在本指南最後拿回這裡。",
	["{quest:92446}'s claws"] = "{quest:92446}的爪子",
	["{quest:92500}: for {npc:256222}, later in this guide"] = "{quest:92500}：給本指南稍後的{npc:256222}",
	["{quest:92591}'s {npc:260148} is level 59-60: this guide burns its bone pile once you are 58, on one of its two passes through {area:16868}."] = "{quest:92591}的{npc:260148}是59-60級：本指南會在你58級後、兩次經過{area:16868}的其中一次燒掉它的骨堆。",
	["{quest:92591}, still not done"] = "{quest:92591}，還沒完成",
	["{quest:92592}'s {npc:260148} is level 59-60: this guide burns its bone pile once you are 58, on one of its two passes through {area:16868}."] = "{quest:92592}的{npc:260148}是59-60級：本指南會在你58級後、兩次經過{area:16868}的其中一次燒掉它的骨堆。",
	["{quest:92592}, still not done"] = "{quest:92592}，還沒完成",
	["{quest:93773}: for {npc:256222}"] = "{quest:93773}：給{npc:256222}",
	["{quest:93826}: on your way back here later; keep it"] = "{quest:93826}：之後回這裡的路上做；先留著",
	["{quest:94832}: {npc:2329} at the Lion's Pride Inn in {area:87}; take it only if you'll pass by"] = "{quest:94832}：{area:87}獅王之傲旅店的{npc:2329}；只有會經過那裡才接",
	["{quest:96025}: for {npc:254915} at the Summit"] = "{quest:96025}：給山頂的{npc:254915}",
	["{quest:96145}: for {npc:260825}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{quest:96145}：給本指南稍後的{npc:260825}；先留著",
	["{quest:96796}: for {npc:249235}, on the way"] = "{quest:96796}：給{npc:249235}，順路",
	["{quest:96830}: for {npc:244512} in {area:16848}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{quest:96830}：給本指南稍後{area:16848}的{npc:244512}；先留著",
	["{quest:96833}: for {npc:256222}, the hermit"] = "{quest:96833}：給隱士{npc:256222}",
	["{quest:96930}: for the {npc:257753}, later in this guide"] = "{quest:96930}：給本指南稍後的{npc:257753}",
	["{quest:96931}: for the {area:17145}, later in this guide"] = "{quest:96931}：給本指南稍後的{area:17145}",
	["{quest:96964}: for {npc:259695} in {area:16866}, just ahead"] = "{quest:96964}：給前面不遠{area:16866}的{npc:259695}",
	["{quest:96991}: for {npc:264795} at the {area:16849}, later in this guide"] = "{quest:96991}：給本指南稍後{area:16849}的{npc:264795}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/03-darkshore"] = {
	["North along the hills. {npc:3650} waits in the ruins of {quest:954}; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. {quest:1001} stands by the road north-north-west of {npc:3650}; a {quest:4723} lies on the shore on the way to him."] = "沿丘陵往北。{npc:3650}在{quest:954}的廢墟裡等你；{npc:2190}和{npc:2189}佈滿廢墟，{npc:2212}在東緣。{quest:1001}在{npc:3650}北北西方的路旁；去找他的路上，海岸有一隻{quest:4723}。",
	["North from the falls to the shore: the {quest:4727} lies on the beach there, for {npc:10219} in {area:442}."] = "從瀑布往北到海岸：{quest:4727}就躺在那裡的沙灘上，給{area:442}的{npc:10219}。",
	["{item:12237} from the Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers on this shore, if you still need them"] = "還需要的話，從這片海岸的{npc:2235}和{npc:2233}身上拿{item:12237}",
	["{npc:3649}: {npc:1646}'s reply, if you brought it (Night Elves, from Night Elf Darkshore's {zone:1453} walk)"] = "{npc:3649}：{npc:1646}的回信，如果你有帶來（夜精靈，在夜精靈黑海岸指南走{zone:1453}那一趟拿的）",
	["{npc:3657}, beside {npc:3693}"] = "{npc:3657}，在{npc:3693}旁邊",
	["{npc:3657}, beside {npc:3693} and {npc:3701}"] = "{npc:3657}，在{npc:3693}和{npc:3701}旁邊",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/03-darkshore-return"] = {
	["{npc:8997}, a short walk west of {npc:3693}: Argos's message from {zone:1453}"] = "{npc:8997}，在{npc:3693}西邊走幾步路：{zone:1453}阿茍斯的口信",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/03-loch-modan"] = {
	["No Defias Brotherhood from Wiley (it starts with {npc:234}'s letter in {zone:1436}): skip {zone:1436}. North along the road from {area:87} to {zone:1453}: {npc:466} sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate. Then the gryphons in the {object:2096}, back to {area:69}.\nIf {npc:466} isn't at the arrow, he is walking his horse along the {area:1617} nearby: look along the avenue or wait a moment."] = "黑衣威利那邊沒有「迪菲亞兄弟會」任務（它從{zone:1436}{npc:234}的信開始）：跳過{zone:1436}。從{area:87}沿道路往北到{zone:1453}：{npc:466}騎在馬上，在正門外那座橋的另一頭。然後到{object:2096}搭獅鷲回{area:69}。\n{npc:466}不在箭頭處的話，他正牽著馬在附近的{area:1617}走：沿著大道找，或等一下。",
	["On the way to the harbour: {npc:4984}'s message goes to {npc:8997} in {area:442}, beside Terenthis, where the boat lands."] = "去港口的路上：{npc:4984}的口信要交給{area:442}的{npc:8997}，在特倫希斯旁邊，就是船停靠的地方。",
	["{item:253247}: raise it beside Ylva, then hold the spot until {npc:269185} comes"] = "{item:253247}：在伊爾娃旁邊豎起來，然後守住那裡直到{npc:269185}出現",
	["{npc:332} is upstairs in the SI:7 building in {object:2100}: the stairs are hard to see at first. {npc:466} sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate, then back to the gryphons in the {object:2096}.\nIf {npc:466} isn't at the arrow, he is walking his horse along the {area:1617} nearby: look along the avenue or wait a moment."] = "{npc:332}在{object:2100}軍情七處建築的樓上：樓梯一開始不容易看到。{npc:466}騎在馬上，在正門外那座橋的另一頭，然後回{object:2096}搭獅鷲。\n{npc:466}不在箭頭處的話，他正牽著馬在附近的{area:1617}走：沿著大道找，或等一下。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains"] = {
	["Next: the gryphon to {area:42} for {zone:1431}'s second loop (the {zone:1431} guide)."] = "接下來：搭獅鷲到{area:42}做{zone:1431}的第二圈（{zone:1431}指南）。",
	["{npc:267}: {quest:66}, the footlocker in {zone:1436}'s {area:20}, at the west end of your next {zone:1431} loop (the {zone:1431} guide)"] = "{npc:267}：{quest:66}，那個小提箱在{zone:1436}的{area:20}，在你下一次{zone:1431}那一圈的西端（{zone:1431}指南）",
	["{npc:272}: the six legs from the {area:1097}"] = "{npc:272}：從{area:1097}拿六隻腳",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/05-duskwood"] = {
	["Every ghoul of the {area:492}'s northern half can drop a rib: Flesh Eaters and Bone Chewers (24-27) are the easier kills; Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters (27-29) drop them too. {npc:522}, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.\nCareful: A {npc:948} casts {spell:3428} as it dies, which brings extra adds.\nCareful: {npc:503} (31) and {npc:771} (32), both rares, haunt the cemetery's north and west, and {npc:1200} (32, elite) keeps to the house at its western edge: leave them be."] = "{area:492}北半部的每隻食屍鬼都可能掉肋骨：{npc:3}和{npc:210}（24-27級）比較好打；{npc:604}和{npc:570}（27-29級）也會掉。精英{npc:522}在墳墓間遊蕩：離他遠一點。\n小心：{npc:948}死的時候會施放{spell:3428}，會多叫出小怪。\n小心：稀有的{npc:503}（31級）和{npc:771}（32級）在墓地的北邊和西邊出沒，{npc:1200}（32級，精英）待在墓地西緣的房子裡：別惹他們。",
	["For {npc:1212} in {zone:1453}'s Cathedral, on the walk north"] = "給{zone:1453}大教堂的{npc:1212}，往北走的路上",
	["For {npc:1217} in {area:150} (the {zone:1437} guide)"] = "給{area:150}的{npc:1217}（{zone:1437}指南）",
	["From level 28: the Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders stand in the west part of the {area:492}, just east of {npc:311}'s camp.\nCareful: The Warders are 28-29 and the skeletons stand close together: pull one at a time.\nCareful: {npc:522}, an elite (35), wanders these graves too, and {npc:771} (32, rare) haunts the west part: keep away from both."] = "28級起：{npc:1110}、骷髏治療者和骷髏守衛站在{area:492}西部，就在{npc:311}營地東邊。\n小心：守衛是28-29級，骷髏站得很近：一次拉一隻。\n小心：精英{npc:522}（35級）也在這些墳墓間遊蕩，{npc:771}（32級，稀有）在西部出沒：兩個都離遠一點。",
	["Head north through Elwynn to {area:1519}; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in {object:2100}."] = "往北穿過艾爾文森林到{area:1519}；馬迪亞斯·肖爾在{object:2100}的軍情七處。",
	["North into {area:42}: {npc:276}'s house stands at the east end of town, on the way in."] = "往北進{area:42}：{npc:276}的房子在城鎮東端，就在進城的路上。",
	["On into {zone:1453}: {npc:1212} stands in the Cathedral of Light, on the way to the gryphon master. His next quest is for {npc:1217} in {area:150}, where the flight lands."] = "繼續進{zone:1453}：{npc:1212}站在聖光大教堂裡，在去獅鷲管理員的路上。他的下一個任務是給{area:150}的{npc:1217}，就在飛行降落的地方。",
	["On into {zone:1453}: {npc:297} (the arrow shows him) takes the letter; the {object:1561} beside him holds the next clue."] = "繼續進{zone:1453}：{npc:297}（箭頭會指他）收信；他旁邊的{object:1561}裡有下一個線索。",
	["On the way west to {npc:311}: Skeletal Fiends and Skeletal Horrors walk the cemetery's southern half, north of {area:94}. {npc:522}, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him."] = "往西找{npc:311}的路上：{npc:531}和{npc:202}在墓地南半部、{area:94}北邊走動。精英{npc:522}在墳墓間遊蕩：離他遠一點。",
	["Skeletal Raiders"] = "{npc:1110}",
	["The {npc:511} (26) hides in the small crypt by the {area:121}, south of {area:42}; the glass is inside."] = "{npc:511}（26級）躲在{area:42}南邊{area:121}旁的小地穴裡；鏡子就在裡面。",
	["{item:1946}: the {npc:511}, in the crypt of the cemetery just below"] = "{item:1946}：在正下方墓地地穴裡的{npc:511}",
	["{item:910}, from the {object:1560} upstairs"] = "{item:910}，樓上的{object:1560}裡",
	["{npc:1212}, in the Cathedral of Light"] = "{npc:1212}，在聖光大教堂",
	["{npc:264}: the Plague Spreaders, with {npc:289}'s ghouls on the next trip west"] = "{npc:264}：{npc:604}，下一趟往西時和{npc:289}的食屍鬼一起做",
	["{npc:267}: for {npc:295} in {area:87}, on the walk north to {zone:1453}"] = "{npc:267}：給{area:87}的{npc:295}，往北走去{zone:1453}的路上",
	["{npc:604}, for {quest:58}"] = "{npc:604}，給{quest:58}",
	["{object:1561}, beside him"] = "{object:1561}，在他旁邊",
	["{quest:177}: the ogres of Vul'Gol, on your {zone:1431} return"] = "{quest:177}：沃古爾的食人魔，你回{zone:1431}時做",
	["{quest:67}: west from {npc:311}'s camp over the border into {zone:1436} and on to {area:20}, where the {object:3643} stands among the Defias (15-18). Then hearth back to {area:42}."] = "{quest:67}：從{npc:311}的營地往西過邊界進{zone:1436}，再到{area:20}，{object:3643}就在迪菲亞的人（15-18級）之間。然後用爐石回{area:42}。",
	["{quest:68}: {npc:267}, in the town hall, takes the footlocker's contents."] = "{quest:68}：市政廳裡的{npc:267}收小提箱裡的東西。",
	["{quest:69}: {npc:295} is in {area:87}'s Lion's Pride Inn; the chest with the letter is upstairs."] = "{quest:69}：{npc:295}在{area:87}的獅王之傲旅店；有信的箱子在樓上。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/06-ashenvale"] = {
	["Back to {area:415} on the way to the west: {npc:3894} is inside the building beyond the inn."] = "往西去的路上回{area:415}：{npc:3894}在旅店後面那棟建築裡。",
	["For {npc:3649}, back in {area:442} (the {zone:1437} guide)"] = "給{area:442}的{npc:3649}（{zone:1437}指南）",
	["From the {area:418} head north-west to the {area:417} and go in from the east side: {npc:3664} and his guards hold a hill inside it. Pull his guards first."] = "從{area:418}往西北到{area:417}，從東側進去：{npc:3664}和他的守衛佔據裡面的一座小丘。先拉他的守衛。",
	["Hearth to {area:415}, where your hearthstone is bound, or follow the road east from the {area:414}: {npc:3845} stands by the flight master, {npc:3691} in the inn, {npc:3894} inside the building beyond it."] = "用爐石回{area:415}（你的爐石綁在那裡），或從{area:414}沿道路往東：{npc:3845}站在飛行管理員旁，{npc:3691}在旅店裡，{npc:3894}在旅店後面那棟建築裡。",
	["North again to the shore of {area:441}. Teronis lies among the Saltspittle murlocs; any murloc can drop the {item:5463}."] = "再往北到{area:441}岸邊。泰洛尼斯倒在鹽沫魚人之間；任何魚人都可能掉{item:5463}。",
	["North along the road to {area:467}: {npc:3994} stands by the flight master, {npc:16458} in the inn just west of them."] = "沿道路往北到{area:467}：{npc:3994}站在飛行管理員旁，{npc:16458}在他們西邊不遠的旅店裡。",
	["North from {area:421}, past {area:415}'s east side, to the Thistlefur camp: {npc:3987} leads the furbolgs there. Then south to {area:415}.\nCareful: Dal is level 25, and the furbolgs near him usually join in when he is pulled. Kill the ones along his path first so you fight him alone."] = "從{area:421}往北，經過{area:415}東側，到薊皮熊怪的營地：{npc:3987}帶領那裡的熊怪。然後往南回{area:415}。\n小心：達爾是25級，拉他時附近的熊怪通常會一起上。先殺掉他路線上的熊怪，再單獨打他。",
	["North of the {area:417}, {npc:3585} waits at the {area:416}."] = "在{area:417}北邊，{npc:3585}在{area:416}等你。",
	["North-east from the lake to {area:413}."] = "從湖往東北到{area:413}。",
	["North-west from {npc:1244}: the Mosshide Fenrunners and Trappers (22-24) along the river south-west of {area:309} drop flint, almost every one. Black, Crimson and Monstrous Oozes fill {area:309}, just west of the road to {area:205} and north of Einar's camp. Careful: Black and Crimson Oozes also drop {item:3349}. Pull those instead of fighting the larger Monstrous Oozes (25–26).\nCareful: Maddened Rotclaws (25-26) roam the {area:1025} around {npc:1244} and north of him: cross it to the river and don't hunt the flint there. Mosshide Brutes, Mystics and Alphas (24-27) hold the hills north-west of the Fenrunners' camp."] = "從{npc:1244}往西北：{area:309}西南方河邊的{npc:1010}和苔皮捕獸者（22-24級）幾乎每隻都會掉燧石。黑色、{npc:1031}和{npc:1033}佈滿{area:309}，就在往{area:205}的道路西邊、卡爾營地北邊。注意：黑色和{npc:1031}也會掉{item:3349}。打牠們，別打比較大的{npc:1033}（25-26級）。\n小心：{npc:271334}（25-26級）在{npc:1244}周圍和北邊的{area:1025}遊蕩：穿過那裡到河邊就好，別在那裡找燧石。{npc:1012}、苔皮祕法師和苔皮首領（24-27級）佔據沼澤奔行者營地西北方的丘陵。",
	["Pridewing Wyverns (21-22) and Consorts (22-23) nest on the slopes either side of the road, Skyhunters (23-24) a little further north-east. Any of them drops the venom sacs and the courier's supplies: start with the Consorts right beside the courier and work back along the road.\nCareful: {npc:5928}, a rare elite wyvern (27), flies over the Pridewing slopes and the road north: leave it alone."] = "{npc:4012}（21-22級）和傲翼配偶（22-23級）在道路兩側的山坡上築巢，天空獵手（23-24級）在再往東北一點。牠們都會掉毒囊和信使的補給：先打信使旁邊的配偶，再沿著道路往回打。\n小心：稀有精英雙足飛龍{npc:5928}（27級）在傲翼的山坡和往北的道路上空飛：別惹牠。",
	["South from {npc:3987}'s camp to {area:415}: {npc:3691} and {npc:3961} are in the inn, the flight master at the west end."] = "從{npc:3987}的營地往南回{area:415}：{npc:3691}和{npc:3961}在旅店裡，飛行管理員在西端。",
	["South-east from {area:415}, south of the road: the Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den at its north-west corner.\nCareful: The Den Watcher and the Ursas (24-25) stand together at the den: pull them one at a time."] = "從{area:415}往東南、道路南邊：腐木熊怪住在樹林裡。巢穴看守者和熊怪守護者守著西北角的巢穴。\n小心：巢穴看守者和熊怪守護者（24-25級）一起站在巢穴旁：一次拉一隻。",
	["South-east of the Foulweald, the {object:669176} lies in the grass: {npc:3961}, in {area:415}'s inn, takes it.\nCareful: two Shadethicket Bark Rippers (26-27) stand within a few steps of it: pull them one at a time before you pick it up."] = "在腐木林東南方，{object:669176}躺在草地上：{area:415}旅店裡的{npc:3961}收它。\n小心：兩隻{npc:3784}（26-27級）站在離它幾步的地方：撿之前先一次一隻拉掉。",
	["South-west from {area:415}: west of {area:421}, the stardust bushes grow among the ruins.\nCareful: Shadethicket Raincallers and Wood Shapers (22–24) stand among the bushes. Clear one bush at a time; don’t run through the camp."] = "從{area:415}往西南：在{area:421}西邊，星塵灌木長在廢墟之間。\n小心：{npc:3783}和木塑者（22-24級）站在灌木之間。一次清一叢；別直接衝過營地。",
	["The Pridewings"] = "傲翼雙足飛龍",
	["The road from {area:413} comes in by the flight master: {npc:3845} and {npc:4079} stand there, {npc:3996} just east of them, {npc:3691} in the inn, {npc:3894} inside the building beyond it."] = "從{area:413}來的路在飛行管理員旁進城：{npc:3845}和{npc:4079}站在那裡，{npc:3996}在他們東邊不遠，{npc:3691}在旅店裡，{npc:3894}在旅店後面那棟建築裡。",
	["The tram comes in at the {object:28027}; walk west to the {object:2098}: {npc:1646} stands at its east side. (The route hands his letter in at the end of the {zone:1432} guide; this is for a character still carrying it.)"] = "地鐵停在{object:28027}；往西走到{object:2098}：{npc:1646}站在它的東側。（路線在{zone:1432}指南最後才交他的信；這是給身上還帶著信的角色。）",
	["West from the {area:1076} along the road, past the Pridewing slopes: the courier waits by the road on their west side. His supplies drop from the Pridewings, and {npc:16458} at {area:467}, at the end of the road north, takes them."] = "從{area:1076}沿道路往西，經過傲翼雙足飛龍的山坡：信使在山坡西側的路旁等你。他的補給從傲翼雙足飛龍身上掉，道路北端{area:467}的{npc:16458}收。",
	["West from {area:413} to the coast, then north to the {area:414}. {npc:3846} camps on the beach; Wrathtail nagas fill the shore."] = "從{area:413}往西到海岸，再往北到{area:414}。{npc:3846}在海灘上紮營；怒尾納迦佈滿海岸。",
	["{area:467} flight master"] = "{area:467}的飛行管理員",
	["{item:2611}: the Mosshide Fenrunners and Trappers by the river"] = "{item:2611}：河邊的{npc:1010}和苔皮捕獸者",
	["{npc:1078}: the bigger raptors in the valley west of the dig are for your next {zone:1437} visit, at about 29"] = "{npc:1078}：挖掘場西邊山谷裡比較大的迅猛龍，留給你約29級下一次來{zone:1437}時",
	["{npc:1239}: a flagon of the inn's mead"] = "{npc:1239}：一壺旅店的蜂蜜酒",
	["{npc:1239}: the Cursed Crew is for your next {zone:1437} visit, at about 29"] = "{npc:1239}：「被詛咒的船員」留給你約29級下一次來{zone:1437}時",
	["{npc:16458}, in the inn"] = "{npc:16458}，在旅店裡",
	["{npc:3663}: its circles are for your next {zone:1440} visit, at about 30"] = "{npc:3663}：要淨化的法陣留給你約30級下一次來{zone:1440}時",
	["{npc:3691}: the Foulweald, after Stonetalon"] = "{npc:3691}：腐木林，石爪山之後",
	["{npc:3691}: {npc:3987}, north of town, at the end of this visit"] = "{npc:3691}：{npc:3987}，在城鎮北邊，這一趟最後",
	["{npc:3845} stands by the flight master where you land."] = "{npc:3845}站在你降落處的飛行管理員旁。",
	["{npc:3845}: the Pridewings, on the way north through Stonetalon"] = "{npc:3845}：傲翼雙足飛龍，往北穿過石爪山的路上",
	["{npc:3885} stands at the {area:420} on the east shore of {area:421}. Befouled Water Elementals (23-25) wade in the lake.\nCareful: {npc:12759}, a level 27 water elemental, walks the lake's west shore among them: leave it be."] = "{npc:3885}站在{area:421}東岸的{area:420}。{npc:3917}（23-25級）在湖裡涉水。\n小心：水元素{npc:12759}（27級）在牠們之間的湖西岸走動：別惹它。",
	["{npc:3996}: for {npc:3994} at {area:467}, at the end of the Stonetalon trip"] = "{npc:3996}：給石爪山之旅最後{area:467}的{npc:3994}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/06-wetlands"] = {
	["Alexston's reply, if you still carry it (the route hands it in on the {zone:1439} return's first {area:442} stop)"] = "亞歷克斯頓的回信，如果你身上還有（路線在回{zone:1439}第一次停{area:442}時交）",
	["Back down the road to {area:205}: {npc:1075} wants the {object:147516} explosives under the far end of the span destroyed. Keep to the camp's east side, away from Modr (32, elite) in the ruins."] = "沿道路回{area:205}：{npc:1075}要你炸掉橋另一頭下面的{object:147516}炸藥。待在營地東側，遠離廢墟裡的莫德爾（32級，精英）。",
	["Back east along the road from {area:413} to {area:415}: {npc:3691} in the inn, the flight master at the west end."] = "從{area:413}沿道路往東回{area:415}：{npc:3691}在旅店裡，飛行管理員在西端。",
	["Back north through Menethil: {npc:1217} is in the {area:2104}, on the way to the hovels."] = "往北穿過米奈希爾回去：{npc:1217}在{area:2104}，就在去小屋的路上。",
	["Back over the span and down the road to {area:205}, on the camp's east side, away from Modr (32, elite) in the ruins."] = "走回橋這邊，沿道路回{area:205}，待在營地東側，遠離廢墟裡的莫德爾（32級，精英）。",
	["Back through the portal to {area:702} and fly to {area:442} for the boat."] = "穿過傳送門回{area:702}，飛到{area:442}搭船。",
	["East from {npc:1244}: the Crimson Whelps (25-26) nest in the hills north-east of the {area:1036}, and the Highland Razormaws (27-28) hunt the highlands north of them, towards {area:205}. The Perfect Razormaw Eggs lie in the raptors' nests.\nCareful: {quest:98283}, an elite raptor, prowls the hills north of the whelps, and Ados, an elite {npc:270892} guardian, stands at the {area:1038}: give both room. The Dragonmaw east of {npc:270637} are elite too."] = "從{npc:1244}往東：{npc:1069}（25-26級）在{area:1036}東北方的丘陵築巢，{npc:1018}（27-28級）在牠們北邊往{area:205}的高地獵食。{item:280132}在迅猛龍的巢裡。\n小心：精英迅猛龍{quest:98283}在雛龍北邊的丘陵徘徊，精英{npc:270892}守衛阿多斯站在{area:1038}：兩個都離遠一點。{npc:270637}東邊的龍喉獸人也是精英。",
	["Follow the road east to the {area:419}. {npc:3916} stands by the moonwell."] = "沿道路往東到{area:419}。{npc:3916}站在月井旁。",
	["For the Dragonmaw catapult, on the {zone:1437} loop of the {zone:1424} guide"] = "給龍喉投石車，在{zone:1424}指南的{zone:1437}那一圈",
	["For {npc:1416} in {zone:1453}, on this guide's {zone:1453} stop"] = "給{zone:1453}的{npc:1416}，本指南去{zone:1453}那一站",
	["For {npc:2700} at {area:320}, on your {zone:1417} visit (30-40)"] = "給{area:320}的{npc:2700}，你去{zone:1417}時（30-40）",
	["From level 29: north along the coast from Menethil to the wreck of the Intrepid. {npc:1160} (30) is aboard, and the locked strongbox sits in the wreck.\nCareful: Cursed Marines (27-28) crowd the deck around him: clear them first. {npc:270589}, a level 31-32 elite, roams the {zone:1437}: give it a wide berth."] = "29級起：從米奈希爾沿海岸往北到無畏號的殘骸。{npc:1160}（30級）在船上，上鎖的保險箱在殘骸裡。\n小心：{npc:1158}（27-28級）擠在他周圍的甲板上：先清掉。31-32級的精英{npc:270589}在{zone:1437}遊蕩：遠遠避開。",
	["From {area:442}'s flight master, a short flight over the water to {area:702}."] = "從{area:442}的飛行管理員，飛過海一小段到{area:702}。",
	["Go west from {area:415} to {area:441}. Teronis lies on the shore among the Saltspittle murlocs."] = "從{area:415}往西到{area:441}。泰洛尼斯倒在岸邊的鹽沫魚人之間。",
	["Hearth back to {area:150} if you bound at the {area:2104}, or walk west along the road: {npc:2104} stands on the top floor of {area:2103}, {npc:2094} by the docks."] = "如果爐石綁在{area:2104}就用爐石回{area:150}，或沿道路往西走：{npc:2104}站在{area:2103}頂層，{npc:2094}在碼頭旁。",
	["In the river under the Arathi end of the span, a {item:4433} lies on the bottom: {npc:2695} in {zone:1455}, at the end of this guide, takes it."] = "在橋阿拉希那一頭下方的河裡，河底有一封{item:4433}：本指南最後{zone:1455}的{npc:2695}收。",
	["North along the road from {area:205} towards the {area:880}: Ebenezer Rustlocke's corpse lies under the span. His parchment goes back to {npc:1075}.\nCareful: Two elite Dark Iron Saboteurs (28-29) stand by the corpse inside the span: loot the corpse and walk straight out without fighting, or, from level 31, pull them one at a time."] = "從{area:205}沿道路往北朝{area:880}走：艾本尼澤·鏽鎖的屍體在橋下。他的羊皮紙交回給{npc:1075}。\n小心：兩隻精英{npc:1052}（28-29級）站在橋下屍體旁：拾取屍體後不要打，直接走出來；或31級起一次拉一隻。",
	["North-west to the road and north along it to {area:205}. {npc:1071} and {npc:1075} stand together in the dwarves' camp on the east side of the road; the {object:147516} ruins west of it are full of elites: keep to the road.\nCareful: Modr (32, elite) walks the {object:147516} ruins about 55 yards west of {npc:1075}; players have met it from the camp and the road: stay on the camp's east side."] = "往西北到道路，再沿道路往北到{area:205}。{npc:1071}和{npc:1075}一起站在道路東側的矮人營地；營地西邊的{object:147516}廢墟滿是精英：待在路上。\n小心：莫德爾（32級，精英）在{npc:1075}西邊約55碼的{object:147516}廢墟裡走動；玩家在營地和路上都遇過它：待在營地東側。",
	["Not done on your first {zone:1440} visit? {npc:3691} also has {quest:1025} (the Foulweald, on the way to {npc:3897}) and {quest:1054} ({npc:3987}, on the way back from {area:413})."] = "第一次來{zone:1440}沒做完？{npc:3691}還有{quest:1025}（腐木林，往{npc:3897}的路上）和{quest:1054}（{npc:3987}，從{area:413}回來的路上）。",
	["Over the {area:880}: the Dark Irons' cache of explosives sits by its Arathi end.\nCareful: Dark Iron Shadowcasters (31-32) and Bombardiers (30-31), who fight from range, and a Supplier (31-32) stand within 15-25 yards of the cache: pull them one at a time to the bridge before you touch it."] = "越過{area:880}：黑鐵矮人的炸藥堆在阿拉希那一頭。\n小心：會遠程攻擊的{npc:2577}（31-32級）和轟炸手（30-31級），還有一個補給官（31-32級），站在炸藥堆15-25碼內：碰炸藥前先一次一隻拉到橋上。",
	["Razormaw Incisors: from the raptors by the {area:1038}, after the Fen Creepers"] = "{item:280103}：{area:1038}旁的迅猛龍，在{npc:1040}之後",
	["South along the road to the {area:1025}: {npc:270637} camps among the Fenrunners, just west of {npc:1244}."] = "沿道路往南到{area:1025}：{npc:270637}在沼澤奔行者之間紮營，就在{npc:1244}西邊不遠。",
	["Sully Balloo's letter, from the {area:880}: {npc:2695} takes it here in {zone:1455}."] = "蘇利·巴盧的信，來自{area:880}：{zone:1455}這裡的{npc:2695}收。",
	["Take her message to {npc:3916} on the way east"] = "往東的路上把她的口信交給{npc:3916}",
	["The Bluegill Raiders (28-29) on the beach south-west of Menethil carry the ingots."] = "米奈希爾西南方沙灘上的{npc:1418}（28-29級）身上有鐵錠。",
	["The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of {area:2358}.\nRotting Slimes in and around the Barrow Den leave a {object:19021} when they die: open the chests until one holds the pommel.\nCareful: Non-elite Forsaken of about level 28-30 guard the camp. Some of them are stealthed, and the ones around the table often aggro together."] = "被遺忘者的營地在{area:2358}南邊的樹林裡。\n墓穴裡外的{npc:3928}死後會留下{object:19021}：一個一個打開，直到有一個裝著劍柄頭。\n小心：營地由約28-30級的非精英被遺忘者守著。有些會潛行，桌子旁那幾個常常一起上。",
	["The Saltspittle murlocs around Teronis at {area:441} drop the {item:5463}."] = "{area:441}泰洛尼斯周圍的鹽沫魚人會掉{item:5463}。",
	["The tram comes in at the {object:28027}: {npc:1416} works at the forge there."] = "地鐵停在{object:28027}：{npc:1416}在那裡的鍛爐工作。",
	["The wreck of the Flying Osprey lies in the shallows south of the keep, beside {item:279915}."] = "飛鶚號的殘骸在要塞南邊的淺灘，就在{item:279915}旁邊。",
	["Through the pink portal at {area:702}, up into {zone:1457}."] = "穿過{area:702}的粉紅色傳送門，上到{zone:1457}。",
	["{item:5520}, in {object:19877}"] = "{item:5520}，在{object:19877}裡",
	["{npc:1075} stands beside {npc:1071} in the dwarves' camp at {area:205}, east of the road; keep out of the {object:147516} ruins west of it, where Modr (32, elite) walks."] = "{npc:1075}站在{area:205}道路東側矮人營地裡{npc:1071}的旁邊；別進營地西邊的{object:147516}廢墟，莫德爾（32級，精英）在那裡走動。",
	["{npc:1239}: {npc:1160} (30) is for the end of this visit, from level 29"] = "{npc:1239}：{npc:1160}（30級）留到這一趟最後，29級起",
	["{npc:1416}: {quest:322}, from {npc:1217} in Menethil"] = "{npc:1416}：{quest:322}，來自米奈希爾的{npc:1217}",
	["{npc:2097}, by the north gate: {npc:1071} takes it at {area:205}, at the north end of this visit's east loop"] = "{npc:2097}，在北門旁：{area:205}的{npc:1071}收，在這一趟東邊那一圈的北端",
	["{npc:2784} holds court in the {object:171709}."] = "{npc:2784}在{object:171709}接見。",
	["{npc:3691}'s delivery"] = "{npc:3691}的送貨",
	["{npc:3691}'s message"] = "{npc:3691}的口信",
	["{npc:3691}, at the inn, if you missed her first visit"] = "{npc:3691}，在旅店，如果你第一趟沒找她",
	["{npc:3691}, at the {area:415} inn"] = "{npc:3691}，在{area:415}的旅店",
	["{npc:3880}: for {npc:8026} in {zone:1457}, a hop from {area:442} on the way to the boat"] = "{npc:3880}：給{zone:1457}的{npc:8026}，去搭船的路上從{area:442}過去一下",
	["{npc:8026} stands on the {area:1660} in the north of the city; {object:19877} is in the south of it."] = "{npc:8026}站在城市北邊的{area:1660}；{object:19877}在城市南邊。",
	["{npc:8026}: for {npc:3453} in {area:392}, on your {zone:1445} trip at about 33 (30-40)"] = "{npc:8026}：給{area:392}的{npc:3453}，你約33級去{zone:1445}時（30-40）",
	["{quest:270}, from {npc:1212} in {zone:1453}: {npc:1217} stands in the {area:2104}, south of the keep. His {quest:321} lies in the wreck just south of town, by {item:279915}."] = "{quest:270}，來自{zone:1453}的{npc:1212}：{npc:1217}站在要塞南邊的{area:2104}。他的{quest:321}在城鎮南邊不遠的沉船裡，就在{item:279915}旁邊。",
	["{quest:277} is still short of its nine {item:2611}: the Mosshide Fenrunners and Trappers (22-24) along the river north-west of the Angerfang camp, south-west of {area:309}, drop them. Almost every one carries some.\nCareful: Maddened Rotclaws (25-26) roam the {area:1025} around {npc:1244}; Mosshide Brutes, Mystics and Alphas (24-27) hold the hills north-west of the Fenrunners' camp."] = "{quest:277}還差九個{item:2611}：{area:309}西南方、怒牙營地西北方河邊的{npc:1010}和苔皮捕獸者（22-24級）會掉。幾乎每隻身上都有。\n小心：{npc:271334}（25-26級）在{npc:1244}周圍的{area:1025}遊蕩；{npc:1012}、苔皮祕法師和苔皮首領（24-27級）佔據沼澤奔行者營地西北方的丘陵。",
	["{quest:288}, if the {zone:1440} guide's Menethil stop didn't do it: {npc:1239} wants a {item:2594} from {npc:1464}, both in the inn."] = "{quest:288}，如果{zone:1440}指南停米奈希爾港時沒做：{npc:1239}要{npc:1464}的{item:2594}，兩個都在旅店裡。",
	["{quest:293}, from {npc:1217} in Menethil: {npc:1284} stands in the Cathedral of Light."] = "{quest:293}，來自米奈希爾的{npc:1217}：{npc:1284}站在聖光大教堂裡。",
	["{quest:98246}: the Razormaw eggs, on the same walk"] = "{quest:98246}：剃刀之顎的蛋，同一趟路上",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/07-thousand-needles"] = {
	["{quest:58}'s Plague Spreaders, from your last {zone:1431} visit: Commander Althea is in the town hall."] = "上次去{zone:1431}拿的{quest:58}的{npc:604}：奧爾希雅指揮官在市政廳。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills"] = {
	["for {npc:2700} at {area:320}, in the {zone:1417} guide"] = "給{area:320}的{npc:2700}，在{zone:1417}指南",
	["{npc:2276}, inside: keep it, the Syndicate camp waits for the road north to Arathi (the {zone:1417} guide)"] = "{npc:2276}，在裡面：先留著，辛迪加營地留到往北去阿拉希的路上（{zone:1417}指南）",
	["{npc:2366}, in the inn: for {area:35} (the {zone:1434} guide)"] = "{npc:2366}，在旅店裡：給{area:35}（{zone:1434}指南）",
	["{npc:5479} trains warriors in {object:2100}, beside the Pig and Whistle. {npc:6236} waits on {area:720} in the {zone:1413}, on the way to {area:392} much later (the 40-50 {zone:1434} guide)."] = "{npc:5479}在{object:2100}訓練戰士，就在豬與哨旅店旁邊。{npc:6236}在{zone:1413}的{area:720}等你，很久以後去{area:392}的路上（40-50的{zone:1434}指南）。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/02-desolace"] = {
	["Back south-east past {npc:11863}'s tower to the Burning Blade's fortress: {npc:5644} hides inside it."] = "往東南經過{npc:11863}的塔，到燃刃的堡壘：{npc:5644}躲在裡面。",
	["Back west up the hill to {npc:11863}'s tower with the sceptre, then south along the road to {area:2407}."] = "帶著權杖往西爬上山丘回{npc:11863}的塔，再沿道路往南到{area:2407}。",
	["Keep north to {area:598} for {item:15881}: any Slitherblade can drop it. Work the Naga, Sorceresses and Warriors (32-34) of the strand's southern half until it drops.\nCareful: the Myrmidons (34-35) hold the beach's northern half with the Sea Witches and Oracles (34-36, casters), and Tidehunters (36-37) swim off the northern tip: on the way to the chest, keep to the beach and swim straight across."] = "繼續往北到{area:598}拿{item:15881}：任何滑刃納迦都可能掉。在海灘南半部打納迦、女巫和戰士（32-34級），直到掉出來。\n小心：侍從（34-35級）和海女巫、神諭者（34-36級，會施法）佔據海灘北半部，潮汐獵人（36-37級）在北端外海游：去箱子的路上沿著海灘走，直接游過去。",
	["North-east from {npc:11596}'s camp to {area:609}, on the way back to {area:608}: every Kolkar drops Centaur Ears for {npc:5752} and {quest:93224} for {npc:5396}. The Magram south-east of {npc:11596}'s camp drop them too, but their village holds Necromancers (42-43) and Guardians (39-41): stay with the Kolkar (30-35)."] = "從{npc:11596}的營地往東北到{area:609}，順路回{area:608}：每個科卡爾半人馬都會掉{item:6067}給{npc:5752}，以及{quest:93224}給{npc:5396}。{npc:11596}營地東南方的瑪格拉姆也會掉，但他們的村子有死靈法師（42-43級）和守護者（39-41級）：打科卡爾（30-35級）就好。",
	["North-west from {area:609} back along the road to {area:608}: {npc:11438} waits at {area:2407}. He sends you after the robber to {area:35}, where the next guide ends: keep it."] = "從{area:609}往西北沿道路回{area:608}：{npc:11438}在{area:2407}等你。他會要你去{area:35}追那個強盜，下一份指南在那裡結束：先留著。",
	["West into the {area:596} first: {npc:11438}'s {object:176751} lie among the skeletons on its western side. Just north of them an {object:417353} starts {quest:79229}, also for {npc:11438}."] = "先往西進{area:596}：{npc:11438}要的{object:176751}在西側的骨骸之間。就在它們北邊，一堆熄滅的營火會開始{quest:79229}，也是給{npc:11438}的。",
	["West to the shore: the Drysnap Crawlers and Pincers (33-35) on the beach and the clam beds around the wreck carry {item:15878}, about one in seven."] = "往西到海岸：沙灘上的{npc:11562}和乾鉗蟹（33-35級），以及殘骸周圍的蛤床，大約七隻掉一把{item:15878}。",
	["{area:2407} stands by the road south of the fortress, on the way to {npc:11596}'s camp. {npc:11438} collects {object:176751}; they lie among the skeletons of the {area:596}, where {npc:11596}'s kodos are."] = "{area:2407}在堡壘南邊的路旁，在去{npc:11596}營地的路上。{npc:11438}收集{object:176751}；它們在{area:596}的骨骸之間，{npc:11596}的科多獸也在那裡。",
	["{item:13703}, among the skeletons"] = "{item:13703}，在骨骸之間",
	["{npc:11438}: Tokal waits in {area:35}, at the end of the next guide"] = "{npc:11438}：托卡爾在{area:35}，下一份指南最後",
	["{npc:11863}: {npc:12369} (38) rises at the {object:177673}, for the south loop at the end of 30-40 (06b): keep it"] = "{npc:11863}：{npc:12369}（38級）會在{object:177673}出現，留到30-40最後的南邊那一圈（06b）：先留著",
	["{npc:5638}: the satchel lies off the north-west coast, on {zone:1443}'s south loop at the end of 30-40: keep it"] = "{npc:5638}：背包在西北海岸外，在30-40最後{zone:1443}的南邊那一圈：先留著",
	["{object:177787}, beside the chest: its two keys drop only while you have the quest"] = "{object:177787}，在箱子旁邊：它的兩把鑰匙只有接著任務時才會掉",
	["{quest:79229}: the {object:417353}"] = "{quest:79229}：熄滅的營火",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale"] = {
	["Dizzywig's next errand goes back to the {area:2240}, which the route next visits at 45: leave it."] = "迪茲維格的下一個任務要回{area:2240}，路線45級才會再去：先別接。",
	["Down the {area:485} into {zone:1441}. Careful: wait on the platform until the lift is level with it before you step on, and stay on it until it stops; the drop beside it kills. {item:5791} lies a couple of hundred yards north-east of the lift's foot, in {area:2097}, where the Grimtotems (25-27) camp."] = "搭{area:485}下到{zone:1441}。注意：在平台上等升降梯跟平台一樣高再踏上去，停穩之前別下來；旁邊摔下去會死。{item:5791}在升降梯底下東北方一兩百碼的{area:2097}，恐怖圖騰（25-27級）在那裡紮營。",
	["Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at {area:503}, where the road to the {area:403} turns west. Look around the tower: {npc:4967} appears at its foot, and you hand the quest in to him there."] = "沿道路往西北離開塞拉摩，到{area:503}的瞭望塔，往{area:403}的路在那裡轉往西。在塔周圍看一看：{npc:4967}會出現在塔底，就在那裡把任務交給他。",
	["Follow the road west to the burned inn on the road toward the {zone:1413}: the black shield and Reethe's guard badge lie in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn."] = "沿道路往西到往{zone:1413}路上那間燒毀的旅店：黑色盾牌和里斯的守衛徽章在灰燼裡，蹄印在旅店旁的泥地上。",
	["From Theramore follow the road north-west through the marsh into the {zone:1413} and up the coast to {area:392}: Stranglethorn starts at {area:35}, across the sea. {area:392}'s gryphon master stands above the dock; {npc:3391} is upstairs in the house above it; {quest:1111} waits on the dock by the boat."] = "從塞拉摩沿道路往西北穿過沼澤進入{zone:1413}，再沿海岸往北到{area:392}：荊棘谷從海對面的{area:35}開始。{area:392}的獅鷲管理員站在碼頭上方；{npc:3391}在它上面那棟房子的樓上；{quest:1111}在碼頭的船旁等你。",
	["Take Tervosh's next errand now: he stands here only right after the hand-in. {npc:4966} waits for the next {zone:1445} visit, at about 39."] = "現在就接特沃許的下一個任務：他只有剛交完任務時才站在這裡。{npc:4966}留到下一次約39級來{zone:1445}時。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:12866} stands by the entrance of {area:1316}, a few hundred yards north-east of the top of the {area:485}; the Razorfen Battleguards, Thornweavers and Death's Head Cultists (33-34, elite) hold the thorny slopes around her. Skip it if you are alone."] = "這些是精英怪：建議組隊，找人和你一起做。{npc:12866}站在{area:1316}入口旁，在{area:485}頂端東北方幾百碼；{npc:7873}、荊棘編織者和{npc:7872}（33-34級，精英）佔據她周圍長滿荊棘的山坡。獨自一人就跳過。",
	["Vimes's next errand, The Deserters, is for the {zone:1445} visit at 39: leave it."] = "維米斯的下一個任務「逃兵」留到39級來{zone:1445}那一趟：先別接。",
	["West to the wyverns' cliffs at {area:482}. Every wyvern there can drop a venom sac."] = "往西到{area:482}的雙足飛龍懸崖。那裡每隻雙足飛龍都可能掉毒囊。",
	["{item:5791}: for {npc:4048}, just past {area:482}"] = "{item:5791}：給{area:482}過去不遠的{npc:4048}",
	["{npc:3391}: for {npc:4631}, on {area:35}'s dock where the boat lands"] = "{npc:3391}：給{area:35}碼頭（船停靠的地方）的{npc:4631}",
	["{npc:4048} camps north of {area:482}, just over the border into {zone:1444} on the path up to {area:489}: hand him the journal. His next quest is inside {area:1717}: leave it."] = "{npc:4048}在{area:482}北邊紮營，剛越過邊界進{zone:1444}、往{area:489}的小路上：把日記交給他。他的下一個任務在{area:1717}裡面：別接。",
	["{npc:4452}: for {quest:1111} on {area:392}'s dock, where this guide ends"] = "{npc:4452}：給{area:392}碼頭的{quest:1111}，本指南在那裡結束",
	["{npc:4456} is in the north of town, Captain Vimes and {npc:4948} on the top floor of {area:514}; {npc:4941} stands in the town."] = "{npc:4456}在城鎮北邊，維米斯上尉和{npc:4948}在{area:514}頂層；{npc:4941}站在城裡。",
	["{npc:4630}: for {npc:3391} in {area:392}, on the way to the boat"] = "{npc:4630}：給{area:392}的{npc:3391}，在去搭船的路上",
	["{npc:4964}: {area:503} is the watchtower on the road west, next"] = "{npc:4964}：{area:503}是往西道路上的瞭望塔，接下來就去",
	["{npc:4967}, at the foot of the tower"] = "{npc:4967}，在塔底",
	["{npc:4967}: {npc:4966} holds {area:504}, for the {zone:1445} visit at 39"] = "{npc:4967}：{npc:4966}守著{area:504}，留給39級來{zone:1445}那一趟",
	["{object:19868} lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers and Salt Flats Scavengers roam the north half, Sparkleshell Tortoises (30-31) the middle of the flats: hunt them for the shells. Careful: Sparkleshell Snappers (34-35) wander the whole flats, and the Saltstone Gazers (34-35) and Scorpid Terrors (33-34) hold the far south: leave them and keep to the north half.\nCareful: {npc:5935} (37, rare) roams the south-east of the flats, around 83-88,71-84: leave it be."] = "{object:19868}散落在整片鹽灘上。{npc:4140}和{npc:4154}在北半部遊蕩，{npc:4142}（30-31級）在鹽灘中部：打牠們拿殼。注意：{npc:4143}（34-35級）在整片鹽灘遊蕩，{npc:4150}（34-35級）和{npc:4139}（33-34級）佔據最南邊：別理牠們，待在北半部。\n小心：{npc:5935}（37級，稀有）在鹽灘東南部約83-88,71-84遊蕩：別惹它。",
	["{object:21042}: for Captain Vimes, on the way back through Theramore"] = "{object:21042}：給維米斯上尉，回去經過塞拉摩時交",
	["{quest:1111}: for {npc:3945} in {area:35}, where the boat lands"] = "{quest:1111}：給{area:35}（船停靠的地方）的{npc:3945}",
	["{quest:1111}: {quest:1039}, from {npc:8026} in {zone:1457}"] = "{quest:1111}：{quest:1039}，來自{zone:1457}的{npc:8026}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale"] = {
	["Keep it for another visit: {npc:729} (37) prowls the Lashtail hill."] = "先留到下一趟：{npc:729}（37級）在鞭尾迅猛龍的山丘上徘徊。",
	["{npc:250660}'s next errand sends you into the Venture Co. house at {area:37}, among Venture Co. Agents (39): leave it."] = "{npc:250660}的下一個任務要你進{area:37}的風險投資公司房子，周圍是{npc:260429}（39級）：先別接。",
	["{npc:3945}, on the dock"] = "{npc:3945}，在碼頭上",
	["{npc:3945}: for {npc:267} in {area:42}, where the second Stranglethorn loop starts"] = "{npc:3945}：給{area:42}的{npc:267}，荊棘谷第二圈從那裡開始",
	["{npc:4631} stands on the dock where the boat lands. Bind your hearthstone at the inn: it is your way back here from the north of the jungle at the end of the loop."] = "{npc:4631}站在船停靠的碼頭上。在旅店綁爐石：這一圈最後要從叢林北邊用它回這裡。",
	["{npc:4631}, on the dock"] = "{npc:4631}，在碼頭上",
	["{npc:4631}: for {npc:2496}, upstairs in the tavern"] = "{npc:4631}：給酒館樓上的{npc:2496}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale"] = {
	["Check the hilltop on your way to the raptors. If {npc:729} isn't here or you can't pull her alone, keep moving; {npc:717} can take the paw on the later visit."] = "去打迅猛龍的路上看看山頂。{npc:729}不在、或你單拉不了她，就繼續走；{npc:717}之後那一趟也收爪子。",
	["East from the ruins, hunt Lashtail Raptors around the hill south-west of Nesingwary's camp. If you have {quest:187}, are at least 36 and see {npc:729} (37) alone, you can take her paw here or leave the hunt for your next visit."] = "從廢墟往東，在奈辛瓦里營地西南方的山丘周圍打{npc:686}。如果你有{quest:187}、至少36級、而且看到{npc:729}（37級）落單，可以在這裡拿她的爪子，或留到下一趟再打。",
	["Hand the paw to {npc:717} beside Hemet."] = "把爪子交給赫米特旁邊的{npc:717}。",
	["{item:4600}, from {npc:2832}"] = "{item:4600}，向{npc:2832}買",
	["{npc:215643}, whom Bibbly sent you to find, waits by the {object:56910}. He asks for a {item:4600}: {npc:2832} sells it in the tavern, a few steps away."] = "比布里要你找的{npc:215643}在{object:56910}旁等你。他要一杯{item:4600}：酒館裡幾步之遙的{npc:2832}有賣。",
	["{npc:267} works in {area:42}'s town hall, a short walk from the flight master; {npc:661} stands just east of it."] = "{npc:267}在{area:42}的市政廳，離飛行管理員走幾步路；{npc:661}站在它東邊不遠。",
	["{npc:661}: the evidence lies in the {area:121}, on the next guide's way to the {zone:1435}: keep it"] = "{npc:661}：證據在{area:121}，在下一份指南去{zone:1435}的路上：先留著",
	["{npc:715}, if the first Stranglethorn loop didn't give it: the Lashtail Raptors, after the jungle ruins"] = "{npc:715}，如果荊棘谷第一圈沒拿到：{npc:686}，叢林廢墟之後",
	["{npc:717}. Keep it for the later visit if you skip {npc:729} on the raptor hill."] = "{npc:717}。如果你在迅猛龍山丘上跳過了{npc:729}，就留到之後那一趟。",
	["{npc:729} (37) prowls the hilltop."] = "{npc:729}（37級）在山頂徘徊。",
	["{npc:729} on the raptor hill"] = "迅猛龍山丘上的{npc:729}",
	["{npc:729}'s hill"] = "{npc:729}的山丘",
	["{npc:770}, if the first Stranglethorn loop didn't give it: for {npc:773} in {area:35}"] = "{npc:770}，如果荊棘谷第一圈沒拿到：給{area:35}的{npc:773}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands"] = {
	["His next errand goes to {zone:1457}, off this route: leave it."] = "他的下一個任務要去{zone:1457}，不在這條路線上：先別接。",
	["Leave the {zone:2548} for about level 41: its Western Front has elite patrols. After Stranglethorn, the {zone:2548} guide takes you from {zone:1455} to {area:69}, then through {area:2417}."] = "{zone:2548}留到約41級再去：它的西部前線有精英巡邏。荊棘谷之後，{zone:2548}指南會帶你從{zone:1455}到{area:69}，再穿過{area:2417}。",
	["South from {area:42} to the {area:121}, on the way to {zone:1430}: the mound of dirt by the Nightbane worgen (29-31) holds the evidence {npc:661} wants."] = "從{area:42}往南到{area:121}，在去{zone:1430}的路上：夜禍狼人（29-31級）旁那堆土裡有{npc:661}要的證據。",
	["The two wrecks lie in the bay west of the cove. The charts and logs are inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around them. Daggerspine naga swim the whole bay.\nCareful: the charts and logs lie deep inside the wrecks: watch your breath bar and come up between them; a water breathing potion makes it easy."] = "兩艘沉船在海灣西邊的海灣裡。海圖和航海日誌在船裡面；寶石在周圍的海底。匕脊納迦在整個海灣游來游去。\n小心：海圖和日誌在沉船深處：注意呼吸條，中間浮上來換氣；有水下呼吸藥水會輕鬆很多。",
	["the {object:19030}"] = "{object:19030}",
	["{npc:2276}, inside, if the {zone:1424} guide didn't take it: the Syndicate camp is on the way to Arathi"] = "{npc:2276}，在裡面，如果{zone:1424}指南沒接：辛迪加的營地在往阿拉希的路上",
	["{npc:2700}: {npc:1075}'s plea, from the {zone:1437}"] = "{npc:2700}：{zone:1437}的{npc:1075}的請求",
	["{npc:661}, in {area:42}"] = "{npc:661}，在{area:42}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands"] = {
	["The Shadowforge dwarves camp just north of the digsite; the crumpled map and {npc:269577}'s mining helmet lie among their tents. Tunnelers and Darkweavers carry Ryedol's pick and {npc:269577}'s artifacts. Crag Coyotes roam the slopes around it. Careful: Shadowforge Ruffians (36-37, elite) walk among them, most on the slopes between the pass and the camp: pull the Tunnelers and Darkweavers away from them."] = "暗爐矮人在挖掘場北邊不遠紮營；皺巴巴的地圖和{npc:269577}的採礦頭盔在他們的帳篷之間。挖掘者和暗織者身上有萊多爾的鎬和{npc:269577}的古物。{npc:2727}在周圍的山坡上遊蕩。注意：{npc:4845}（36-37級，精英）在他們之間走動，大多在山口和營地之間的山坡上：把挖掘者和暗織者拉離他們。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/30-40/06b-desolace"] = {
	["{npc:11438}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't give it"] = "{npc:11438}，如果第一次來{zone:1443}沒拿到",
	["{npc:11863}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't give it"] = "{npc:11863}，如果第一次來{zone:1443}沒拿到",
	["{npc:11863}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't take the sceptre back to him"] = "{npc:11863}，如果第一次來{zone:1443}沒把權杖帶回給他",
	["{npc:5396}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't give it"] = "{npc:5396}，如果第一次來{zone:1443}沒拿到",
	["{npc:5638}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't take it: the wreck lies below {npc:11863}'s tower"] = "{npc:5638}，如果第一次來{zone:1443}沒接：沉船在{npc:11863}的塔下方",
	["{npc:6019} stands at the edge of the {area:596}, south-west of {area:2407}; {object:176751} lie among the skeletons.\nCareful: Rexxar (62, elite), the Horde's champion, walks the road past the graveyard with his bear Misha and attacks Alliance players: when he comes by, step well away from the road and let him pass."] = "{npc:6019}站在{area:596}邊緣，在{area:2407}西南方；{object:176751}在骨骸之間。\n小心：部落的勇士雷克薩（62級，精英）帶著他的熊米莎沿墓地旁的道路走，會攻擊聯盟玩家：他經過時離道路遠一點，讓他過去。",
	["{object:177787}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't take it"] = "{object:177787}，如果第一次來{zone:1443}沒接",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale"] = {
	["Already have all eight Tumbled Crystals? Hand them to {npc:737} now."] = "八個{item:4106}都拿到了？現在交給{npc:737}。",
	["Back down to town: Shaky stands at the tunnel mouth; {npc:2488} and MacKinley are on the top floor."] = "回到城鎮：『病鬼』菲力浦站在隧道口；{npc:2488}和馬克基雷在頂層。",
	["Back east along the road to Theramore: {npc:4944} takes the deserters' news on the top floor of {area:514}, and the flight master stands by its gate."] = "沿道路往東回塞拉摩：在{area:514}頂層把逃兵的消息交給{npc:4944}，飛行管理員就站在它的大門旁。",
	["Back to Theramore for the boat to {area:150}."] = "回塞拉摩搭船去{area:150}。",
	["Every Bloodsail drops Snuff and one of them carries {npc:2493}'s eye: take them from the Raiders and Mages (39-41) at the Bloodsail camp on the beach just north of town, where you found the letter. Leave the {area:43} camp south of town (Warlocks and Swashbucklers 41-43) for the level-48 visit.\nCareful: Rippa (44, a rare crocolisk) swims the shore beside the camp: stay out of the water."] = "每個血帆海盜都會掉鼻煙，其中一個身上帶著{npc:2493}的眼睛：到城鎮北邊海灘上的血帆營地（你找到信的地方）打劫掠者和法師（39-41級）拿。城鎮南邊的{area:43}營地（術士和劍客41-43級）留到48級那一趟再去。\n小心：稀有鱷魚瑞帕（44級）在營地旁的岸邊游動：別下水。",
	["Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at {area:503}. Mudrock Burrowers roam the marsh around it.\nIf {quest:1265} isn't done yet: {npc:4967} waits at the foot of the tower once you have looked around. Hand the quest in to him there, not in Theramore, and take his next errand on the spot."] = "沿道路往西北離開塞拉摩，前往{area:503}的瞭望塔。{npc:4398}在它周圍的沼澤遊蕩。\n如果{quest:1265}還沒完成：你四處看過之後，{npc:4967}會在塔底等你。就在那裡把任務交給他，不要回塞拉摩交，並當場接他的下一個任務。",
	["Follow the road south-east from Biggs to the pass into the {zone:1419}, keeping clear of {area:75}, the Horde town to the north-east.\nDown the pass, the road bends east to {area:1438}. Careful: {npc:5982} vultures (46) and Starving Snickerfangs (45) hunt in the dry hills south of the road: stay on it and keep moving."] = "從比格斯沿道路往東南走到進入{zone:1419}的山口，遠離東北方的部落城鎮{area:75}。\n下了山口，道路向東彎往{area:1438}。小心：{npc:5982}禿鷹（46級）和{npc:5984}（45級）在道路南邊的乾燥丘陵獵食：待在路上，別停下來。",
	["From the Bloodsail camp, climb into the Mistvale hills just east of it: the Elder Mistvale Gorillas (40) there drop the giblets."] = "從血帆營地爬上它東邊的迷霧谷山丘：那裡的{npc:1557}（40級）會掉落內臟。",
	["Head south from the compound to {area:37}. The Venture Co. Geologists in the shore camps carry the Tumbled Crystals; Venture Co. Agents (39) walk among them. Stay on the shore: stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers prowl the jungle south and east of the lake."] = "從營地往南到{area:37}。岸邊營地的{npc:1096}身上有{item:4106}；{npc:260429}（39級）在他們之間走動。待在岸邊：潛行的{npc:684}在湖南邊和東邊的叢林裡徘徊。",
	["If you didn't take {quest:2872} on the earlier stop: \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor."] = "如果之前那一趟沒接{quest:2872}：頂層的『海狼』馬克基雷。",
	["Into the {zone:1419}"] = "進入{zone:1419}",
	["MacKinley's Voodoo Dues waits for the level-48 {area:35} stop, with Zanzil's village: leave it for now."] = "馬克基雷的「巫毒債務」留到48級回{area:35}時和贊吉爾的村莊一起做：先別管。",
	["Seahorn's next task, {quest:597}, waits for the level-48 {area:35} stop with the {area:43} camp (41-43): leave it for now."] = "海角的下一個任務{quest:597}，留到48級回{area:35}時和{area:43}營地（41-43級）一起做：先別管。",
	["The boat to {area:35} leaves from {area:392}'s dock, below the flight master. Without the {area:392} flight path: follow the road west out of the marsh into the {zone:1413} and north up the coast to {area:392}, and learn it there."] = "去{area:35}的船從{area:392}的碼頭出發，就在飛行管理員下方。還沒有{area:392}的飛行路線：沿道路往西離開沼澤進入{zone:1413}，再沿海岸往北到{area:392}，在那裡學。",
	["The crystals gathered at {area:37}"] = "在{area:37}收集的水晶",
	["The pass to the {zone:1419}"] = "通往{zone:1419}的山口",
	["The road to {area:1438}"] = "通往{area:1438}的道路",
	["You missed this on the route's earlier visit here: take it now, before the Bloodsail camp. Its gorillas live on the hills just above the camp."] = "路線之前來這裡時你漏接了這個：現在接，在去血帆營地之前。要打的猩猩就住在營地正上方的山丘上。",
	["\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor, offers {quest:2872} from level 40 (under 40, this guide's last {area:35} stop offers it again)."] = "頂層的『海狼』馬克基雷從40級起提供{quest:2872}（不到40級的話，本指南最後一次回{area:35}時會再提供）。",
	["\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley: for Stoley in {zone:1446}, keep it"] = "『海狼』馬克基雷：給{zone:1446}的史托利，先留著",
	["for {area:1438}, just south of the swamp"] = "去沼澤南邊不遠的{area:1438}",
	["{area:720} lies off the {area:391} just south of {area:392}: wade over the sand bar shallows. {npc:6236} sends four challengers and then {npc:6238} (level 33) at you, one at a time."] = "{area:720}在{area:392}南邊不遠的{area:391}外海：涉水走過沙洲淺灘過去。{npc:6236}會先派四名挑戰者，再派{npc:6238}（33級），一次一個來打你。",
	["{npc:217412}: {quest:93176}, from the {zone:1417} guide"] = "{npc:217412}：{quest:93176}，來自{zone:1417}指南",
	["{npc:2494}' Akiris by the Bundle waits for the level-48 {area:35} stop (its naga are 43-44): leave it for now."] = "{npc:2494}的「成捆的阿基利斯蘆葦」留到48級回{area:35}時再做（那裡的納迦是43-44級）：先別管。",
	["{npc:2498}'s Zanzil's Secret waits for the same stop (Zanzil's village is 43-44): leave it for now."] = "{npc:2498}的「贊吉爾的秘密」也留到同一趟再做（贊吉爾的村莊是43-44級）：先別管。",
	["{npc:5385} is upstairs in the keep and {npc:5393} inside it; the gryphon master stands south of the keep."] = "{npc:5385}在要塞樓上，{npc:5393}在要塞裡；獅鷲管理員站在要塞南邊。",
	["{npc:6236}'s Affray first: {area:720} lies just south of {area:392}. The boat to {area:150} leaves from Theramore afterwards."] = "先做{npc:6236}的「混戰」：{area:720}就在{area:392}南邊不遠。之後再從塞拉摩搭船去{area:150}。",
	["{npc:717}, beside the other hunters"] = "{npc:717}，在其他獵人旁邊",
	["{npc:737}: the Tumbled Crystals, at {area:37} on the northern loop"] = "{npc:737}：{item:4106}，在北邊那一圈的{area:37}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades"] = {
	["Before the second wave: its raiders (44-45), bombardiers (43-44) and {quest:95124}'s ships after them (45) are more than a level over you below 44. Top up on the first camp's buccaneers and musketeers (41-43) at its south-west end, away from the port. {npc:259758}, a rare elite of level 49, roams these cliffs: if you see him, keep well away. Or, with a group, run the {area:1517} dungeon instead."] = "打第二波之前：不到44級的話，它的突襲者（44-45級）、投彈手（43-44級）和之後{quest:95124}的船（45級）都比你高一級以上。先在第一座營地西南端、遠離港口的地方打海盜和火槍手（41-43級）補經驗。{npc:259758}是49級的稀有精英，在這片懸崖遊蕩：看到他就遠遠避開。或者組隊改去打{area:1517}地城。",
	["Careful: the Western Front is written for level 44 and up. Its Twilight Champions are 43-44 and its Thralls 44, Twilight Enforcers (elites, 45) patrol through the camps, and {npc:256881} (46, elite) is for a group only. Below 44, top up on the Eastsea pirates by the port first, or come back with a friend."] = "小心：西部前線是寫給44級以上的。{npc:256799}是43-44級、奴僕44級，{npc:256800}（精英，45級）在營地之間巡邏，{npc:256881}（46級，精英）只適合組隊。不到44級就先在港口旁的東海海盜補經驗，或找朋友一起回來。",
	["Claire is in the cave under the eastern edge of {area:16723}: its entrance is at 50.0,46.0."] = "克萊兒在{area:16723}東緣下方的洞穴裡：入口在50.0,46.0。",
	["Level 44 on the Eastsea pirates"] = "在東海海盜身上練到44級",
	["North from {area:16724}, past {area:16729} and across the river, to {area:16723}, the farm town the Twilight cult holds; keep clear of {area:16743}, the Horde's fort east of the town. {npc:259158} the kobold waits in a cage at the arrow, {npc:256831} below ground in a cave at the town's eastern edge (the entrance is at 50.0,46.0), and {npc:258697} waits at his farm on the north-eastern edge."] = "從{area:16724}往北，經過{area:16729}並渡過河，到暮光教派佔據的農莊{area:16723}；遠離城鎮東邊的部落堡壘{area:16743}。狗頭人{npc:259158}關在箭頭處的籠子裡，{npc:256831}在城鎮東緣一個洞穴的地下（入口在50.0,46.0），{npc:258697}在東北緣自己的農場等你。",
	["Out to the pirates' cliffs once more. Plant Whizzbuzz's charges on the three ships moored below the camp, south to north. {quest:95124} (level 45) walks the middle ship's top deck; her loot chest is below deck. Keep an eye out for {npc:259758} on the way."] = "再去一次海盜的懸崖。把威茲巴茲的炸藥裝在營地下方停泊的三艘船上，從南到北。{quest:95124}（45級）在中間那艘船的上甲板走動；她的戰利品箱在甲板下。路上留意{npc:259758}。",
	["the Wanted poster"] = "通緝海報",
	["{npc:259158}: {quest:94961}, in his cage"] = "{npc:259158}：{quest:94961}，在他的籠子裡",
	["{npc:260026} waits beside the road east of the pass.\nThis guide is written for levels 41-45: the route comes here at about 41, after {zone:1434}. The port's second wave and the Western Front's camps in the north are 43-45, with elite Twilight Enforcers (45) on patrol and {npc:256881} (46, elite) for groups only: below 41, do Stranglethorn first."] = "{npc:260026}在山口東邊的路旁等你。\n本指南寫給41-45級：路線約41級、做完{zone:1434}後來到這裡。港口的第二波和北邊西部前線的營地是43-45級，有精英{npc:256800}（45級）巡邏，{npc:256881}（46級，精英）只適合組隊：不到41級就先做荊棘谷。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas"] = {
	["Only with the distress beacon, a rare drop in {zone:1444}: it starts a quest to find the robot it calls for."] = "只有拿到遇難信標（{zone:1444}的稀有掉落）時才做：它會開始一個任務，去找它呼叫的那個機器人。",
	["The robot sits in a small cave on the north side of {area:1105}, just north-west of the ruins. Escort it to the dock on the {area:1108}, where the boat to Feathermoon leaves; its reward waits with {npc:7406} in {area:35}, on the {zone:1425} guide's {area:35} stop.\nCareful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock."] = "機器人在{area:1105}北側的一個小山洞裡，就在廢墟西北方不遠。護送它到{area:1108}的碼頭（去羽月的船從那裡出發）；獎勵在{area:35}的{npc:7406}那裡，等{zone:1425}指南回{area:35}時再領。\n小心：護送途中會有三次伏擊，每次之前機器人都會先警告你。第一次是3隻雪人，在機器人離開山洞、往道路爬上去之後。第二次是3隻猩猩，在沿著懸崖的小路上。第三次是約4隻豺狼人，其中一隻會施法，在路線轉向碼頭的地方。",
	["for {npc:7771} at the {area:1938} in {zone:1446}: keep it"] = "給{zone:1446}{area:1938}的{npc:7771}：先留著",
	["{npc:3936}: {quest:4267}, for {npc:7740} on the {zone:1446} guide's {zone:1457} stop: keep it"] = "{npc:3936}：{quest:4267}，給{npc:7740}，在{zone:1446}指南去{zone:1457}時交：先留著",
	["{npc:7900} in {area:1116} sends you to {npc:7771} at the {area:1938} in {zone:1446}, where the {zone:1446} guide stops for his dig."] = "{area:1116}的{npc:7900}要你去找{zone:1446}{area:1938}的{npc:7771}，{zone:1446}指南會在他的挖掘場停一下。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris"] = {
	["Only if a Southsea pirate gave you a {item:9250}: it starts a quest for {npc:7882}, inside, where you stand."] = "只有南海海盜掉了{item:9250}給你時才做：它會開始一個交給{npc:7882}的任務，他就在你所在的建築裡。",
	["The {area:2240} lies on the {area:439} in south-east {zone:1441}: {npc:4454} is in the gnomes' camp beside the track, {npc:4630} and {npc:4709} by the goblins' camp. With {quest:1137} handed in, {npc:4630} has work: {npc:4630} first, then {npc:4709}, who runs off to keep Rizzle busy; then take Rizzle's plans from the gnomes' camp and bring them back to {npc:4630}."] = "{area:2240}在{zone:1441}東南部的{area:439}上：{npc:4454}在賽道旁的地精營地，{npc:4630}和{npc:4709}在哥布林營地旁。交完{quest:1137}後{npc:4630}有工作給你：先找{npc:4630}，再找{npc:4709}，他會跑去纏住瑞茲；然後從地精營地拿走瑞茲的設計圖，帶回來給{npc:4630}。",
	["{npc:7771}: the {item:10556} is in {area:392}, on the Un'Goro guide's flight to {area:976}, which hands it in here: keep it"] = "{npc:7771}：{item:10556}在{area:392}，安戈洛指南飛往{area:976}時會順路做，之後回這裡交：先留著",
	["{npc:7771}: {quest:3380}, from Angelas in Feathermoon"] = "{npc:7771}：{quest:3380}，羽月的安吉拉斯給的",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands"] = {
	["Only if you escorted the {zone:1425} robot: {npc:7406} has its reward too."] = "只有護送過{zone:1425}的機器人才做：{npc:7406}這裡也有它的獎勵。",
	["Only if you escorted the {zone:1444} robot: its reward waits with {npc:7406} here in {area:35}."] = "只有護送過{zone:1444}的機器人才做：獎勵在{area:35}這裡的{npc:7406}那裡。",
	["Only with the distress beacon, a rare drop in the {zone:1425}: it starts a quest to find the robot it calls for."] = "只有拿到遇難信標（{zone:1425}的稀有掉落）時才做：它會開始一個任務，去找它呼叫的那個機器人。",
	["The robot sits at the head of the river west of {area:351}. Escort it east to the shore beyond the {area:307}, then ride back west for {area:348}; its reward waits with {npc:7406} in {area:35}, later in this guide.\nCareful: Two ambushes spawn during the escort: first three wildkin owlbeasts, then three trolls. Before each, the robot halts and announces it senses danger. Oozes, stealthed wolves and a large turtle along the path can join fights, and they respawn even if cleared beforehand."] = "機器人在{area:351}西邊的河流源頭。護送它往東到{area:307}另一頭的岸邊，然後往西騎回{area:348}；獎勵在{area:35}的{npc:7406}那裡，本指南稍後會去。\n小心：護送途中會有兩次伏擊：先是三隻梟獸，然後是三個食人妖。每次之前機器人都會停下來說它感覺到危險。沿路的軟泥怪、潛行的狼和一隻大海龜可能加入戰鬥，而且就算事先清掉也會重生。",
	["for {quest:2990} at {area:1438}: the {zone:1428} guide hands it in"] = "給{area:1438}的{quest:2990}：{zone:1428}指南會去交",
	["{item:3925}, from {npc:2536}"] = "{item:3925}，{npc:2536}掉落",
	["{npc:2486}, by the inn"] = "{npc:2486}，在旅店旁",
	["{npc:2535} and Jon-Jon"] = "{npc:2535}和{npc:2536}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge"] = {
	["Careful: Slavers can net you and call allies within 15 yards. A Taskmaster or Steamsmith may be standing beside one. Wait for a clear pull or leave the pack; don't descend into the Cauldron for this bounty."] = "小心：奴隸販子會用網子網住你，並呼叫15碼內的同伴。他們旁邊可能站著監工或鍛造師。等到能單拉再拉，不然就放棄那一群；別為了這個懸賞下到大熔爐裡。",
	["Culling the Competition"] = "淘汰競爭者",
	["Dark Iron Slavers"] = "{npc:5844}",
	["Dark Iron Steamsmiths at the surface furnaces carry Thorium Plated Daggers as well as the {item:18959}. Pull from the outside of the camp."] = "地面熔爐旁的{npc:5840}身上除了{item:18959}，也有{item:10551}。從營地外圍拉。",
	["Dark Iron Taskmasters"] = "{npc:5846}",
	["Still under level 48.66 after the {area:1443} (a solo player usually is; a group's Culling the Competition or {quest:7701} covers it)? Top up on the Incendosaurs (47) in the {area:1443}'s lava pools, pulled to the edge.\nCareful: {npc:14621} (50, elite) and his elite guards hold the {area:1443}'s depths: keep to the pools near the entrance and don't follow the tunnels in."] = "打完{area:1443}還不到48.66級？（單人通常不到；組隊做「淘汰競爭者」或{quest:7701}就夠了）在{area:1443}的熔岩池打{npc:9318}（47級）補經驗，把牠們拉到邊緣。\n小心：{npc:14621}（50級，精英）和他的精英守衛佔據{area:1443}深處：待在入口附近的熔岩池，別跟著隧道往裡走。",
	["Still under level 48.98 (a solo player usually is; a group's {quest:3452} covers it)? Top up on the Searing Lava Spiders (47-48) of the western plateaus, away from the {object:147516} camps.\nCareful: Magma Elementals (46-48) drift among the spiders: pull one at a time. Keep south of the Twilight camp at {area:1442}, whose cultists are elites."] = "還不到48.98級？（單人通常不到；組隊做{quest:3452}就夠了）在西邊高地打{npc:5858}（47-48級）補經驗，遠離{object:147516}的營地。\n小心：{npc:5855}（46-48級）在蜘蛛之間飄蕩：一次拉一隻。待在{area:1442}暮光營地的南邊，那裡的教徒是精英。",
	["Take the bounty from the board only if you want to hunt the linked dwarf packs with a group."] = "只有想跟隊伍一起獵殺成群相連的矮人時，才去告示板接這個懸賞。",
	["The Steamsmiths at the furnaces carry the {item:18959}; the Lookouts on the southern ridges carry the Spyglass. Keep the {item:11818} if a dwarf drops it."] = "熔爐旁的鍛造師身上有{item:18959}；南邊山脊上的瞭望者身上有望遠鏡。如果矮人掉了{item:11818}，留著。",
	["The Twilight elites of {npc:8436}'s camp drop the {quest:3378} page, about one in five: keep the group together here until one drops."] = "{npc:8436}營地的暮光精英會掉落{quest:3378}的書頁，大約五隻掉一張：讓隊伍待在這裡一起打，直到掉出來。",
	["The furnaces and southern ridges"] = "熔爐和南邊的山脊",
	["Thorium Plated Daggers"] = "{item:10551}",
	["grind on {npc:5858}"] = "刷{npc:5858}",
	["{quest:3378}: the page"] = "{quest:3378}：那張書頁",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater"] = {
	["For {npc:7740} in {zone:1457}, on the {zone:1448} guide's {zone:1457} stop: keep it"] = "給{zone:1457}的{npc:7740}，在{zone:1448}指南去{zone:1457}時交：先留著",
	["Level 50"] = "50級",
	["On the ride south, {npc:7771}'s dig camp stands at the {area:1938}: hand him the {item:10556}."] = "往南騎的路上，{npc:7771}的挖掘營地在{area:1938}：把{item:10556}交給他。",
	["Still short of level 50 after the refuge's hand-ins? The next guide opens in {zone:1455} with quests that need level 50: top up on the Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers (48-50) of the eastern jungle, where you took the petals, before you leave the crater."] = "在避難營交完任務還不到50級？下一份指南在{zone:1455}開始，任務需要50級：離開環形山前，在東部叢林（你拿花瓣的地方）打{npc:6509}和血瓣花打穀者（48-50級）補經驗。",
	["The flight lands in {area:976}."] = "飛行降落在{area:976}。",
	["The gorillas on {area:1943} carry the pelts: keep it for the second Un'Goro visit, around 54"] = "{area:1943}上的猩猩身上有毛皮：留到約54級第二次來安戈洛時再做",
	["{npc:7771}'s next task, Into the Depths, is inside the {area:1417}: skip it."] = "{npc:7771}的下一個任務「深入深處」在{area:1417}裡面：跳過。",
	["{npc:7771}'s {item:10556} stands in {area:392}: fly there first, then on to {area:976}."] = "{npc:7771}的{item:10556}在{area:392}：先飛去那裡，再前往{area:976}。",
	["{npc:9272}, {npc:9271}, {npc:9270} and {npc:9618} have quests among mobs of 51-55: leave them for the later Un'Goro visit, at about 54."] = "{npc:9272}、{npc:9271}、{npc:9270}和{npc:9618}的任務都在51-55級的怪物之間：留到約54級第二次來安戈洛時再做。",
	["{quest:3444} stands on the hill just south-west of the flight master."] = "{quest:3444}在飛行管理員西南方不遠的山丘上。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes"] = {
	["A {zone:1419} mob dropped a {item:8244}: Kum'isha pays for it too."] = "有{zone:1419}的怪掉了{item:8244}：庫米沙也收這個。",
	["Back north into {area:1438}: Connar, then Danneth again once he is home. {npc:3546} takes his scales here too."] = "往北回{area:1438}：先找康納，等丹涅斯到家後再找他一次。{npc:3546}也在這裡收他的鱗片。",
	["Back to Truesong at {area:3137}: {zone:1448}, the next guide, is a short ride west."] = "回{area:3137}找真歌：下一份指南{zone:1448}往西騎一小段就到。",
	["For {npc:10838} at {area:3197}, the next stop"] = "給{area:3197}的{npc:10838}，下一站",
	["For {npc:34365} in Alterac, on the Western & {zone:1423} guide's ride to {area:3197}: keep it"] = "給奧特蘭克的{npc:34365}，在西瘟疫與{zone:1423}指南騎往{area:3197}的路上交：先留著",
	["Gammerita need not die: target her and use the {item:9328}. She is a level 48 elite, so keep your distance.\nGammerita walks the {zone:1425} shore below the {area:307}, from the arrow south to about 75,66 and north to about 82,52: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the shore."] = "加莫里塔不用殺：選中她並使用{item:9328}。她是48級精英，所以保持距離。\n加莫里塔在{area:307}下方的{zone:1425}海岸走動，從箭頭處往南到約75,66、往北到約82,52：她不在箭頭處的話，就沿著海岸找。",
	["Open the {item:10569} from {zone:1427} for its {item:10575}, then tell {npc:9459} you bring proof of your deeds: no drake to fight.\nCareful: Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams the hills around {npc:9459}'s cave: if he is about, wait for him to pass."] = "打開{zone:1427}拿到的{item:10569}取出{item:10575}，然後告訴{npc:9459}你帶來了證明：不用打龍。\n小心：沃爾查（60級，稀有火元素）在{npc:9459}洞穴周圍的丘陵遊蕩：他在附近的話，等他走過去。",
	["Ride back south into the {zone:1419} for the bloodmages' beasts: Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills south of the bloodmages' camp, Scorpok Stingers scuttle across the middle of the north and {npc:5982} vultures circle over all of it. Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of the keep.\nCareful: two elites roam here: {npc:221740} (50) in the middle of the zone around 44,34, and {npc:247015} (55) on the ridge around 39,32. When you see one, hunt somewhere else.\nCareful: {npc:8301} (53, a rare scorpid) walks the north around 47,36, {npc:8298} (54, rare) the middle around 45,48, and Snickerfang Matriarchs (60) roam the ground east of here, between Kum'isha's hill and the {area:1440} (about 54-62, 31-47): give them room.\nAny mob here may drop a {item:8244}: keep it for Kum'isha."] = "往南騎回{zone:1419}打血法師要的野獸：{npc:5984}在血法師營地南邊的乾燥丘陵遊蕩，{npc:5988}在北半部中間爬來爬去，{npc:5982}禿鷲在整片上空盤旋。{npc:5992}和紅石蜥蜴一起在要塞西南的山坡上。\n小心：這裡有兩隻精英在遊蕩：{npc:221740}（50級）在地區中部約44,34，{npc:247015}（55級）在約39,32的山脊上。看到其中一隻就換個地方打。\n小心：{npc:8301}（53級，稀有蠍子）在北邊約47,36走動，{npc:8298}（54級，稀有）在中部約45,48，{npc:272386}（60級）在這裡東邊、庫米沙的山丘和{area:1440}之間（約54-62, 31-47）遊蕩：離牠們遠一點。\n這裡任何怪都可能掉{item:8244}：留著給庫米沙。",
	["Ride east from Kum'isha's hill to the mouth of the {area:1440} caverns, due south of {area:1438}: Danneth hides just inside.\nCareful: Snickerfang Matriarchs (60) roam the ground between Kum'isha's hill and the caverns: watch for them on the ride and go round them, there and back.\nCareful: Shadowsworn Cultists, Thugs and Adepts (51-52) guard the caves, and the deeper chambers hold {npc:7728} (55, elite) and {npc:7666} (58, elite): stay near the mouth, pull one at a time, and lead Danneth straight out.\nWalk him out of the caves and north to {area:1438}: Connar takes him there."] = "從庫米沙的山丘往東騎到{area:1440}洞穴口，在{area:1438}正南方：丹涅斯就躲在入口裡面。\n小心：{npc:272386}（60級）在庫米沙的山丘和洞穴之間遊蕩：騎過去時留意牠們、繞開，去程回程都一樣。\n小心：{npc:6004}、影誓暴徒和侍僧（51-52級）守著洞穴，更深的洞室有{npc:7728}（55級，精英）和{npc:7666}（58級，精英）：待在洞口附近，一次拉一隻，帶著丹涅斯直接出來。\n帶他走出洞穴、往北到{area:1438}：康納在那裡接他。",
	["Ride west out of the keep to the bloodmages' camp beside the road into the {zone:1419}."] = "往西騎出要塞，到通往{zone:1419}的道路旁的血法師營地。",
	["Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls (50) roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.\nCareful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.\nCareful: The {npc:10411} (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts."] = "{npc:1783}和{npc:1791}（50級）在營地北邊的田野遊蕩；這裡所有的天譴軍都會掉天譴石。\n小心：這些不死生物很遠就會發現你，拉一隻時附近的其他不死生物也會加入。\n小心：{npc:10411}（3個重生點，15分鐘重生）脫離戰鬥時會隱形，戰鬥一開始就會叫來{npc:10408}。",
	["The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side.\nCareful: the Firegut Ogres are 50 and the Ogre Mages 51, but the Brutes on the rock's east side are 52: take the ogres on the near side first and pull the Brutes one at a time.\nCareful: Escaped Core Hounds (level 60) roam the Steppes, a few on the slopes west and south of {area:249}: pull the ogres on the rock itself and look around before each pull.\nCareful: the Firegut chiefs {npc:9602} and {npc:9604} (54) stand on the rock's east side among the Brutes: leave them be."] = "火腹巨魔佔據崗哨北邊的大石頭，火腹蠻卒在它的東側。\n小心：{npc:7033}是50級、火腹巨魔法師51級，但石頭東側的蠻卒是52級：先打近側的巨魔，蠻卒一次拉一隻。\n小心：{npc:227746}（60級）在燃燒平原遊蕩，{area:249}西邊和南邊的山坡上有幾隻：在石頭上面拉巨魔，每次拉怪前先看看四周。\n小心：火腹首領{npc:9602}和{npc:9604}（54級）站在石頭東側的蠻卒之間：別惹他們。",
	["The Spitelash naga of the {area:1221} carry {item:13815}. Tymor's runes stand among the ruins: use his {item:10445} on each."] = "{area:1221}的惡鞭納迦身上有{item:13815}。泰摩爾的符文立在廢墟之間：對每一個使用他的{item:10445}。",
	["The Spitelash naga of these ruins drop Truesong's Eldarath Relics. {npc:239939} (52) stands in the ruins of Eldarath, south-west of the Myrmidons: pull him alone."] = "這片廢墟的惡鞭納迦會掉真歌要的{item:280608}。{npc:239939}（52級）站在埃達拉斯廢墟裡、侍從的西南方：單獨拉他。",
	["The boat lands in {area:442}: fly straight on to {area:415}. Erelas, Jenal and Gracina take their deliveries on the {zone:1448} guide's {zone:1457} stop, which goes there anyway."] = "船停在{area:442}：直接飛往{area:415}。艾瑞拉斯、耶納爾和格拉希娜的貨，在{zone:1448}指南去{zone:1457}那一站交，反正會經過那裡。",
	["The nearest Mosshoof Coursers graze the hills north-east of the {area:1224}, toward the {area:1219}; a larger herd roams the open ground to the south.\nCareful: the Mosshoof Coursers are 52-53: pull them one at a time from the herd's edge."] = "最近的{npc:8761}在{area:1224}東北方、往{area:1219}方向的丘陵上吃草；更大的一群在南邊的空地遊蕩。\n小心：{npc:8761}是52-53級：從群的邊緣一次拉一隻。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:9461} is a level 54 elite: most classes solo it at level 56, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone."] = "這些是精英怪：建議組隊，找人和你一起做。{npc:9461}是54級精英：大多數職業56級能單挑，但你可能需要幫忙。獨自一人就跳過。",
	["Tymor in {zone:1455}, on the {zone:1422} guide's {zone:1455} stop: keep it"] = "{zone:1455}的泰摩爾，在{zone:1422}指南去{zone:1455}那一站：先留著",
	["Use the {item:12284} on a {npc:7047} on the slopes east of {area:251} just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.\nCareful: a {npc:8981} (level 56, rare) walks the slopes by the broodlings, Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams the hills east of {area:251}, and the {npc:7040} and Wyrmkin around them are elite: use the Incarcinatrix on a broodling at the edge and look around before each pull."] = "在{area:251}東邊山坡上的{npc:7047}快死之前對牠使用{item:12284}，然後拾取牠留下的精華。\n小心：一隻{npc:8981}（56級，稀有）在小龍旁的山坡走動，沃爾查（60級，稀有火元素）在{area:251}東邊的丘陵遊蕩，周圍的{npc:7040}和黑色龍人都是精英：挑邊緣的小龍用，每次拉怪前先看看四周。",
	["Your Hearthstone is set at {zone:1455} (the {zone:1425} guide binds it there): hearth back to the inn from Un'Goro."] = "你的爐石設在{zone:1455}（{zone:1425}指南把它綁在那裡）：從安戈洛用爐石回那裡的旅店。",
	["keep it: the {area:199} cauldron waits for the {zone:1422} guide"] = "先留著：{area:199}的大鍋留給{zone:1422}指南",
	["the {item:9328} on Gammerita: no kill"] = "對加莫里塔使用{item:9328}：不用殺",
	["{item:8244}, a rare drop"] = "{item:8244}，稀有掉落",
	["{npc:10877} rides around the city's ring on his ram: catch him as he passes."] = "{npc:10877}騎著公羊繞著城裡的環狀大道走：等他經過時攔住他。",
	["{npc:11406}: for {npc:8405} in {zone:1447}, at the end of this guide: keep it"] = "{npc:11406}：給本指南最後{zone:1447}的{npc:8405}：先留著",
	["{npc:239822}: {quest:88809}, the relics drop from the naga of the {area:1221} ahead"] = "{npc:239822}：{quest:88809}，遺物由前方{area:1221}的納迦掉落",
	["{npc:239822}: {quest:92345}, for {npc:4217} in {zone:1457}, on the {zone:1448} guide: keep it"] = "{npc:239822}：{quest:92345}，給{zone:1457}的{npc:4217}，在{zone:1448}指南：先留著",
	["{npc:266524}: {npc:266508} is in the {area:1440} caverns, on this loop"] = "{npc:266524}：{npc:266508}在{area:1440}洞穴裡，就在這一圈路線上",
	["{npc:7312}, the mage trainer: for {npc:8395} in {zone:1447}, at the end of this guide: keep it"] = "{npc:7312}，法師訓練師：給本指南最後{zone:1447}的{npc:8395}：先留著",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood"] = {
	["Back to {npc:7775}'s camp, just south-east of {npc:7765}: the {item:11242} buys three Videre Elixirs. Keep them: {npc:9298} takes one at the start of the next guide, and Gaeriyan in {area:976} shows himself only to someone who has drunk one."] = "回到{npc:7775}的營地，就在{npc:7765}東南方不遠：{item:11242}能換三瓶{item:11243}。留著它們：下一份指南一開始{npc:9298}要一瓶，{area:976}的加里楊只對喝過的人現身。",
	["Ends in {area:392}, on the next guide: keep it"] = "在下一份指南的{area:392}結束：先留著",
	["Fandral stands at the top of the druids' building; {npc:4217}, next, is lower down inside it."] = "范達爾站在德魯伊建築的頂層；接下來的{npc:4217}在建築裡比較低的地方。",
	["Fill {item:11682} at the moonwell inside the Temple of the Moon."] = "在月神殿裡的月井裝滿{item:11682}。",
	["For {npc:5594} in {area:976}, on the {zone:1446} and {zone:1452} guide: keep it"] = "給{area:976}的{npc:5594}，在{zone:1446}和{zone:1452}指南：先留著",
	["From {area:3137} ride west along the road past {area:2358}, then north-west into {zone:1448}: the {area:2479} is the druids' camp on the road just past the {zone:1440} border."] = "從{area:3137}沿道路往西騎，經過{area:2358}，再往西北進入{zone:1448}：{area:2479}是德魯伊的營地，就在剛過{zone:1440}邊界的路上。",
	["Keep it: {npc:7775} in {zone:1444}, later in this guide, brews the elixir"] = "先留著：本指南稍後{zone:1444}的{npc:7775}會調製藥劑",
	["Only if the Timbermaw are already Neutral to you: the Deadwood furbolgs drop a {quest:8470} about one kill in thirty, and {npc:11558} just inside {area:1769} takes it. Below Neutral the quest is refused: it needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "只有木喉對你已經是中立時才做：死木熊怪大約每三十隻掉一個{quest:8470}，{area:1769}入口內的{npc:11558}收它。還不到中立會被拒絕：要木喉中立；聲望指南會帶你達到。",
	["Portal to {zone:1438}"] = "前往{zone:1438}的傳送門",
	["Ride east along the road to {area:489}, on the {zone:1441} border: the next guide flies from there."] = "沿道路往東騎到{zone:1441}邊界的{area:489}：下一份指南從那裡起飛。",
	["Ride north-east from the dock past the {area:1119} to {npc:7775}'s camp. He brews the {item:11243} from an {item:11242}: take his errand for one."] = "從碼頭往東北騎，經過{area:1119}到{npc:7775}的營地。他用{item:11242}調製{item:11243}：接他的任務換一瓶。",
	["Ride south to {npc:9298}'s camp beside the hot springs."] = "往南騎到溫泉旁{npc:9298}的營地。",
	["Step into the cave: {npc:11558} stands just inside. She needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "走進洞穴：{npc:11558}就站在入口內。她要木喉中立；聲望指南會帶你達到。",
	["Take the boat to the mainland: {npc:14637} waits on the dock where it lands."] = "搭船到大陸：{npc:14637}在船停靠的碼頭上等你。",
	["The Chillwind horns come on the next guide's {zone:1452} loop: keep it"] = "寒風之角在下一份指南的{zone:1452}那一圈拿：先留著",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs live in the village just south-west of {npc:11554}; keep the Deadwood Headdress Feathers they drop: {npc:11554} and {npc:15395} each take five."] = "死木熊怪住在{npc:11554}西南方不遠的村子裡；留著牠們掉的{item:21377}：{npc:11554}和{npc:15395}各要五根。",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs of {area:1762} fill the hills west of the cave.\nCareful: Den Watchers are level 53-54 and the Avengers 54-55; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%."] = "{area:1762}的死木熊怪佈滿洞穴西邊的丘陵。\n小心：巢穴看守者是53-54級、復仇者54-55級；血量低於50%時會呼叫25碼內的同伴，低於15%時會逃跑求救。",
	["The Sea Sprays (46-47) wash along the shore just south of the dock: they drop the Water Elemental Cores as well as the Sea Elementals (47) do. The Wave and Deep Striders (47) wade in the water off the same beach: zap them with {item:18904} first, and shrunken they lose their elite strength.\nThe Ultra-Shrinker lasts two hours: hand both quests back to {npc:14637} before you leave the coast."] = "{npc:5462}（46-47級）沿著碼頭南邊不遠的岸邊沖刷：牠們和{npc:5461}（47級）一樣會掉{item:18958}。波濤巨人和{npc:5360}（47級）在同一片海灘外的水裡走動：先用{item:18904}電牠們，縮小後就失去精英的力量。\n超級縮小器持續兩小時：離開海岸前把兩個任務都交回給{npc:14637}。",
	["The vial is filled in {zone:1457}, later in this guide: keep it; inside"] = "小瓶要在本指南稍後的{zone:1457}裝滿：先留著；在裡面",
	["The {area:2479} is the druids' camp by the road in southern {zone:1448}."] = "{area:2479}是{zone:1448}南部路旁的德魯伊營地。",
	["Walk through {area:1769}'s tunnel to its {zone:1452} end."] = "穿過{area:1769}的隧道走到{zone:1452}那一端。",
	["{area:1763} is the ruined temple north of the glen.\nCareful: the {npc:11141} (53, elite) haunts the west end of {area:1763}, around 35,60: work the south-east, where the arrow points, and pull the cultists and hounds away from him."] = "{area:1763}是山谷北邊那座毀壞的神殿。\n小心：{npc:11141}（53級，精英）在{area:1763}西端約35,60遊蕩：在箭頭指的東南邊打，把教徒和獵犬拉離他。",
	["{npc:11138}, the Alliance flight master"] = "{npc:11138}，聯盟的飛行管理員",
	["{npc:11556} stands at the {zone:1452} end of the tunnel"] = "{npc:11556}站在隧道的{zone:1452}那一端",
	["{npc:3516}, upstairs"] = "{npc:3516}，在樓上",
	["{npc:4090}, in the Temple of the Moon: {quest:3378}, from the {zone:1427}"] = "{npc:4090}，在月神殿：{quest:3378}，來自{zone:1427}",
	["{npc:4217}'s next task grows ten {item:11040} from a pouch over several hours: skip it."] = "{npc:4217}的下一個任務要用一個袋子花好幾個小時種出十個{item:11040}：跳過。",
	["{npc:7740} stands beside Tyrande in the Temple of the Moon."] = "{npc:7740}站在月神殿裡泰蘭妲旁邊。",
	["{npc:7916}: the wildkin feathers lie along {zone:1452}'s road, on the next guide; {npc:7916} takes them on the Plaguelands guide's way through: keep it"] = "{npc:7916}：梟獸羽毛在下一份指南{zone:1452}的道路沿途；{npc:7916}會在瘟疫之地指南經過時收：先留著",
	["{npc:7916}: {quest:3661}, the feathers from the {zone:1425}"] = "{npc:7916}：{quest:3661}，羽毛來自{zone:1425}",
	["{npc:9047} waits in the {area:1658}, west of the druids' building."] = "{npc:9047}在{area:1658}，德魯伊建築的西邊。",
	["{npc:9047}, in the {area:1658}: {quest:3764}"] = "{npc:9047}，在{area:1658}：{quest:3764}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring"] = {
	["Back into {area:1770}: the succubus {npc:9518} (56) waits on the way to its deepest chamber, with Trey Lightforge's remains beside her.\nCareful: {npc:9518} is level 56: clear the cultists around her first and fight her at full health."] = "回到{area:1770}：魅魔{npc:9518}（56級）在往最深洞室的路上，特雷·萊弗治的遺骸就在她旁邊。\n小心：{npc:9518}是56級：先清掉她周圍的教徒，滿血再打她。",
	["Back north through {area:1769}'s tunnel to {npc:9298}."] = "往北穿過{area:1769}的隧道回{npc:9298}那裡。",
	["Back through the tunnel to {zone:1448} and south past {area:1998}: the {quest:5086} (53) roam the north-eastern tip of {area:1767}."] = "穿過隧道回{zone:1448}，往南經過{area:1998}：{quest:5086}（53級）在{area:1767}東北角遊蕩。",
	["Back west to {npc:10302} at the hot springs."] = "往西回溫泉找{npc:10302}。",
	["Check the two outdoor Matriarchs (56) on the western slope of the yetis' hills. Leave the Patriarchs (57) and the cave alone. If you don't get both horns on this pass, skip the hunt and Umi's hand-in."] = "看看雪人丘陵西坡上兩隻在外面的冰薊雪人女王（56級）。別碰冰薊雪人王（57級）和洞穴。這一趟沒拿到兩支角的話，就放棄這次狩獵和烏米的任務。",
	["Ends with {npc:9298} in {zone:1452}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "本指南稍後在{zone:1452}的{npc:9298}那裡結束：先留著",
	["Fly from {area:976} to {area:541}. {npc:9997}'s friend {npc:9999} has gone missing; {npc:8737} stands at the back of the refuge, with {npc:9117} in the cave behind him; {npc:9618} stands just outside, on the way out east."] = "從{area:976}飛到{area:541}。{npc:9997}的朋友{npc:9999}失蹤了；{npc:8737}站在避難營深處，{npc:9117}在他身後的洞穴裡；{npc:9618}就站在營地外面，往東出去的路上。",
	["For Greta in {zone:1448}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "給本指南稍後{zone:1448}的格雷塔：先留著",
	["For {npc:11558} in {area:1769}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "給本指南稍後{area:1769}的{npc:11558}：先留著",
	["For {npc:9116} in {zone:1448}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "給本指南稍後{zone:1448}的{npc:9116}：先留著",
	["Loot the horns from Ice Thistle Matriarchs"] = "從{npc:7459}身上拿角",
	["Moontouched Feathers lie on the ground all along the road west to {npc:9298}, where the Ragged Owlbeasts (53) roam: pick them up as you ride.\nThe same road crosses the Rogue Ice Thistles' ground (about one in three drops a {item:12366} for Umi) and the Fledgling Chillwinds' (about one in five drops an {item:12444} for {npc:10468}): work both here, around the road's middle.\nCareful: both are 53-55: pull the lower ones and take them one at a time."] = "往西到{npc:9298}的整條路上，地上都散落著{item:12383}，{npc:7450}（53級）在那裡遊蕩：邊騎邊撿。\n同一條路會經過{npc:7457}的地盤（大約三隻掉一個{item:12366}，給烏米）和{npc:7447}的地盤（大約五隻掉一個{item:12444}，給{npc:10468}）：在道路中段一起打。\n小心：兩種都是53-55級：挑等級低的，一次拉一隻。",
	["North-east from the pylon to {area:543}: {npc:10302} the goblin sits by the water."] = "從水晶塔往東北到{area:543}：哥布林{npc:10302}坐在水邊。",
	["Pestlezugg's next task, Pawn Captures Queen, sends you back to the {npc:10041} in the {area:540}: skip it."] = "匹斯特蘇格的下一個任務「兵卒捉后」要你回{area:540}找{npc:10041}：跳過。",
	["Ride back north up the valley and west along the road to the tunnel at {zone:1452}'s western end, where Salfa stands. Walk into {area:1769} and take the {area:493} branch of the tunnel down to {area:493}. {npc:10897}, {area:493}'s flight master, stands south of the lake, outside {area:2361}: learn the flight path from him. The flight master in {area:2361} itself flies only Druids, from her gossip, and has no flight path to learn. The next guide flies on from here."] = "沿山谷往北騎回去，再沿道路往西到{zone:1452}西端的隧道，薩爾法站在那裡。走進{area:1769}，走隧道往{area:493}的那一條岔路下到{area:493}。{area:493}的飛行管理員{npc:10897}站在湖南邊、{area:2361}外面：跟他學飛行路線。{area:2361}裡面那位飛行管理員只透過對話載德魯伊，也沒有飛行路線可學。下一份指南從這裡繼續飛。",
	["Ride back north-west to {area:2253} on its hill: {npc:11079} and {npc:10301} stand together."] = "往西北騎回山丘上的{area:2253}：{npc:11079}和{npc:10301}站在一起。",
	["Ride north up the road to the cave mouth of {area:1769}."] = "沿道路往北騎到{area:1769}的洞口。",
	["Ride on to {npc:9298}'s camp beside the hot springs."] = "繼續騎到溫泉旁{npc:9298}的營地。",
	["Ride south from the cave to {area:1998}, the night elves' camp on the road."] = "從洞穴往南騎到{area:1998}，路上的夜精靈營地。",
	["Ride south-east from {area:2255} down the valley to {npc:10301}'s damaged crate in the snow at {area:2245}, with his wrecked wagon just east of it."] = "從{area:2255}往東南沿山谷騎到{area:2245}雪地上{npc:10301}損壞的箱子，他翻覆的馬車就在它東邊不遠。",
	["Still short of Thick Yeti Furs or Uncracked Chillwind Horns? The Rogue Ice Thistles and the Fledgling Chillwinds (both 53-55) live along the road west of {area:2255}, toward {npc:9298}. The hills east of {area:2255} hold only the Ice Thistle Yetis (55-56), Matriarchs and Patriarchs, and the Chillwind Chimaeras (55-57) and Ravagers (57-59): don't hunt the furs and horns there."] = "{item:12366}或{item:12444}還不夠？{npc:7457}和{npc:7447}（都是53-55級）住在{area:2255}西邊往{npc:9298}的路上。{area:2255}東邊的丘陵只有{npc:7458}（55-56級）、冰薊雪人女王和冰薊雪人王，以及{npc:7448}（55-57級）和冰風劫毀者（57-59級）：別去那裡找毛皮和角。",
	["The Deadwood cauldron in {area:1762}, at the {zone:1448} end of the tunnel"] = "{area:1762}的死木大鍋，在隧道的{zone:1448}那一端",
	["The Deadwood cauldron stands at the top of {area:1762}, just west of the cave mouth."] = "死木大鍋在{area:1762}最上面，就在洞口西邊。",
	["The flight lands in {area:2255}: {npc:11754} and Umi stand around the town before you ride west."] = "飛行降落在{area:2255}：騎往西邊之前，{npc:11754}和烏米都在城鎮附近。",
	["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. {npc:9166} circle the slopes around it: they count for {npc:9997}.\nCareful: {npc:6584} (60), a rare devilsaur, roams the crater's west around 27,46: if you meet him, ride away."] = "水晶塔在避難營東邊的山坡上。{npc:9166}在周圍的山坡盤旋：殺牠們算{npc:9997}的任務。\n小心：{npc:6584}（60級，稀有魔暴龍）在環形山西部約27,46遊蕩：遇到他就騎走。",
	["The relics are in the ruins just south of {quest:5250}"] = "遺物在{quest:5250}南邊不遠的廢墟裡",
	["The road to {area:2255}: furs and horns"] = "往{area:2255}的路：毛皮和角",
	["The road west: feathers, furs and horns"] = "往西的路：羽毛、毛皮和角",
	["The ruins lie around the frozen lake south of {area:2253}. Pick up the four relic fragments lying in the ruins: {npc:10304} in the {zone:1423} takes them, on the next guide."] = "廢墟在{area:2253}南邊結冰的湖周圍。撿起廢墟裡的四塊遺物碎片：下一份指南裡{zone:1423}的{npc:10304}會收。",
	["The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between {npc:9298} and the tunnel. Any furbolg here can drop an {item:12771} (about one in ten: it comes within the kills these quests need): right-click it. They also drop Winterfall Ritual Totems (about one in thirty) and {item:14047}, which only matter if you are Neutral (the totem) or Friendly ({npc:11557}'s {item:14047}) with the Timbermaw: keep them then.\nCareful: the Pathfinders are 53 and the Totemics 54, but the Den Watchers inside the camp are 55: take the camp from its edge and pull one at a time."] = "西邊的冬泉營地在{npc:9298}和隧道之間的丘陵上。這裡任何熊怪都可能掉{item:12771}（大約十隻一個：這些任務要殺的數量內就會拿到）：右鍵點它。牠們也會掉{quest:8471}（大約三十隻一個）和{item:14047}，只有你跟木喉是中立（圖騰）或友善（{npc:11557}要的{item:14047}）時才有用：那時再留著。\n小心：探路者是53級、圖騰師54級，但營地裡面的巢穴看守者是55級：從營地邊緣打，一次拉一隻。",
	["The {quest:5086} are just back through the tunnel, in {zone:1448}"] = "{quest:5086}就在隧道另一頭的{zone:1448}",
	["The {quest:5087} (57) carry their crates along the road between {area:2246} and {zone:1448}'s tunnel.\nCareful: Turning in spawns three or four level 56-57 Winterfall ambushers that attack you; you can escape them while mounted, in stealth or with {spell:5384}, and they then gather by the lake so you can take the next quest.\nCareful: the {quest:5087} are 57, over you here: pull one at a time, away from the camp."] = "{quest:5087}（57級）帶著箱子在{area:2246}和{zone:1448}隧道之間的路上走。\n小心：繳交時會跳出三、四個56-57級的冬泉伏擊者攻擊你；騎著坐騎、潛行或用{spell:5384}都能甩掉他們，之後他們會聚到湖邊，你就能接下一個任務。\n小心：{quest:5087}是57級，在這裡比你高：一次拉一隻，遠離營地。",
	["Through {area:1769}'s tunnel to its {zone:1452} end."] = "穿過{area:1769}的隧道走到{zone:1452}那一端。",
	["Through {area:1769}'s tunnel, just north of {npc:9298}, to {zone:1448}."] = "穿過{npc:9298}正北邊{area:1769}的隧道，到{zone:1448}。",
	["Umi's next task scares three goblins in {area:2255}, {area:976} and Un'Goro, behind the route now: skip it."] = "烏米的下一個任務要去嚇{area:2255}、{area:976}和安戈洛的三個哥布林，都已經在路線後面了：跳過。",
	["West across the south of the crater: Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from the Diemetradons. The expedition's {item:11112} lies in the south-west jungle.\nCareful: Gruff (57), a rare devilsaur, prowls the south around 38,75: if you meet him, ride away."] = "往西穿過環形山南部：{item:11114}散落在西南部地上的劍龍之間：劍龍是精英，在牠們周圍撿骨頭，其餘的從異齒龍身上拿。探險隊的{item:11112}在西南部的叢林裡。\n小心：稀有魔暴龍格魯夫（57級）在南部約38,75徘徊：遇到他就騎走。",
	["With the {item:11243} from Gregan"] = "帶著格雷甘給的{item:11243}",
	["{area:1769}, {zone:1448} side"] = "{area:1769}，{zone:1448}那一側",
	["{area:1770} is the cave at the back of {area:1763}, west of the road. Use the {item:12906} on the four braziers inside.\nCareful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in large linked groups, many with stuns: pull at the edge of each group and fight one pack at a time.\nThe Jaedenar Darkweavers, Warlocks and Enforcers in here drop a {item:13140}, about one kill in thirty: keep killing them until it drops. It opens the cell of {npc:11018}, the night elf held in the cave."] = "{area:1770}是{area:1763}後方、道路西邊的洞穴。對裡面的四個火盆使用{item:12906}。\n小心：洞裡滿是53-55級的暗影議會怪，常常一大群連在一起，很多會擊暈：在每一群的邊緣拉，一次打一群。\n這裡的{npc:7118}、術士和執行者會掉{item:13140}，大約三十隻一個：一直打到掉出來。它能打開關在洞裡的夜精靈{npc:11018}的牢房。",
	["{item:11515}, from the same cultists: {npc:9528} takes six by the Sanctuary if you did Cleansing Felwood"] = "{item:11515}，同一批教徒掉落：做過「淨化費伍德」的話，聖所旁的{npc:9528}收六個",
	["{item:12366}, from the Rogue Ice Thistles"] = "{item:12366}，{npc:7457}掉落",
	["{item:12444}, from the Fledgling Chillwinds"] = "{item:12444}，{npc:7447}掉落",
	["{item:14047}, for {npc:11557}, if you are Friendly with the Timbermaw"] = "{item:14047}，給{npc:11557}，要你跟木喉是友善",
	["{npc:10305}: the Rogue Ice Thistles on the road west carry the furs"] = "{npc:10305}：西邊道路上的{npc:7457}身上有毛皮",
	["{npc:10431}: keep it for the Plaguelands, on the next guide; inside"] = "{npc:10431}：留給下一份指南的瘟疫之地；在裡面",
	["{npc:10924}: for {npc:11079} in {area:2253}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{npc:10924}：給本指南稍後{area:2253}的{npc:11079}；先留著",
	["{npc:11557}, just inside the cave beside {npc:11558}, takes thirty {quest:6031} from Friendly with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "{npc:11557}在洞穴入口內{npc:11558}旁邊，木喉友善起收三十份{quest:6031}；聲望指南會帶你達到。",
	["{npc:11558} stands just inside the {area:1769} cave: she needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "{npc:11558}站在{area:1769}洞穴入口內：她要木喉中立；聲望指南會帶你達到。",
	["{npc:11558} takes the totem; the quest needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "{npc:11558}收圖騰；任務要木喉中立；聲望指南會帶你達到。",
	["{npc:11754}, for {npc:9298}: walks around {area:2255}, look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:11754}，給{npc:9298}：在{area:2255}到處走，看地圖上的圓圈裡面",
	["{npc:11755}: for {npc:10301} in {area:2253}, just back up the road"] = "{npc:11755}：給{area:2253}的{npc:10301}，沿路回去不遠",
	["{npc:5594}, inside"] = "{npc:5594}，在裡面",
	["{npc:5901} stands on the coast south-east of town."] = "{npc:5901}站在城鎮東南方的海岸上。",
	["{npc:7771}'s next task, Into the Depths, is inside the {area:1417}: skip it."] = "{npc:7771}的下一個任務「深入深處」在{area:1417}裡面：跳過。",
	["{npc:7876}, north side of town: the tar is in Un'Goro"] = "{npc:7876}，在城鎮北邊：焦油在安戈洛",
	["{npc:8496}: the ash is in Un'Goro; inside"] = "{npc:8496}：灰燼在安戈洛；在裡面",
	["{npc:8737} in {area:541}, Un'Goro: keep it"] = "安戈洛{area:541}的{npc:8737}：先留著",
	["{npc:9116}'s next task, Silver Heart, sends you to the Irontree Stompers in the north and back here: skip it."] = "{npc:9116}的下一個任務「白銀之心」要你去北邊打{npc:7139}再回來：跳過。",
	["{npc:9116}'s next task, {npc:222647}, ends with {npc:3848} at {area:2358}, south of the route once {zone:1448} is done: skip it."] = "{npc:9116}的下一個任務「{npc:222647}」在{zone:1448}做完後、路線南邊{area:2358}的{npc:3848}那裡結束：跳過。",
	["{npc:9298} camps beside the hot springs at the western end of the road."] = "{npc:9298}在道路西端的溫泉旁紮營。",
	["{npc:9299}, at the graveyard just east of {area:976}, later in this guide"] = "{npc:9299}，在{area:976}東邊不遠的墓地，本指南稍後",
	["{npc:9528} is in the ruins just down the road from the Sanctuary: he takes the six Corrupted Soul Shards (from both trips into {area:1770}) on the spot."] = "{npc:9528}在聖所沿路往下不遠的廢墟裡：當場收下六個{item:11515}（兩趟{area:1770}拿到的）。",
	["{npc:9684}'s lair lies in the jungle north of {npc:9619}, below the eastern cliffs: use {item:11568} there.\nCareful: {npc:9684} is level 56, a level or two over you here: start at full health, and clear the raptors around the lair first."] = "{npc:9684}的巢穴在{npc:9619}北邊的叢林裡、東邊懸崖下方：在那裡使用{item:11568}。\n小心：{npc:9684}是56級，在這裡比你高一兩級：滿血再開始，先清掉巢穴周圍的迅猛龍。",
	["{npc:9861} and {npc:9860} guard {npc:9517} in {area:1770}'s deepest chamber, just past {npc:9518}.\nCareful: The three bosses fight as a group. Kill the nearby mobs first so you don't pull extra enemies."] = "{npc:9861}和{npc:9860}守著{area:1770}最深洞室的{npc:9517}，就在{npc:9518}過去一點。\n小心：三個首領會一起打。先殺掉附近的怪，免得多拉到敵人。",
	["{quest:3444} stands on the hill just south-west of the flight master."] = "{quest:3444}在飛行管理員西南方不遠的山丘上。",
	["{quest:5085}: {npc:9298}, on this guide's {zone:1452} loop: keep it"] = "{quest:5085}：{npc:9298}，在本指南{zone:1452}那一圈：先留著",
	["{quest:5242} is a group quest at this level: {npc:9861} (52), {npc:9860} (54) and {npc:9517} (57) fight together at the back of {area:1770}. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip it if you are alone."] = "這個等級的{quest:5242}是組隊任務：{npc:9861}（52級）、{npc:9860}（54級）和{npc:9517}（57級）在{area:1770}深處一起打。建議組隊，找人和你一起做。獨自一人就跳過。",
	["{quest:980}' follow-up, Strange Sources, is at {area:2256}'s mouth among elite giants and Hederine: skip it."] = "{quest:980}的後續「奇怪的源頭」在{area:2256}入口，周圍有精英巨人和赫德琳：跳過。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands"] = {
	["Arbington's next task goes to {area:976}, behind the route now: skip it."] = "阿爾比頓的下一個任務要去{area:976}，已經在路線後面了：跳過。",
	["Back east to {npc:11063} at the chapel."] = "往東回禮拜堂找{npc:11063}。",
	["Back to the camp: Valorfist, then {npc:11053} beside him."] = "回營地：先找瓦羅菲斯特，再找他旁邊的{npc:11053}。",
	["Back to {area:3197}."] = "回{area:3197}。",
	["Back to {npc:11063} at {area:2268} with your group."] = "跟隊伍一起回{area:2268}找{npc:11063}。",
	["Careful: Scarlet Paladins (55-56) and priests guard {item:12954} inside {area:190}'s town hall. They are elite, and a {npc:1839} (63, elite) stands near the book. Go in with your group; stay out of the Clerist's reach."] = "小心：{npc:1834}（55-56級）和牧師守著{area:190}鎮公所裡的{item:12954}。他們是精英，書旁邊還站著一個{npc:1839}（63級，精英）。跟隊伍一起進去；別進到高階牧師打得到的範圍。",
	["Close enough to see the Blightcaller in front of the house"] = "近到可以看見房子前面的凋零者",
	["Cross the river south-east to the {area:2261}, the crypt in the south-west of the zone.\nCareful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot."] = "往東南過河到{area:2261}，地區西南部的地穴。\n小心：米庫提奧會帶大約四隻非精英小怪一起來。牠們是走到墳墓那裡，不是當場出現。",
	["Cross the river west to {npc:1855}'s hut.\nCareful: the short way from {area:2627} to {npc:1855} is the {area:2626}, whose south mouth opens by his hut: Crypt Fiends, Walkers, Horrors and Slayers (53-58) stand close together inside. Pull them one at a time, or ride round by the road outside it."] = "往西過河到{npc:1855}的小屋。\n小心：從{area:2627}到{npc:1855}的捷徑是{area:2626}，它的南口就開在他的小屋旁：裡面的{npc:8555}、地穴巡邏者、地穴恐魔和地穴屠戮者（53-58級）站得很近。一次拉一隻，或從外面的路繞過去。",
	["Dumah's next task sets a barrel down at Northridge, behind you now: skip it."] = "杜馬的下一個任務要在北谷放一個桶子，已經在你後面了：跳過。",
	["Emma's charm goes back to {npc:10778} in the {zone:1422}, behind you now: skip it."] = "艾瑪的護身符要拿回{zone:1422}給{npc:10778}，已經在你後面了：跳過。",
	["Emma's charm goes back to {npc:10778} in the {zone:1422}, out of the way now: skip it."] = "艾瑪的護身符要拿回{zone:1422}給{npc:10778}，現在不順路：跳過。",
	["Fandral stands at the top of the druids' building of the {area:1658}; {npc:4217}, next, is lower down inside it."] = "范達爾站在{area:1658}德魯伊建築的頂層；接下來的{npc:4217}在建築裡比較低的地方。",
	["Fly to {zone:1453} for Highlord Bolvar's errand for SI:7 and {npc:10778}'s parcel, then straight back."] = "飛到{zone:1453}做伯瓦爾大領主給軍情七處的任務、交{npc:10778}的包裹，然後直接飛回來。",
	["Follow the southern road east out of the {zone:1422}."] = "沿南邊的道路往東離開{zone:1422}。",
	["Highlord Bolvar in {zone:1453}, on the way out of this guide"] = "{zone:1453}的伯瓦爾大領主，在離開本指南的路上",
	["No {quest:5401} yet? Pureheart gives you one here: the scourgestone quests need it."] = "還沒有{quest:5401}？普爾哈特在這裡給你一份：天譴石任務要用到它。",
	["North to {npc:10667} in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal."] = "往北到安多哈爾西邊那間毀壞的旅店找{npc:10667}。",
	["On the road east out of {area:3197}, {npc:10927}'s farmhouse stands on {area:197}: her {quest:5142} goes to the ghost in {area:2262}, the next stop."] = "從{area:3197}往東的路上，{npc:10927}的農舍在{area:197}：她的{quest:5142}要交給下一站{area:2262}的鬼魂。",
	["Ride back south from {area:200} to the camp."] = "從{area:200}往南騎回營地。",
	["Ride back south to {area:3197}."] = "往南騎回{area:3197}。",
	["Ride back west along the road to {npc:10927}'s farmhouse; {npc:10936}'s monument is just north of it."] = "沿道路往西騎回{npc:10927}的農舍；{npc:10936}的紀念碑就在它北邊不遠。",
	["Ride east along the southern road across the {zone:1423} to {area:2268}: Plaguehound Runts and Plaguebats roam beside it.\nCareful: Gargantuan Plaguebats (60) fly among the smaller bats near the western border: take the Plaguebats of your level."] = "沿南邊的道路往東穿過{zone:1423}到{area:2268}：{npc:8596}和{npc:8600}在路旁遊蕩。\n小心：{npc:272342}（60級）在西邊邊界附近，混在小蝙蝠之間飛：打跟你同等級的{npc:8600}。",
	["Ride east into the {zone:1423}: the {area:2260} is the farm north of the southern road, north-west of {area:2262}. The three agents' remains are bone outlines on the ground: one by the road south of the farm, one on the hill east of the house, one on the mound in front of it.\nCareful: {npc:11878} (level 62 elite) and his elite hounds stand in front of the house: take the remains on the mound from the side and do not pull him. You don't have to fight him."] = "往東騎進{zone:1423}：{area:2260}是南邊道路北側、{area:2262}西北方的農場。三位特務的遺骸是地上的骨頭輪廓：一個在農場南邊的路旁，一個在房子東邊的山丘上，一個在房子前面的土堆上。\n小心：{npc:11878}（62級精英）和他的精英獵犬站在房子前面：從側面拿土堆上的遺骸，別把他拉過來。你不用跟他打。",
	["Ride east to the border river: {npc:1855} lives in a small hut on the bank. His hunts are in the {area:2277} and {area:2627}, at the end of this guide's ride east."] = "往東騎到邊界的河邊：{npc:1855}住在岸邊的小屋裡。他要的獵物在{area:2277}和{area:2627}，本指南往東騎到最後就會去。",
	["Ride north from {area:271} into Alterac and west to the walls of {area:279}: {npc:34365} stands outside them."] = "從{area:271}往北騎進奧特蘭克，再往西到{area:279}的城牆：{npc:34365}站在牆外。",
	["Ride north-west to the Dalson farm. The diary lies in the barn; a wandering skeleton carries the outhouse key, and {npc:10836} waits in the outhouse with the cabinet key. {npc:11152} stands just south-west of the farmhouse, and its Cauldron Lord beside it carries the key."] = "往西北騎到達爾松農場。日記在穀倉裡；一具到處走的骷髏身上有廁所的鑰匙，{npc:10836}在廁所裡，身上有櫃子的鑰匙。{npc:11152}在農舍西南方不遠，旁邊的大鍋領主身上有鑰匙。",
	["Ride south from {npc:1855}'s hut to {area:201}. {npc:11078} (58) guards the cauldron.\nCareful: Soulwrath is level 58, a level over you here: clear the ghouls around the cauldron first and pull him alone."] = "從{npc:1855}的小屋往南騎到{area:201}。{npc:11078}（58級）守著大鍋。\n小心：魂怒是58級，在這裡比你高一級：先清掉大鍋周圍的食屍鬼，再單獨拉他。",
	["Ride south-west through the {zone:1422} to {area:3197}."] = "往西南穿過{zone:1422}到{area:3197}。",
	["Ride to the lake south of the {area:2277}, north-west of {area:2268}."] = "騎到{area:2277}南邊、{area:2268}西北方的湖。",
	["Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls (50) roam the fields just north of the camp.\nCareful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled."] = "{npc:1783}和{npc:1791}（50級）在營地北邊不遠的田野遊蕩。\n小心：這些不死生物很遠就會發現你，拉一隻時附近的其他不死生物也會加入。",
	["Small lockboxes lie in the rubble all over Andorhal; each holds a watch.\nCareful: Ghouls and skeletons usually stand next to the boxes and attack when you come close. Searing ghouls also hurt anyone nearby and will break stealth."] = "安多哈爾到處的瓦礫裡都有小鎖箱；每個裡面都有一只懷錶。\n小心：箱子旁邊通常站著食屍鬼和骷髏，你一靠近就會攻擊。灼熱食屍鬼也會傷到附近的人，還會打破潛行。",
	["Take the boat to Theramore: {zone:2482}, the next guide, starts with the flight to {area:2255}."] = "搭船去塞拉摩：下一份指南{zone:2482}一開始就是飛往{area:2255}。",
	["The Diseased Grizzlies (55-56) roam the woods around the {area:202}, east and north of {npc:10739}."] = "生病的灰熊（55-56級）在{area:202}周圍、{npc:10739}東邊和北邊的樹林裡遊蕩。",
	["The agents' remains lie at the {area:2260} in the {zone:1423}, on this guide's ride east"] = "特務的遺骸在{zone:1423}的{area:2260}，本指南往東騎的時候",
	["The cauldron is at {area:200}"] = "大鍋在{area:200}",
	["The cauldron sits at the {area:202}, by {npc:10739}' farm, east of Andorhal."] = "大鍋在安多哈爾東邊{area:202}、{npc:10739}的農場旁。",
	["The libram is inside {area:190} among elite Scarlet guards, and {item:12955} among Haunting Visions at {area:201}: a group quest."] = "經文在{area:190}裡、精英血色守衛之間，{item:12955}在{area:201}的{npc:4472}之間：組隊任務。",
	["The ruins of {area:2262} lie south of the road. {npc:10926}'s ghost plays by the ruined house at the south end."] = "{area:2262}的廢墟在道路南邊。{npc:10926}的鬼魂在南端那間毀壞的房子旁玩耍。",
	["The shield lies east of the barn at {area:201}. Take your group around the barn to reach it."] = "盾牌在{area:201}穀倉的東邊。跟隊伍一起繞過穀倉去拿。",
	["The skeletons of Andorhal, next on this guide"] = "安多哈爾的骷髏，本指南接下來就去",
	["Use the {item:12815} at the foot of each of the four watchtowers around the edge of Andorhal, north of the camp, on the way to {area:199}.\nCareful: Skeletal Warlords and Flesh Golems (57, elites) walk Andorhal's streets, and the {npc:7572} (59, elite) wanders between Andorhal and Northridge: keep to the towers at the town's edge and let them pass."] = "在營地北邊、往{area:199}的路上，對安多哈爾外圍四座瞭望塔的塔腳各使用一次{item:12815}。\n小心：{npc:1788}和{npc:1805}（57級，精英）在安多哈爾的街上走動，{npc:7572}（59級，精英）在安多哈爾和北谷之間遊蕩：待在城鎮邊緣的塔旁，讓他們過去。",
	["West across the zone to {npc:1855}'s hut on the way back to {area:3197}."] = "往西穿過整個地區到{npc:1855}的小屋，順路回{area:3197}。",
	["West into the middle of the zone: Marduk's sword lies in the {area:2623} and Horgus' skull at {area:2624}, north of it, each where ghosts fight; grown Plaguehounds hunt the plains between."] = "往西到地區中部：馬杜克的劍在{area:2623}，霍古斯的頭骨在它北邊的{area:2624}，兩處都有鬼魂在打鬥；兩地之間的平原有成年的{npc:8597}在獵食。",
	["West of Andorhal to {area:199}: {npc:11075} (53) guards the cauldron among the Jabbering Ghouls (54).\n{npc:10778}'s ghost wanders by the farmhouse at the field's edge, upstairs; her parcel lies inside the house: take it for {zone:1453}, at the end of this guide."] = "往安多哈爾西邊到{area:199}：{npc:11075}（53級）在{npc:10801}（54級）之間守著大鍋。\n{npc:10778}的鬼魂在田地邊緣農舍的樓上徘徊；她的包裹在屋子裡：拿著，本指南最後去{zone:1453}時交。",
	["West through the {area:2277} to {area:2627}: fill the {item:15042} at the big termite mounds, and kill the Frenzied Plaguehounds and the Carrion Devourers on the way.\nCareful: the Frenzied Plaguehounds are 57-58: pull them one at a time."] = "往西穿過{area:2277}到{area:2627}：在大白蟻丘裝滿{item:15042}，沿路打{npc:8598}和{npc:8605}。\n小心：{npc:8598}是57-58級：一次拉一隻。",
	["Without the flight to {zone:1453} at 56 earlier in this guide: {npc:10778}'s parcel goes to {npc:10782} in the {object:2096}, then {npc:3520} takes her own errand on the canals. {npc:14722} takes sixty Silk, sixty Mageweave and sixty {item:14047}: hand in what you carry (or buy at the Auction House), skip the rest."] = "本指南前面56級時沒飛去{zone:1453}的話：{npc:10778}的包裹交給{object:2096}的{npc:10782}，然後{npc:3520}在運河邊有她自己的任務。{npc:14722}收六十份絲綢、六十份魔紋布和六十份{item:14047}：身上有多少交多少（或從拍賣場買），其餘的跳過。",
	["Without the {zone:1428} guide's {area:3197} quests: {npc:10838} stands in the middle of the camp. His {quest:5092} opens the camp's chain."] = "沒做{zone:1428}指南的{area:3197}任務的話：{npc:10838}站在營地中間。他的{quest:5092}開啟營地的任務鏈。",
	["Without the {zone:1428} guide's {area:3197} quests: {npc:10877} walks the ring of {zone:1455} and sends you to {npc:10838}, whose camp this guide visits next. Chillwind's chain starts with it."] = "沒做{zone:1428}指南的{area:3197}任務的話：{npc:10877}在{zone:1455}的環狀大道上走，他會叫你去找{npc:10838}，本指南接下來就去他的營地。寒風營地的任務鏈從這裡開始。",
	["{area:199}'s cauldron, later in this guide"] = "{area:199}的大鍋，本指南稍後",
	["{area:201}'s cauldron, on this guide's ride north-east"] = "{area:201}的大鍋，本指南往東北騎的時候",
	["{area:3197}: the cauldrons"] = "{area:3197}：大鍋",
	["{item:14613}, from {npc:11886} (57, elite)"] = "{item:14613}，{npc:11886}（57級，精英）掉落",
	["{npc:10667} in Andorhal, later on this loop: keep it"] = "安多哈爾的{npc:10667}，這一圈稍後：先留著",
	["{npc:10739} stands by the farm at the {area:202}, north of {npc:10927}."] = "{npc:10739}站在{area:202}的農場旁，在{npc:10927}北邊。",
	["{npc:10739}' next task goes to the druids of {zone:1457}, behind the route now: skip it."] = "{npc:10739}的下一個任務要去找{zone:1457}的德魯伊，已經在路線後面了：跳過。",
	["{npc:10778}, upstairs in the farmhouse"] = "{npc:10778}，在農舍樓上",
	["{npc:10838} (from level 55)"] = "{npc:10838}（55級起）",
	["{npc:10838}: the watchtowers stand around Andorhal, on the way to {area:199}"] = "{npc:10838}：瞭望塔在安多哈爾周圍，往{area:199}的路上",
	["{npc:10878} stands by the Temple of the Moon."] = "{npc:10878}站在月神殿旁。",
	["{npc:11038}'s {npc:12250} is a group quest in the {area:2261} (a level 54 elite)."] = "{npc:11038}的{npc:12250}是{area:2261}裡的組隊任務（54級精英）。",
	["{npc:11038}, by the graves south of the chapel: {npc:11140} is in {area:2627}, at the end of this ride: keep it"] = "{npc:11038}，在禮拜堂南邊的墓地旁：{npc:11140}在{area:2627}，這一趟最後才到：先留著",
	["{npc:11063} at {area:2268}, on this guide's second ride east: keep it"] = "{area:2268}的{npc:11063}，在本指南第二次往東騎時：先留著",
	["{npc:11613} (56) walks the Northridge camp east of {npc:11610}; {npc:11611} (57) guards the tower at {area:190}'s southern approach.\nCareful: Guards stand at the tower's base and one more circles it on patrol. Clear them before you engage Durgen so they don't join the fight."] = "{npc:11613}（56級）在{npc:11610}東邊的北谷營地走動；{npc:11611}（57級）守著{area:190}南邊入口的塔。\n小心：塔腳有守衛站崗，還有一個繞著塔巡邏。打杜爾根之前先清掉他們，免得他們加入戰鬥。",
	["{npc:11616}: the termites come later, in the {area:2277}"] = "{npc:11616}：白蟻之後才在{area:2277}拿",
	["{npc:12384} lives in the ruined hut in {area:2627}, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby. {npc:11140} stands by {npc:12384}' hut."] = "{npc:12384}住在{area:2627}那間毀壞的小屋裡，他的收據簿在附近毀壞的旅店裡。{npc:11140}站在{npc:12384}的小屋旁。",
	["{npc:13841} camps beside the road north to {area:3197}."] = "{npc:13841}在往北通往{area:3197}的路旁紮營。",
	["{npc:13843}: for {npc:13841}, on the way to {area:3197}"] = "{npc:13843}：給{npc:13841}，在往{area:3197}的路上",
	["{npc:14724} and {npc:14723} each take sixty Wool, sixty Silk and sixty Mageweave, then sixty {item:14047}: hand in what you carry (or buy at the Auction House), skip the rest."] = "{npc:14724}和{npc:14723}各收六十份毛料、六十份絲綢、六十份魔紋布，再收六十份{item:14047}：身上有多少交多少（或從拍賣場買），其餘的跳過。",
	["{npc:15187}, by the flight master where you land: for {npc:15191} in {zone:1451}, on the last guide; keep it"] = "{npc:15187}，在你降落處的飛行管理員旁：給最後一份指南{zone:1451}的{npc:15191}；先留著",
	["{npc:1748}, in {object:2117}"] = "{npc:1748}，在{object:2117}",
	["{npc:3516}, upstairs"] = "{npc:3516}，在樓上",
	["{npc:7916}' next task sends you back to Ranshalla in {zone:1452}, behind the route now: skip it."] = "{npc:7916}的下一個任務要你回{zone:1452}找蘭莎爾拉，已經在路線後面了：跳過。",
	["{npc:9616}' next task fills his jars in Un'Goro, behind the route now: skip it."] = "{npc:9616}的下一個任務要去安戈洛裝滿他的罐子，已經在路線後面了：跳過。",
	["{quest:5152}, back in the {zone:1422}: keep it"] = "{quest:5152}，回{zone:1422}時交：先留著",
	["{quest:5781} is a group quest: {npc:11886} (57, elite) and his adds in the {area:2261}."] = "{quest:5781}是組隊任務：{area:2261}裡的{npc:11886}（57級，精英）和他的小怪。",
	["{quest:5845}'s symbol lies in the lake south of the {area:2277}: your group fetches it before the ride back to {area:3197}."] = "{quest:5845}的徽記在{area:2277}南邊的湖裡：騎回{area:3197}之前，跟隊伍一起去拿。",
	["{quest:6184} at {area:3197}, on the flight back"] = "{area:3197}的{quest:6184}，飛回來時交",
	["{quest:6762} in {zone:1450}: {zone:2482}'s {zone:1450} errand takes you to her, in the next guide; keep it"] = "{zone:1450}的{quest:6762}：下一份指南裡，{zone:2482}去{zone:1450}的任務會帶你去找她；先留著",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus"] = {
	["Back from {zone:2482} in {area:2255}: {npc:11118}'s mail went astray in the hills east of town, where the Ice Thistle yetis carry it off."] = "從{zone:2482}回到{area:2255}：{npc:11118}的郵件在城鎮東邊的山丘弄丟了，被冰薊雪人拿走。",
	["Back to {area:3425}. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "回到{area:3425}。{npc:15189}站在他那棟建築的樓上：從裡面走上去，箭頭分不清樓層。",
	["Careful: the Twilight Keepers are level 60: clear the cultists around each one first and fight the keeper at full health.\n{npc:11803} holds the cultists' camp in the far south-west."] = "小心：暮光守護者是60級：先清掉每一位周圍的教徒，滿血再打守護者。\n{npc:11803}佔據遙遠西南方的教徒營地。",
	["Dredge Strikers dig in the dunes north-west of the hold; Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers roam all around.\nCareful: {npc:15185} (62, elite) guard the Caverns of Time's mouth in the south-west, around 21,82: stay out of there."] = "{npc:11740}在要塞西北的沙丘裡挖洞；{npc:11735}和{npc:11738}到處遊蕩。\n小心：{npc:15185}（62級，精英）守著西南方約21,82的時光之穴入口：別去那裡。",
	["Fly to {area:541} in {zone:1449}, the way into {zone:1451}."] = "飛到{zone:1449}的{area:541}，那是進入{zone:1451}的路。",
	["From a {area:2742} silithid: for {npc:15170} at Bronzebeard's Encampment"] = "{area:2742}的異種蟲掉的：給銅鬚營地的{npc:15170}",
	["Maethrya, the Alliance flight master"] = "麥瑟蕾亞，聯盟的飛行管理員",
	["Ride north-east to {npc:13220} at {area:3077}."] = "往東北騎到{area:3077}找{npc:13220}。",
	["Ride west from {area:541} to the crater's north-western pass into {zone:1451}."] = "從{area:541}往西騎到環形山西北邊進入{zone:1451}的山口。",
	["The Ice Thistle yetis (53-57) in the hills east of {area:2255} carry the {item:258323}: take it from the ones at the edge of the hills."] = "{area:2255}東邊山丘上的冰薊雪人（53-57級）身上有{item:258323}：從山丘邊緣的雪人身上拿。",
	["The Twilight's Hammer dig fills the north-west corner: tablet fragments lie on the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an {item:20404}: keep twenty, ten for {npc:15306} and ten for {npc:15194} later.\nCareful: take the texts from the Twilight Avengers and Geolords; leave the Twilight Flamereavers (60) and stay out of the hive's mouth, where the {area:2742} elites (59-60) wait.\nThe {area:2742} silithids sometimes drop {quest:8308}: keep it for Bronzebeard's Encampment in the south."] = "暮光之錘的挖掘場佔滿西北角：石板碎片散落在地上，{npc:11744}和{npc:11746}身上也有。每個教徒都可能掉{item:20404}：留二十份，十份給{npc:15306}、十份之後給{npc:15194}。\n小心：從{npc:11880}和暮光地領主身上拿文件；別碰{npc:15201}（60級），也別進蜂巢入口，那裡有{area:2742}的精英（59-60級）。\n{area:2742}的異種蟲有時會掉{quest:8308}：留著給南邊的銅鬚營地。",
	["The tortured druids and sentinels haunt the ruined village east of the hold."] = "受折磨的德魯伊和哨兵在要塞東邊那座毀壞的村莊遊蕩。",
	["{area:3425}'s last hand-ins can leave a player who followed only this route short of 60 (up to about a level for the slowest; most players less).\nWith a group: run the {area:2057} dungeon or the {area:2279} dungeon, in the Plaguelands by {area:3197} and {area:2268}.\nAlone: the Twilight's Hammer camps of {zone:1451}'s north-west (Twilight Avengers 57-59 and Geolords 58-60; leave the Flamereavers, 60) and the Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers (57-59) around {area:3425} are at your level. {area:3425}'s repeatable quests open only at 60."] = "只走這條路線的玩家，交完{area:3425}最後的任務可能還差一點才到60級（最慢的大約差一級；大多數人差得少）。\n有隊伍的話：去打{area:2057}地城或{area:2279}地城，在瘟疫之地的{area:3197}和{area:2268}旁邊。\n一個人的話：{zone:1451}西北的暮光之錘營地（{npc:11880}57-59級、暮光地領主58-60級；別碰60級的烈焰搶奪者），以及{area:3425}周圍的{npc:11737}和{npc:11739}（57-59級）都適合你的等級。{area:3425}的可重複任務要60級才會開放。",
	["{npc:13220} stands at {area:3077}, where the pass comes out."] = "{npc:13220}站在山口出口的{area:3077}。",
	["{npc:13220}'s next task goes to {zone:1450}: skip it."] = "{npc:13220}的下一個任務要去{zone:1450}：跳過。",
	["{npc:15181} (from level 58): Bronzebeard's Encampment comes later, on the way south"] = "{npc:15181}（58級起）：銅鬚營地之後往南的路上才去",
	["{npc:15306}: his Twilight texts come from the dig"] = "{npc:15306}：他要的暮光文件來自挖掘場",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh"] = {
	["East through the South Gate tunnel into {area:38}. {npc:1089} and {npc:1092} stand at the dwarven post just past it."] = "往東穿過南門隧道進入{area:38}。{npc:1089}和{npc:1092}站在隧道出口不遠的矮人哨站。",
	["Follow the road back to {area:1537} if you left the city. {npc:6175} walks through the Commons."] = "如果你出了城，沿道路回{area:1537}。{npc:6175}在大廳裡走動。",
	["Follow the road north-east from {area:131} to the depot: the whole east of {area:1} is one sweep from here."] = "從{area:131}沿道路往東北到補給站：{area:1}東部從這裡一趟走完。",
	["From the tram to {area:1519}"] = "從地鐵到{area:1519}",
	["Go through the tunnel into {area:38}. Just past it, a path marked by stones climbs the hills on the right of the road north to {npc:257808}'s camp."] = "穿過隧道進入{area:38}。剛出隧道，道路右邊有一條用石頭標示的小路爬上丘陵，往北通到{npc:257808}的營地。",
	["If you're short on cloth, leave {zone:1455} through the Commons and follow the road down the mountain, then east to {area:134}. Kill Rockjaw Skullthumpers on the quarry's western edge. If the missing cloth is affordable at the Auction House, you can buy it instead."] = "布不夠的話，從大廳離開{zone:1455}，沿道路下山，再往東到{area:134}。在採掘場西緣打{npc:1115}。缺的布在拍賣場不貴的話，也可以用買的。",
	["Keep ten {item:2589} for {npc:6175} in {zone:1455}. Finish your stack here on the same Stonesplinter Troggs and Scouts; stay in the north camps."] = "留十份{item:2589}給{zone:1455}的{npc:6175}。在這裡同一批{npc:1161}和碎石斥候身上把它收齊；待在北邊的營地。",
	["Linen for {npc:6175}"] = "給{npc:6175}的亞麻布",
	["Linen for {quest:1648}"] = "給{quest:1648}的亞麻布",
	["North of the post, west of the road: the Stonesplinter troggs and scouts camp in the hills. Both drop the Trogg Stone Teeth.\nCareful: pull the Stonesplinter Scouts and Troggs one at a time. Stay at the north edge of the valley; Headsplitter patrols the deeper camps."] = "哨站北邊、道路西邊：碎石穴居人和碎石斥候在丘陵上紮營。兩種都會掉穴居人石牙。\n小心：{npc:1162}和穴居人一次拉一隻。待在山谷北緣；碎顱者在更深的營地巡邏。",
	["On the {zone:1455} platform of the {area:2257}, {npc:12997} asks for help with the rats: use his {item:17117} on the Deeprun Rats around the platform, hand them in, then take his letter to his brother {npc:13018} at the {zone:1453} end. The tram has no map inside. The city markers show the entrances, not the two brothers."] = "在{area:2257}的{zone:1455}月台，{npc:12997}請你幫忙抓老鼠：對月台周圍的{npc:13016}使用他的{item:17117}，交回給他，然後把他的信帶到{zone:1453}那一頭給他的兄弟{npc:13018}。地鐵裡面沒有地圖。城裡的標記指的是入口，不是兩兄弟。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:1388} is a level 12 elite: take him on with a group. Alone, skip it: the {area:38} quests ahead make up the experience."] = "這些是精英怪：建議組隊，找人和你一起做。{npc:1388}是12級精英：跟隊伍一起打。一個人就跳過：前面{area:38}的任務會把經驗補回來。",
	["West from the {object:32383} into the {object:32362}: {npc:5149}, {npc:6179} and {npc:6178} are in the {object:32386}, {npc:6179} and {npc:6178} on its upper floor: the stairs up start just north-east of {npc:5149}. {npc:6175}, a beggar, wanders the city. John needs ten {item:2589}. Bring what you have; if you’re short, Rockjaw Skullthumpers at Gol’Bolar Quarry drop it."] = "從{object:32383}往西進入{object:32362}：{npc:5149}、{npc:6179}和{npc:6178}在{object:32386}，{npc:6179}和{npc:6178}在它的樓上：上樓的樓梯就在{npc:5149}東北方不遠。乞丐{npc:6175}在城裡到處走。約翰要十份{item:2589}。有多少帶多少；不夠的話，古博拉採掘場的{npc:1115}會掉。",
	["{area:135} is the troll cave in the hills south-west of {area:137}. Kill Headhunters at its mouth, then walk through the cave to its far end: Fully explore {area:135} ticks only in there, not on the hill above it.\nCareful: the Frostmane Hideskinners inside the Hold are level 9-10 and stand in pairs: pull them one at a time back to the mouth."] = "{area:135}是{area:137}西南方丘陵裡的食人妖洞穴。在洞口殺獵頭者，然後穿過洞穴走到最裡面：「完整探索{area:135}」只有在裡面才會打勾，在它上方的山丘不算。\n小心：要塞裡的{npc:1122}是9-10級、兩兩站在一起：一次一隻拉回洞口。",
	["{area:1}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1}：遇到就殺",
	["{npc:5505} in {zone:1453}; {area:1} has no druid trainer"] = "{zone:1453}的{npc:5505}；{area:1}沒有德魯伊訓練師",
	["{npc:6179} and {npc:6178}"] = "{npc:6179}和{npc:6178}",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh"] = {
	["East through the South Gate tunnel into {area:38}. {npc:1089} and {npc:1092} stand at the dwarven post just past it."] = "往東穿過南門隧道進入{area:38}。{npc:1089}和{npc:1092}站在隧道出口不遠的矮人哨站。",
	["From the tram to {area:1519}"] = "從地鐵到{area:1519}",
	["Go through the tunnel into {area:38}. Just past it, a path marked by stones climbs the hills on the right of the road north to {npc:257808}'s camp."] = "穿過隧道進入{area:38}。剛出隧道，道路右邊有一條用石頭標示的小路爬上丘陵，往北通到{npc:257808}的營地。",
	["North of the post, west of the road: the Stonesplinter troggs and scouts camp in the hills. Both drop the Trogg Stone Teeth.\nCareful: pull the Stonesplinter Scouts and Troggs one at a time. Stay at the north edge of the valley; Headsplitter patrols the deeper camps."] = "哨站北邊、道路西邊：碎石穴居人和碎石斥候在丘陵上紮營。兩種都會掉穴居人石牙。\n小心：{npc:1162}和穴居人一次拉一隻。待在山谷北緣；碎顱者在更深的營地巡邏。",
	["On the {zone:1455} platform of the {area:2257}, {npc:12997} asks for help with the rats: use his {item:17117} on the Deeprun Rats around the platform, hand them in, then take his letter to his brother {npc:13018} at the {zone:1453} end. The tram has no map inside. The city markers show the entrances, not the two brothers."] = "在{area:2257}的{zone:1455}月台，{npc:12997}請你幫忙抓老鼠：對月台周圍的{npc:13016}使用他的{item:17117}，交回給他，然後把他的信帶到{zone:1453}那一頭給他的兄弟{npc:13018}。地鐵裡面沒有地圖。城裡的標記指的是入口，不是兩兄弟。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:1388} is a level 12 elite: take him on with a group. Alone, skip it: the {area:38} quests ahead make up the experience."] = "這些是精英怪：建議組隊，找人和你一起做。{npc:1388}是12級精英：跟隊伍一起打。一個人就跳過：前面{area:38}的任務會把經驗補回來。",
	["{area:135} is the troll cave in the hills south-west of {area:137}. Kill Headhunters at its mouth, then walk through the cave to its far end: Fully explore {area:135} ticks only in there, not on the hill above it.\nCareful: the Frostmane Hideskinners inside the Hold are level 9-10 and stand in pairs: pull them one at a time back to the mouth."] = "{area:135}是{area:137}西南方丘陵裡的食人妖洞穴。在洞口殺獵頭者，然後穿過洞穴走到最裡面：「完整探索{area:135}」只有在裡面才會打勾，在它上方的山丘不算。\n小心：要塞裡的{npc:1122}是9-10級、兩兩站在一起：一次一隻拉回洞口。",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil"] = {
	["Back to {area:442}"] = "回{area:442}",
	["East from the city gate to {area:736}"] = "從城門往東到{area:736}",
	["Follow the road west into {area:1657} and use the {item:279378} at the inn on the {area:1659} and at the tunnel mouth below {area:3425} for the last two owls. {npc:4241} stands on the {area:1659} just inside the city. {npc:3516} is in the {area:1658} at the north end of the city, {quest:922} just south of it; {npc:4092}, {npc:7999}, {npc:7313} and {npc:8396} are in the Temple of the Moon at the south end."] = "沿道路往西進{area:1657}，在{area:1659}的旅店和{area:3425}下方的隧道口各使用一次{item:279378}，完成最後兩隻貓頭鷹。{npc:4241}站在剛進城的{area:1659}。{npc:3516}在城市北端的{area:1658}，{quest:922}在它南邊不遠；{npc:4092}、{npc:7999}、{npc:7313}和{npc:8396}在南端的月神殿裡。",
	["Into {area:1657}"] = "進入{area:1657}",
	["Nightsabers, Strigid Owls and Webwood Lurkers roam all around {area:186} and along the road east; the lurkers also drop the recipe's spider legs. The moonwell is at the west edge of {area:260}.\nCareful: the Befouled Webwoods (10-11) in the woods north-west of {area:186}, around 47-52,34-56, are over you now: take the silk from the Webwood Lurkers and leave the webwoods for {npc:3567}'s quest later. Duskstalker (9, a rare nightsaber) and Oakenscowl (9, elite) roam the woods south of {area:186}, around 54-62,73-77: leave them be."] = "夜刃豹、{npc:1995}和{npc:1998}在{area:186}周圍和往東的道路沿途遊蕩；潛伏者也會掉食譜要的蜘蛛腿。月井在{area:260}的西緣。\n小心：{area:186}西北方樹林約47-52,34-56的{npc:272096}（10-11級）現在比你高：從{npc:1998}身上拿蛛絲，污染的蛛網林留給之後{npc:3567}的任務。暮色潛獵者（9級，稀有夜刃豹）和橡木怒容（9級，精英）在{area:186}南邊約54-62,73-77的樹林遊蕩：別惹他們。",
	["Take the portal down from {zone:1457} to the hippogryphs."] = "從{zone:1457}搭傳送門下去找角鷹獸。",
	["Take the portal down to the hippogryphs at {area:702}."] = "搭傳送門下到{area:702}的角鷹獸那裡。",
	["{quest:983}: Thresher Eyes, on the {zone:1439} guide's first beach stop"] = "{quest:983}：{item:5412}，在{zone:1439}指南第一次停沙灘時",
}

P.guides["forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore"] = {
	["Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of {area:442}; Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills around it.\nCareful: the Windtalkers (13-14) cast from range and the furbolgs stand in pairs: pull them one at a time."] = "{npc:2167}和黑木風語者佔據{area:442}東南方的營地；{npc:2164}在周圍的丘陵遊蕩。\n小心：風語者（13-14級）會遠程施法，熊怪兩兩站在一起：一次拉一隻。",
	["Careful: {npc:3667} (16) is over you: pull her on her own at full health. {npc:2184}, a rare (17), also walks the ruins: leave her be."] = "小心：{npc:3667}（16級）比你高：滿血時單獨拉她。稀有的{npc:2184}（17級）也在廢墟裡走動：別惹她。",
	["Darkshore Threshers"] = "{npc:2185}",
	["From level 15 {npc:3649} also has {quest:4763}: its samples come from the northern Blackwood camp on your next {zone:1439} visit. Fill its bowl at the moonwell in the middle of the village now."] = "15級起{npc:3649}還有{quest:4763}：樣本在你下次來{zone:1439}時北邊的黑木營地拿。現在先在村子中間的月井把碗裝滿。",
	["From the beached creature, head east to the {quest:952}. Watch for level 16 bears and level 17 Moonstalker Sires between the beach and the grove; go around them. {npc:3616} stands beside Arbal and the sleeping {npc:11218}."] = "從擱淺的生物那裡往東到{quest:952}。沙灘和古樹林之間有16級的熊和17級的{npc:2237}：繞過去。{npc:3616}站在阿爾巴和沉睡的{npc:11218}旁邊。",
	["Moonstalker Fangs: the Moonstalkers around the river"] = "{item:5413}：河邊的月夜潛獵者",
	["Moonstalkers on the way"] = "順路打月夜潛獵者",
	["North along the hills to {npc:3650}, then on north-east to the {area:456}."] = "沿丘陵往北找{npc:3650}，再往東北到{area:456}。",
	["North along the hills. {npc:3650} waits in the ruins of {quest:954}; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. {quest:1001} stands by the road north-north-west of {npc:3650}; a {quest:4723} lies on the shore on the way to him."] = "沿丘陵往北。{npc:3650}在{quest:954}的廢墟裡等你；{npc:2190}和{npc:2189}佈滿廢墟，{npc:2212}在東緣。{quest:1001}在{npc:3650}北北西方的路旁；去找他的路上，海岸有一隻{quest:4723}。",
	["North-east up the {area:456} to the falls: fill the sampler at the water there. Moonstalkers (14-15) roam the hills around the river.\nCareful: Encrusted Tide Crawlers (17-20) line the shore below the falls and the {npc:6788}'s bears (18-19) lair in the hills south of them: keep to the river."] = "沿{area:456}往東北到瀑布：在那裡的水邊裝滿取樣器。月夜潛獵者（14-15級）在河邊的丘陵遊蕩。\n小心：{npc:2233}（17-20級）排在瀑布下方的岸邊，{npc:6788}的熊（18-19級）在牠們南邊的丘陵築巢：沿著河走。",
	["North-north-west of Asterion by the road, past the {quest:4723}: {quest:1001} wants Moonstalker Fangs next, from the second loop's hills. Then south-west down to {area:442}."] = "在阿斯特利安北北西方的路旁，經過{quest:4723}：{quest:1001}接下來要{item:5413}，在第二圈的丘陵上拿。然後往西南下到{area:442}。",
	["Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills south of {area:442}: use {quest:2139} on one to capture it. Then walk up to the furbolg camp just east of them: nothing to kill yet."] = "{npc:2164}在{area:442}南邊的丘陵遊蕩：對其中一隻使用{quest:2139}把牠抓起來。然後走到牠們東邊不遠的熊怪營地：還不用殺任何東西。",
	["The Moonstalkers (14-15) roam the hills of the loop ahead, south of {area:442} and around the {area:456} at its end: any of them drops the fangs. Leave the Moonstalker Sires (17-18) and Matriarchs (19-20) south of the Grove."] = "月夜潛獵者（14-15級）在接下來那一圈的丘陵遊蕩，在{area:442}南邊和那一圈最後的{area:456}周圍：任何一隻都會掉牙。古樹林南邊的{npc:2237}（17-18級）和月夜潛獵者女族長（19-20級）別打。",
	["West along the north shore: the {quest:4725} lies on the beach north of {quest:954}, among Reef Crawlers and Greymist Warriors (15). Then south-west down to {area:442}."] = "沿北岸往西：{quest:4725}在{quest:954}北邊的沙灘上，周圍是{npc:2235}和{npc:2205}（15級）。然後往西南下到{area:442}。",
	["{item:5382}: {npc:3667}'s ghost walks the ruins"] = "{item:5382}：{npc:3667}的鬼魂在廢墟裡走動",
	["{npc:1646} stands in {object:2098}, west of the {object:2096}: his compass is in his old house in {zone:1436}, on the way. His reply to {npc:3649} goes back to {area:442} with you."] = "{npc:1646}站在{object:2096}西邊的{object:2098}：他的羅盤在{zone:1436}他的老房子裡，順路。他給{npc:3649}的回信由你帶回{area:442}。",
	["{npc:1646}: {npc:3649}'s letter"] = "{npc:1646}：{npc:3649}的信",
	["{npc:1646}: {quest:97926}, for {npc:3649} on your next {zone:1439} visit"] = "{npc:1646}：{quest:97926}，給你下次來{zone:1439}時的{npc:3649}",
	["{npc:3583}: the cave by the {area:445}, on your next {zone:1439} visit"] = "{npc:3583}：{area:445}旁的洞穴，你下次來{zone:1439}時",
	["{npc:3644} waits where the pier meets the shore, on the way to the boat."] = "{npc:3644}在碼頭接到岸邊的地方等你，就在去搭船的路上。",
	["{npc:3644} waits where the pier meets the shore. {npc:3667} (16), whose pendant he wants, walks {area:447} on the loop ahead: from level 14.5 you take it there, else on your next {zone:1439} visit."] = "{npc:3644}在碼頭接到岸邊的地方等你。他要的墜飾在{npc:3667}（16級）身上，她在接下來那一圈的{area:447}走動：14.5級起就在那裡拿，不然留到下次來{zone:1439}時。",
	["{npc:3649}: for {npc:1646} in {zone:1453}, on the walk from the boat"] = "{npc:3649}：給{zone:1453}的{npc:1646}，下船後走過去的路上",
	["{npc:3649}: his sample comes from the {area:445}, at the end of the next loop"] = "{npc:3649}：他要的樣本來自下一圈最後的{area:445}",
	["{npc:3657}, beside {npc:3693}: for Balthule at the {area:444}, on your next {zone:1439} visit"] = "{npc:3657}，在{npc:3693}旁邊：給{area:444}的巴蘇爾，你下次來{zone:1439}時",
	["{npc:3693}: for {npc:3649}, at the north end of the village"] = "{npc:3693}：給村子北端的{npc:3649}",
	["{npc:3701}: the bears are on the loop ahead"] = "{npc:3701}：熊在接下來那一圈",
	["{npc:3701}: the {npc:6788}, on your next {zone:1439} visit"] = "{npc:3701}：{npc:6788}，你下次來{zone:1439}時",
	["{npc:6301}, on the way north: the bay wrecks, on your next {zone:1439} visit"] = "{npc:6301}，往北的路上：海灣的沉船，你下次來{zone:1439}時",
	["{quest:1002} stands on the hill above the falls. He offers {object:17185} next: its bears are far south, for your next {zone:1439} visit."] = "{quest:1002}站在瀑布上方的山丘上。他接下來給{object:17185}：要打的熊在很南邊，留到你下次來{zone:1439}時。",
	["{quest:983} stands on the beach just south of the docks: once his crawler legs are in, he asks for Thresher Eyes. The Darkshore Threshers (12-14) swim in the shallows off the docks and up the shore to {area:452}; {quest:1001}, who takes the eyes, stands north of {quest:954} at the end of the first loop."] = "{quest:983}站在碼頭南邊不遠的沙灘上：交完爬行者的腿後，他會要{item:5412}。{npc:2185}（12-14級）在碼頭外的淺水裡，一直到沿岸往北的{area:452}都有；收眼睛的{quest:1001}站在第一圈最後{quest:954}的北邊。",
}

